<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Medhetetha Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Medhetetha Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Medhe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Medhetethi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Medhetetha Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Medhetetha maxaafay, salo sa7a medhetethi, asa medhetethi, eko geloba, nagaraba, doona buqetethabanne Isra7eele asa doomethi odees. Medhetetha Maxaafay nam7u ayfe kifiletan shaaketees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Shempo 1—11 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Addaamepe Abrahaame gakanaw de7iya asa zeretha doometha taarike qoncisees. Ha kifiliyan, salo sa7a medhetethi, asa medhetethi (Shem 1—2). Addaamenne Hewaanni kiitetetha ixo, nagara gaason baadethinne hayqoy asa koche ubba bolla yuussaa (Shem 3). Qaayelanne Aabela taarikenne asa yeletethi (Shem 4—5). Nohe ammanetethi, asa iitatethinne dhayo haathi (Shem 6—10). Babiloone gimbe, doona buqetethinne asa laaletethi (Shem 11) bessiya taarike paadidi odees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Shempo 12—50 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Isra7eele koyro aawata taarike odees; enta giddofe Xoossas kiitetethan eretida Abrahaame dooretetha, kaallidi iya na7a Yisaaqa, iya na7a na7a gidida Yayqoobanne tammanne nam7u Yayqooba nayta taarike qoncisees. Ha tammanne nam7u Yayqooba nayti, tammanne nam7u Isra7eele kochaas doomethi gidida mayzata. Ha tammanne nam7u Isra7eele nayta giddofe Yoosefa taarikey ha maxaafan daro odetida taarike.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafay, asa zeretha taarike odiyaba gidikoka ubbaafe aathidi Xoossi oothida iya gita oosuwa paadidi bessees. I ba asaas immida ufaysa qaalay, Xoossay ba asaas merinaw qopeysa bessees. Maxaafay gaxape gaxa gakanaw nagara pirdey, ba asaa kaalethey, enta maaddeynne enta taarikiya giigisey Xoosse gideysa bessees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Medhetetha taarike <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 1:1-2:3">1:1—2:3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Addaamenne Hewaanno <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 2:4-25">2:4-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nagari alame geluwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 3:1-24">3:1-24</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nagari alamen daayethaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 4:1-6:8">4:1—6:8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nohenne dhayo haatha taarike <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 6:9-9:29">6:9—9:29</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Babiloone gimbiyanne asa laaletethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 11:1-9">11:1-9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Seema yeletetha susaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 11:10-32">11:10-32</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Abrahaame xeegetethanne duussaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 12:1-25:11">12:1—25:11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isma7eela yeletetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-18">25:12-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yayqooba yeletetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 25:19-35:29">25:19—35:29</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Eesawe yeletetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 36:1-43">36:1-43</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yoosefanne iya ishata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 37:1-45:28">37:1—45:28</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eele asay Gibxe biittan <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GEN 46:1-50:26">46:1—50:26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Medhetethaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>Xoossay koyro salotanne sa7a medhis. <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>He wode sa7i giigonanne aybika bayna mela de7ees. Dhumi biitta ma77ida wolqaama haathata bolla de7ees. Xoossa Ayyaanay haathaafe bollara qaaxees.<verse eid="GEN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “Poo7oy hano” yaagin, poo7oy hanis. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Poo7oy lo77o gididaysa Xoossay be7is; poo7uwa dhumape shaakis. <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>Xoossay poo7uwa, “Gallas” gidi sunthis; qassi dhumaa “Qamma” gidi sunthis. Sa7i qammis wontis; hessi koyro gallas.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “Bollara de7iya haatha garsan de7iya haathaafe shaakiya salo gufanthoy hano” yaagin hanis. <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Xoossay salo gufantho giigisidi, salo gufanthofe bollara de7iya haatha garsan de7iya haathaafe shaakis. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Xoossay he gufanthuwa, “Salo” gidi sunthis. Sa7i qammis; wontis; hessi nam7antho gallasa.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “Mela bessay qoncanaada Salope garsan de7iya haathi ubbay issi bessi shiiqo” yaagin hanis. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Xoossay he mela bessaa, “Biitta” gidi sunthis; qassi issi bessan shiiqida haatha, “Abba” gidi sunthis. Yaatidi, Xoossay hessi lo77o gididaysa be7is. <verse eid="GEN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “Biittay mithi maata doliso; zeretha ayfey de7iya kathinne zeretha ayfey giddon de7iya mithi dolo” yaagis; hessadaka hanis. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Biittay mithi maata iya qommon qommon dolisis. Xoossay hessi lo77o gididaysa be7is. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Sa7i qammis wontis; hessi heedzantho gallas.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “Gallasa qammafe shaakanaw poo7oti salon hano. Enti qamanne, gallas, wodenne laythi erisanaw malla gido. <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>Biitta bolla poo7ana mela enti salo gufanthon hano” yaagis; hessadaka hanis. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Xoossay nam7u gita poo7ota medhis. Awi gallas, ageeni qamma poo7ana mela oothis. Hessadaka Xoolintota medhis. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Xoossay enti ha sa7a bolla poo7ana mela salon wothis. <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>Hessi, gallasinne qamma haarana melanne poo7o dhumape shaakana melasa. Xoossay hessi lo77o gididaysa be7is. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Sa7i qammis wontis; hessi oyddantho gallas.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “De7oy de7iya dumma dumma medhetethati haathan daro; kafotika sa7ape bollara, salo gufanthofe garsan piradho” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Yaatidi Xoossay abban de7iya gita do7ata, haatha giddon woxi qaaxiya medhetethata ubbaanne paalliya kafota ubbaa iya qommon qommon medhis. Xoossay hessi lo77o gididaysa be7is. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Xoossay enta, “Yeletite, darite, abba kumite, kafoti biitta bolla daro” yaagidi anjis. <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Sa7i qammis wontis; hessi ichashantho gallas.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “De7oy de7iya medhetethati enta qommon qommon, meheta, sa7ara gooshetiya medhetethatanne do7ata enta qommon qommon biittay kesso” yaagin hanis. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Hessada oothidi enta ubbaa medhis. Xoossay hessi lo77o gididaysa be7is.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Hessafe simmin, Xoossay, “Ase nuna daanisidi ane medhoos. Enti abba moluwa, salo kafota, biitta bolla woxi qaaxiya medhetetha ubbaa haaro” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Hessada Xoossay ase bana daanisidi medhis. I ase Xoosse daanisidi medhis; enta addenne maccas oothidi medhis.<verse eid="GEN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Xoossay entana, “Yeletite, darite, sa7a kumite; haarite. Abba molo, salo kafotanne biitta bolla woxi qaaxiya, de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaa haarite” yaagidi anjis.<verse eid="GEN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay, “Taani biitta ubbaa bolla zeretha ayfey de7iya katha ubbaanne zeretha ayfey giddon de7iya mithi ubbaa hintew immas; hessi hintew kathi gido. <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>Qassika ha sa7an de7iya mehenne do7a ubbaas, salo kafo ubbaasinne sa7ara gooshetiya medhetetha ubbaas miyaba gidana mela, cil7o mithinne maata immas” yaagis; hessadaka hanis. <verse eid="GEN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Xoossay ba medhida ubbabaaka xeelliya wode daro lo77o gididaysa be7is. Sa7i qammis; wontis; hessi usupuntho gallas.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Salotinne sa7i entan de7iyaba ubbabay haysada medhetidi poletis. <verse eid="GEN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Xoossay ba oosuwa polidi, laapuntha gallasan shempis. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Xoossay laapuntha gallasan ba oothiya oosuwa ongidi shempida gisho he gallasaa anjis; gallasatape dummayis. <verse eid="GEN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>Salotinne sa7i hessada hani medhetis.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 2:4">Addaamenne Hewaanno</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Godaa Xoossay sa7anne salota medhida wode, <verse eid="GEN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/>sa7a bolla iri bukiboona gishonne oothiya asi bayna gisho mithinne maati dolibeenna; aaciyabayka baawa. <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>Gidoshin, sa7ape haathi pultidi, biitta ubbaa laakisees. <verse eid="GEN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Hessafe guye, Godaa Xoossay biitta baanape ase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ase: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ase geysi Ibraawetho doonan “Addaame” geetetees. “Addaame” guussay “Biitta” guussu.</char></note> medhidi iya siidhera de7o shempo punnidi gelsis. Yaatin, he addey de7ora de7iya ase gidis.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Godaa Xoossay doloha baggara Edene gannate giigisis; yan ba medhida addiya wothis. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/>Godaa Xoossay xeellanaw lo77iya, maanawuka mal7iya ubba qommo mithi biittafe dolisis. Gannate giddon de7o immiyanne lo77onne iita erisiya nam7u mithata wothis.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Gannate ushshiya shaafa haathay Edenepe goggees. He shaafay Edenepe keydi oyddu shaafu keyidi shaaketees. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Koyro shaafa sunthay Fisoone. Fisooney worqey de7iya Hawila biitta bolla goggees. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>He biitta worqey geeshsha worqa. Qassi al7o shittoynne shuchi yan de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Nam7antho shaafa sunthay Giyoone. Giyooney Tophe biitta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tophe biitta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beni Tophe biittay ha77i de7iya sudaanepenne Tophefe bagga ekees.</char></note> yuushuwan goggees. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Heedzantho shaafa sunthay Xegroosa. Xegroosi Asoorepe doloha baggara goggees. Qassi oyddantho shaafay Efraxiisa.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>Godaa Xoossay asi Edene Gannate oothana melanne naagana mela iya efidi yan wothis. <verse eid="GEN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Godaa Xoossay ase, “Gannate mitha teera ubbaafe neeni maanaw danda7aasa. <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>Shin lo77onne iita erisiya mitha ayfiyape moopa. Ayis giiko, neeni iyape mida gallas tuma hayqana” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Hessafe guye, Godaa Xoossay, “Addey barka de7eysi lo77o gidenna. Taani iya maaddana mela iyaw injetiya lagge medhana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>Godaa Xoossay meheta, do7atanne salo kafota ubbaa biittafe medhis. Yaatidi, enta woygidi sunthaneko be7anaw Addaameko ehin, Addaamey de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaa sunthida sunthay enta sunthi gididi attis. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>Hessadaka, Addaamey meheta, salo kafotanne bazzo do7ata ubbaa sunthis. Shin Addaames injetiyanne iya maaddiya laggey bentibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Hessa gisho, Godaa Xoossay Addaame wolqaama dhiskon yeggis. I dhisko hayqidashin iya miye meqethafe issuwa ekidi, he bessaa ashon kunthis. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/>Godaa Xoossay Addaamepe ekida meqetha macca oothidi medhis; yaatidi iyo iyako ehis. <verse eid="GEN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Addaamey, “Ha meqethiya ta meqethafe, ha ashshiya ta ashope eketidaro. Iya addefe eketida gisho macca<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Macca: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan Macca geysaranne adde geysara nam7ay issino. Ibraawethon “Adde” geysi “Ish” geetetees; “Macca” geysi “Isha” geetetees.</char></note> geeteto” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>Hessa gisho, asi ba aawanne ba aayiw aggidi, ba machera issife de7ees; nam7ay issi asi gidoosona. <verse eid="GEN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/>Addaameynne Hewaanna nam7ayka xire kallo de7oosona; shin issoy issuwas yeellatokona.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Asa Kiitetetha Ixo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>Shooshi Godaa Xoossay medhida do7a ubbaafe aadhida genancho. Issi gallas shooshi maccasiw, “Xoossay tuma hintena, ‘Gannatiyan de7iya mitha ayfe ubbaafe moopite’ gidee?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Maccasiya shooshako, “Akay, Xoossay hessada gibeenna; nuuni gannate giddon de7iya mithata ayfe maanaw danda7oos. <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>Shin Xoossay nuna, ‘Gannate giddon de7iya mitha ayfe moopite, bochofite; ixiko hinte hayqana’ gis” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>Shooshay maccasiw, “Hinte aykoka hayqeketa. <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>Xoossay hessa giday, he mitha ayfiya hinte miiko akeeka demmidi lo77onne iitaa Xoossada hinte eranaysa I, eriya gishosa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>Maccasiya mitha ayfey maanaw mal7eysa, be7anaw lo77eysanne, cincatethi demmanaw amoyaba gideysa be7asu. He mitha ayfiyape ekada masu. Qassi ba azinaska immin ika mis.<verse eid="GEN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Enti mi simmidi, nam7ayka akeeka demmidosona. Enti xire kallo de7eysa eridosona. Hessa gisho, balase mitha haythi sikidi dancidosona.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Sa7i omarsida wode gannate giddon Godaa Xoossay hemetishin iya girsa Addaameynne iya machiya si7idosona. Enti gannate mitha giddon Godaa Xoossafe qosetidosona. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Shin Godaa Xoossay Addaame xeegidi, “Addaame, awun de7ay?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Addaamey, “Gannate giddon ne girsa si7ada taani kallo de7iya gisho yayyada qosetas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>Godaa Xoossay, “Neeni kallo de7eysa new odiday oonee? Taani nena moopa gida mitha ayfepe madiyee?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>Addaamey, “Taara daana mela neeni immida maccasiya he mitha ayfiyape taw immin mas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>Godaa Xoossay, maccasiw, “Neeni hessa ayis oothadii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Maccasiya, “Tana shooshay cimmin mas” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>Godaa Xoossay shooshaa, “Neeni haysa oothida gisho, mehepenne do7a ubbaafe aadhada baadetidaba gida. Neeni ne ulon biittara gooshetana; ne de7o laytha ubban baana laaccana. <verse eid="GEN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>Taani, ne giddoninne maccase giddon, ne sheesha giddoninne I sheesha giddon morketethi wothana. I ne huuphiya qoxana, neka iya gindiya dukana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>Maccasiw Godaa Xoossay, “Ne qanthatida ageenan daro un7etana. Neeni wolqaama waayen na7a yelana. Gidoshin, neeni ne azinaara daanaw amottana; I nena haarana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Godaa Xoossay Addaameko, “Neeni ne mache oda si7ida gishonne taani nena moopa gida mitha ayfiyape neeni mida gisho, biittay ne gaason baadetidaysa gido. Neeni ne de7o laytha ubban gita daabursan biitta oothada maana. <verse eid="GEN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>Biittay new agunthinne harme dolisana; neeni biittafe dolidi kaxiyaba maana. <verse eid="GEN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>Neeni ne medhetida biitta simmana gakanaw daaburan cawatada oothida ne kathi maana. Neeni biittafe medhetida gisho biitta simmana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Addaamey ba machiw de7oy de7iya asa ubbaas aayo gidiya gisho Hewaanno<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hewaanno: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha sunthaa birshethay “De7iyaro” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>Godaa Xoossay Addaamenne iya machiw ite giigisidi mayzis.<verse eid="GEN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Godaa Xoossay, “Hiza asi lo77onne iita eron nuupe issuwada gidis. Enti banta kushiya yeddidi, de7o immiya mitha ayfiyape ekidi moonna melanne merinaw de7on doona mela teqetanaw koshshees” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Hessa gisho, enti banta medhetida biitta oothana mela Godaa Xoossay Edene Gannatepe enta kessis. <verse eid="GEN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>Yaatidi, de7o immiya mithaako efiya ogiya naagana mela Kirubeela geetetiya de7o medhetethatanne shireti shireti wodhiya tama laco mashshe Edene Gannatepe doloha baggara wothis.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Qaayelanne Aabela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Addaamey ba mache Hewaannira aqis. Iya qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. “Goday tana maaddin adde na7a demmas” gada Qaayela gada sunthasu. <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Iya ishaa Aabela yelasu. Aabeli dorse heemmees qassi Qaayeli biitta oothees. <verse eid="GEN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Undenna wodepe guye, Qaayeli ba gaden kaxida kathaafe Godaas yarsho yarshis. <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/>Shin Aabeli ba dorsa wudiya giddon bayra yeletidaysa shukidi iya ashuwape modho bagga yarshis. Goday Aabelanne iya yarshuwa ekis. <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>Shin Qaayelanne iya yarshuwa ekibeenna. Hessa gisho, Qaayeli daro yilotis; iya som7oy dhumis.<verse eid="GEN 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Goday Qaayelako, “Ayis yilotay? Ne som7oy ayis dhumidee? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Neeni lo77o oothidaba gidiyako, ne som7oy pashka gidennee? Shin neeni lo77o oothonna ixiko, nagari do7ada ne pengen naagees. I nena haaranaw koyees, shin neeni iya xoonanaw bessees” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Hessafe guye, Qaayeli ba ishaa Aabelako, “Ane demba bessi boos” yaagis. Enti demban de7ishin, Qaayeli ba ishaa Aabela bolla dendidi iya wodhis.<verse eid="GEN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Goday Qaayela, “Ne ishay Aabeli awunee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Qaayeli zaaridi, “Taani erike; ta isha naagey taneyee?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>Goday Qaayela, “Haysa ayis oothadii? Heko, ne ishaa suuthay biittafe taako xillo pirdas waassees. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>Neeni baadetidaba gidiya gisho biitta zaarada oothanaw danda7aka. Ne ishaa wodhadasa iya suuthaaka biittan gussadasa. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>Neeni oothinka biittay new ayfena; bete asada neeni sa7a bolla toylattada daaburana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Qaayeli Godaako, “Ne ta bolla pirdida pirday ta wolqafe bolla. <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>Neeni tana hachi biittafe yedethaasa; ne sinthafeka haassasa. Bete asada taani sa7a bolla daaburana; tana demmiya oonika wodhana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Goday iya, “Nena oonika wodhenna; wodhiko, taani laapun toho halo keyana” yaagis. Hessa gisho, iya demmiya oonika wodhonna mela Goday iya bolla naagiso malla wothis. <verse eid="GEN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Qaayeli Godaa sinthafe keyidi, Edene baggafe doloha baggan de7iya Nooda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nooda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Toylatidi daaburiya bessi </char></note> biittan de7is.<verse eid="GEN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qaayelanne Iya Yeleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Qaayeli ba machera aqis; iya qanthatada Heenoke yelasu. He wode Qaayeli katama keexidi, he katama ba na7aa sunthan “Heenoke” gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Heenokey Gayda yelis. Gaydi Ma7eela yelis. Ma7eeli Matusa7eela yelis. Matusa7eeli Laameha yelis.<verse eid="GEN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Laamehi Adonne Siilo geetetiya nam7u macho ekis. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Ada Yabaala yelasu. Yaabali mehe haariyanne dunkaanen de7iya asata aawa. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Iya ishaa sunthay Yubaala. Yubaali qassi diithi diixeysatanne suusul7e punniya asata ubbaa aawa. <verse eid="GEN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Siila qassi Tubalqayna geetetiya na7aa yelasu. Tubalqayni naase biratapenne biratape dumma dumma miisheta qoxeysata aawa. Tubalqayna michiya Na7imo.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Issi gallas Laamehi ba macheta, “Ade, Siile, si7ite; ta macheto, taani odiyaba hayzite. Issi pantha addey tana dechidi madunxisida gisho, taani iya wodhas. <verse eid="GEN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Qaayela haluwa keyanaw laapun kushe koshshiko, Laameha haluwa keyanaw laapun tammanne laapun kushe koshshees” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seetanne Henoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Addaame machiya hara adde na7aa yelasu. Yaatada, “Qaayeli wodhida Aabela gisho Xoossay taw hara na7a immis” gada iya Seeta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Seeta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha sunthaa birshethay “Immis” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu. <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Seeti adde na7a yelidi iya “Henoosa” gidi sunthis. Asay Godaa suntha xeegidi goyinno doomiday he wode.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Addaamenne Iya Yeleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Addaame yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa. Xoossay ase medhida gallas bana daanisidi medhis. <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>I addenne maccas oothi medhidi enta anjis. Enta medhidi Ase (Addaame) gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Addaamey 130 laythi de7idi, bana daaniya adde na7a yelidi iya “Seeta” gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Addaamey Seeta yelidaape guye 800 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>Addaamey 930 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Seeti 105 laythi de7idi Henoosa yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Seeti Henoosa yelidaape guye, 807 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>Seeti 912 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Henoosi 90 laythi de7idi, Qaynana yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Henoosi Qaynana yelidaape guye, 815 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>Henoosi 905 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Qaynani 70 laythi de7idi, Malal7eela yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>Qaynani Malal7eela yelidaape guye, 840 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>Qaynani 910 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Malal7eeli 65 laythi de7idi, Yaareda yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Malal7eeli Yaareda yelidaape guye, 830 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>Malal7eeli 895 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Yaaredi 162 laythi de7idi, Heenoke yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Yaaredi Heenoke yelidaape guye, 800 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Yaaredi 962 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Heenokey 65 laythi de7idi, Matusaala yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Matusaala yelidaape guye, Heenokey 300 laythi Xoosse ufaysiya de7o de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Heenokey 365 laythi de7is. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Xoossi iya baako ekida gisho simmidi bentibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Matusaali 187 laythi de7idi, Laameha yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Matusaali Laameha yelidaape guye, 782 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>Matusaali 969 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Laamehi 182 laythi de7idi, adde na7a yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>Yaatidi, “Ha na7ay Goday baaddida biitta bolla ha daabura ooso ubbaafe nuna shempisana” gidi iya Nohe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nohe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan Nohe geetetiya sunthaas birshethay “Shempo” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Laamehi Nohe yelidaape guye, 595 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>Laamehi 777 laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Nohey 500 laythi de7i simmidi heedzu adde nayta Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Asa Iitatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Asay sa7a bolla darida wode entaw macca nayti yeletidosona. <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>“Xoossaa nayta” geetetiya medhetethati he macca nayti mala lo77o gideysa be7idi entafe bantaw dooridaysata machidosona. <verse eid="GEN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>Goday, “Asas de7o immiya ta Ayyaanay asan merinaw deenna. Asi hayqeysa gidiya gisho, hizape iya laythay issi xeetanne laatama gidana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>He wodenne hessafe guye, Xoossa nayti asa macca nayta ekin, nayti yeletida wode, wogga adussa asati sa7a bolla de7idosona. Enti beni wode olas minonne eretida asata.<verse eid="GEN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>Goday he wode sa7a bolla de7iya asa iitatethi daridaysanne enta wozanay ubba wode qopiyabay iita xalaala gididaysa <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>be7idi, ase ha sa7a bolla medhidaysan azzanis; ba wozanan daro qiirotis. <verse eid="GEN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>Taani ase ayis medhadina gada qiirotas. Hessa gisho, Goday, “Taani medhida ase, mehe, do7a, sa7ara gooshetiya medhetethatanne salo kafota sa7a bollafe dhaysana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Shin Nohey Godaa sinthan saba demmis.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>Nohe taarkey haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa. Nohey ba wode de7iya asa giddofe Xoossaa ufaysiyanne suure asi. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Nohey Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeta geetetiya heedzu adde nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>He wode biittay kumethi Xoossa sinthan tunis; biitta ubbay geellatethan kumis. <verse eid="GEN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Xoossay ha biitta xeelliya wode sa7an de7iya asa ubbay banta ogiya tunisidi de7eysa be7is.<verse eid="GEN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay Nohe haysada yaagidi kiittis; “Taani asa ubbaa dhaysana hanayis. Enta gaason biittay geellatethan kumida gisho, ase biittafe dhaysana. <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/>Hessa gisho, mino mithafe new markabe keexa. He markabiya giddon daro qol7ata kessa. Yaatada sooranne karera made melaban meesha. <figure style="fig" alt="The Ark of Noha" file="CO00628B.tif" size="span" ref="6:14">Nohe Markabiya</figure> <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>Markabiya haysada yaatada keexa; adussatethaa 300 wadha, gompaa 50 wadha, geesa 30 wadha ootha. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>Markabiyas kaara medha; kaarapenne godaape giddon issi wadha gidiya bessi dooya agga. Pengiya markabiyas miye baggara kessa; markabiya heedzu pooqe kessada keexa.<verse eid="GEN 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>“Taani salope garsan shempora de7iya medhetetha ubbaa dhaysanaw dhayo haatha yeddada ha sa7aa bolla de7iyaba ubbaa dhaysana. <verse eid="GEN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>Shin taani ta caaquwa neera caaqana. Neeni, ne machiw, ne adde naytanne enta macheta ekada markabiya giddo gela. <verse eid="GEN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>Enti neera de7on daana mela, de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaafe qommon qommon addenne macca nam7a nam7a oothada, markabiya giddo gelsa. <verse eid="GEN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>Dumma dumma qommo kafotape, dumma dumma qommo mehetapenne sa7ara gooshetiya dumma dumma qommo medhetetha ubbaafe nam7a nam7a gididi de7on daana mela neeko yo. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>Qassi hintenne do7ati maanaw dumma dumma qommo miya kathi efada, markabiya giddon qola” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Nohey ubbabaaka Xoossay kiitidaysada oothis.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Dhayo Haathaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Nohe haysada yaagis; “Neeni ne soo asa ubbaara markabiya giddo gela. Ha wodiya yeletethaa giddon ta sheniya poliday ne xalaala gididaysa be7as. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Neeni tuna gidonna mehenne do7a ubbaafe iya qommofe qommofe addenne macca laapun laapun, tuna mehenne do7a ubbaafe iya qommofe qommofe issi addenne issi macca gelsa. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/>Qassi salo kafotape iya qommofe qommofe addenne macca laapun laapun oothada, biitta ubbaa bolla dumma dumma kochay de7on daana mela neera ekada gela. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Laapun gallasape guye, taani oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma ha sa7aa bolla ira bukisana. Yaatada taani medhida medhetetha ubbaa biitta bollafe quchana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>Yaatin, Nohey Goday iya kiitida ubbaba oothis.<verse eid="GEN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Dhayo haathay ha sa7aa bolla yida wode Nohes laythi usupun xeeta. <verse eid="GEN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>Nohey, iya adde nayti, iya machiyanne iya nayta macheti dhayo haathaafe attanaw markabiya giddo gelidosona. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/>Tuna gidonna mehepenne do7ape, tuna mehepenne do7ape kafotapenne biittara goosheteyisata ubbaafe <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>Xoossay Nohe kiitidaysada addenne maccas nam7a nam7a gididi, Noheko markabiya giddo gelidosona. <verse eid="GEN 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Laapun gallasape guye, dhayo haathay ha sa7a bolla yis.<verse eid="GEN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Nohey usupun xeetu laythi de7in, nam7antho ageenan, tammanne laapuntha gallasan, biitta giddon de7iya gita ciimmuwa pulto ubbay dhuuqi aggis. Salon de7iya haatha maskooteti dooyetidosona. <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/>Iray ha sa7aa bolla oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma bukis. <verse eid="GEN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>Iri buka doomida gallas Noheynne iya machiya, iya adde nayti, Seemi, Kaaminne Yaafeti, iya nayta heedzata macheti issife markabiya giddo gelidosona. <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>Do7a ubbaafe ba qommon qommon, mehe ubbaafe ba qommon qommon, biittara gooshetiya ubbaafe ba qommon qommon, kafo ubbaafe ba qommon qommon entara issife gelidosona. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Shempora de7eysati ubbay nam7a nam7a gididi Noheko markabiyan gelidosona. <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>Xoossay Nohe kiitidaysada, medhetetha ubbaafe addenne macca gididi markabiya giddo gelin Nohepe guyera Goday markabiya pengiya gordis.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Dhayo haathay oytamu gallas sa7a bolla bukishe de7is. Haathay daridi markabiya biittafe pude denthis. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Haathay biitta bolla keehi darin, markabey haatha bolla tooketis. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Salope garsan de7iya zumati ubbay mitettana gakanaw haathay sa7a bolla keehi daris. <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>Haathay zumata xeerape aadhidi, tammanne ichashu wadha gakanaw diccis. <verse eid="GEN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>Yaatin sa7a bolla woxi qaaxiya medhetethati ubbay, kafoti, mehey, do7inne, asi ubbay hayqis. <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>Biitta bolla de7iya ba siidhera de7o shempo shempiya ubbayka hayqis. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Sa7a bolla de7oy de7iya ubbay, asay, mehey, do7aynne salo kafoti ubbay sa7ape qushetidosona. Noheynne iyara markabiya giddon de7eyisata xalaali attidosona. <verse eid="GEN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>He haathay pacconna xeetanne ishatamu gallas sa7a bolla gam7is.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Dhayo Haatha Wodhetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>Shin Xoossay Nohe, iyara markabiya giddon de7iya do7a ubbaanne mehe ubbaa qopidi sa7a bolla carko carkisin he haathay wodhi wodhi bis. <verse eid="GEN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>Qassi biitta giddon de7iya ciimmuwa pultoynne salon de7iya haatha maskooteti gordetidosona; irayka salon teqetis. <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>Yaanin, haathay xeetanne ishatamu gallas gakanaw wodhi wodhi bis. <verse eid="GEN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>Haathay wodhin laapuntha ageenan, tammanne laapuntha gallasan markabey Araraate zumata bolla uttis. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Haathay tammantha ageena gakanaw wodhi wodhi bis. Tammantho ageenas koyro gallas zumata xeerati bentidosona.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Oytamu gallasape guye, Nohey ba keexida markabiya maskootiya <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>dooyidi issi quuro kare yeddin quuroy haathay biitta bollafe melana gakanaw, yaanne haanne piradhishe gam7is. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Qassi Nohey haathay biitta bollafe wodhi wuridaako be7anaw issi holle kare yeddis. <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>Shin he holliya haathay biitta ubbaa bolla ha7ika de7iya gisho, shempiya bessi demmabuku. Hessa gisho, simmada, markabiyako yin, Nohey ba kushiya yeddidi, baako markabiya giddo ekis.<verse eid="GEN 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>Hessafe guye, laapun gallas gam7idi, holliw zaaridi yeddis. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>He holliya sa7i omarsiya wode iyako simmada yashe shamaho aacape duuthida irxa haythi ba doonan saxa ekada yasu. Yaatin, haathay biitta bollafe wodhidaysa Nohey eris. <verse eid="GEN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>Qassi Nohey hara laapun gallas gam7idi, he holliw zaaridi yeddis. Shin he holliya iyako simmada yabuuku.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Nohey usupun xeetanne issi laythi de7in, koyro ageenan koyro gallas, haathay biitta bollafe xiz7is. Nohey markabiya kamaa qaari xeellidi, biittay xiz7idaysa be7is. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Nam7antho ageenan laatamanne laapuntha gallasan, biittay kumethi melis.<verse eid="GEN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Xoossay he wode Nohe haysada yaagidi kiittis; <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>“Neeni, ne machiw, ne adde naytanne ne nayta macheta ekada markabiya giddofe keya. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>Enti yeletidi, darana mela de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaafe neera de7eyisata kafota, meheta, do7atanne biittara gooshetiya ubbaa neera kessa” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Yaatin Nohey ba adde naytara, ba macheranne ba nayta machetara markabiya giddofe keyis. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Yaanin, meheynne do7ay, sa7ara gooshetiya medhetethay, kafoynne sa7a bolla woxi qaaxiyaba ubbay ba qommuwan qommuwan markabiya giddofe keyidosona.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Hessafe guye, Nohey Godaas yarsho bessi gimbidi tuna gidonna mehenne do7a ubbaafe, tuna gidonna kafo ubbaafe ekidi, giigisida bessan yarsho oothidi xuuggis. <verse eid="GEN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/>Yaatin, Goday he yarshuwa peenuwa singidi, ba wozanan haysada yaagis; “Na7atethafe doomidi asi wozanan qopiyaba ubbay iita gidikoka taani asa qoho gisho gada nam7antho ha sa7aa baaddike. Qassi taani ha7i oothidaysada de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaa nam7antho dhaysike. <verse eid="GEN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>Ha biittay de7ida wode ubban, zeriya wodeynne cakiya wodey, meegoyinne hombey, boneynne balgoy, gallasinne qammi ubba wode daana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Nohera Caaqida Caaquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Xoossay Nohenne iya adde nayta haysada yaagidi anjis; “Yeletite, darite, sa7a ubbaa kumite. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Sa7aa do7ati, salo kafoti, biittan woxi qaaxiyabaynne abban de7iya moloti ubbay hintew yashshaninne dagaman de7o. Enti hintew haareto. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Taani doliya dumma dumma cil7obata hintew immidaysada, de7oy de7iya woxi qaaxiya medhetetha ubbay hintew kathi gidana mela immas. <verse eid="GEN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>Shin shempoy giddon de7iya gisho suuthi iya giddon de7iya asho moopite. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>Oonika shempo wodhiday pirdetana. Qassi asa suuthi gussiya do7aka hayqon pirdana. <verse eid="GEN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>Xoossay ase bana daanisidi medhida gisho, asa suuthi gussiya oona gidikoka iya suuthayka asa kushen gukana. <verse eid="GEN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>Hinte yeletite, darite, hinte sheeshayka sa7a bolla daro” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay Nohenne iyara de7iya iya adde nayta haysada yaagis; <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>“Hiza, taani ta caaquwa hintera, hinte sheesharanne de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaara caaqayis. <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>Taani ta caaquwa kafotara, mehiyara, sa7a do7a ubbaaranne, markabiyape hintera keyida, de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbara caaqayis. <verse eid="GEN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>Taani hintera caaqidaysa mela hizape de7oy de7iya medhetethati dhayo haathan dhayokona; ha sa7aaka zaari dhayo haathi dhaysena” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Qassika Xoossay, “Taani taapenne hintefe, de7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaafe giddon caaqiya caaquwa mallay haysa; <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>Taani ta zuulla shaaran essas. I taapenne sa7a bolla de7iya medhetetha giddon de7iya caaquwas malla gidana. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>Ta saluwa shaara mayzida wodenne shaaran zuulli eqida wode, <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>taapenne hintefe giddon, de7oy de7iya dumma dumma medhetetha ubbaafe giddon caaqida ta caaquwa akeekana. De7oy de7iya medhetetha ubbaa dhaysanaw hizape guye dhayo haathi yeenna. <verse eid="GEN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>Zuulli shaaran eqida wode ta iya be7ada taapenne sa7a bolla de7iya dumma dumma medhetetha ubbaafe giddon caaqida merina caaquwa akeekana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Xoossay Nohe, “Taani taapenne sa7a bolla de7oy de7iyaba ubbaafe giddon caaqida caaquwa mallay haysa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nohenne Iya Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Markabiyape keyida Nohe adde nayti Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeta; Kaami Kanaane aawa. <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Ha heedzati Nohe nayta; sa7a ubban de7iya asay entafe yeletidosona.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Nohey goshshancho; I woyne tokethan koyro asi. <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Issi gallas Nohey he woyniyape uyidi mathotidi ba dunkaaniya giddon xire kallo zin7is. <verse eid="GEN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Kanaane aawa Kaami ba aawa kalluwa be7idi, kare keyidi, ba nam7u ishatas odis. <verse eid="GEN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Shin Seeminne Yaafeti afila ekidi, nam7ayka banta hashiyara hashiyara gathi oykidi, guye guthu hemeti gelidi, banta aawa kalluwa kammidosona. Enti banta aawa kalluwa be7oona mela banta ayfiya haraso zaaridosona.<verse eid="GEN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Nohey mathoy aadhin, barkidi, iya kaalo na7ay oothidaba eris. <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>Nohey iyako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanaaney baadetidaba gido!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">I ba ishatas wursetha aylle gido”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 9:25">yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>Qassika Nohey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">“Goday, Seema Xoossay galatetto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaaney Seema aylle gido;<verse eid="GEN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>Xoossay Yaafeta biitta aasso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Yaafeta sheeshay Seema sheeshara wolla de7onna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaaney Yaafeta aylle gido” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Dhayo haathaafe guye, Nohey heedzu xeetanne ishatamu laythi de7is. <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>Nohey uddufun xeetanne ishatamu laythi de7idi hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Nohe Sheesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>Nohe nayta, Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeta yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa. Dhayo haathaafe guye, entaw adde nayti yeletidosona.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>Yaafeta adde nayti, Gomera, Maagoge, Madaya, Yawaana, Tubaala, Mosahanne Tirasa.<verse eid="GEN 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Gomera adde nayti, Askanaaza, Irfatanne Togarma.<verse eid="GEN 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Yawaana adde nayti, Elisha, Tarsesa, Kiximanne Rooda.<verse eid="GEN 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>Haysati Yuushoy abban teqetida biittan de7iya Yaafeta sheeshatas mayzata. Enti banta biittan biittan, banta doonan doonaninne banta kawotethan kawotethan shaaketidi de7iya dereta.<verse eid="GEN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>Kaama adde nayti, Kuusha, Gibxe, Liibenne Kanaane.<verse eid="GEN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Kuusha adde nayti, Saaba, Hawila, Saabita, Ra7imanne Sabtaka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:7">Ra7ime adde nayti; Saabanne Dedaana.<verse eid="GEN 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Kuushi Namiruude yelis; Namiruudey ha sa7an koyro wolqaama olancho gidis. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Godaa maaden wolqaama shankancho gidis. Asay, “Namiruudeda Goday nena wolqaama shankancho kesso” gidi anjey hessa gishosa. <verse eid="GEN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>Iya kawotethaas koyro katamati Sana7oora<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sana7oora: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woyko Babiloone </char></note> biittan de7iya Babiloone, Ereka, Arkadanne Kaline. <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>I he biittafe Asoore bidi, Nanawe, Rehobootanne Kalaha keexis. <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>Qassi Nanawepenne Kalaha katamaape giddon Reseena keexis.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Mixiraymi, Luudeta, Anamimeta, Lahabeta, Naftuheta, <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>Patroosatanne Filisxeeme kochaa yelida Kasluheematanne Qaftooreta mayza. <verse eid="GEN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Kanaaney ba bayra na7a Sidoonanne Heeta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>Qassi Kanaane sheeshati Yaabuseta, Amooreta, Gergeseta, <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>Hiweta, Arketa, Siinata, <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>Arwaadeta, Xamaaratanne Hamaatata yelis. Hessafe guye, Kanaane sheeshati dumma dumma bessi laaletidosona. <verse eid="GEN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>Kanaane biitta zaway Sidoonape doomidi, Garaaranne Gaazara gakidi, Soodomenne Gamoora, Adaamanne Xaboyma bidi, Lasha7a gaki eqis. <verse eid="GEN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Haysati Kaama sheeshata; entaw dumma dumma dooni, dumma dumma biittinne dumma dumma kawotethi de7ees.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Seemas nayti yeletidosona. I Yaafetas bayra ishanne Eboora nayta ubbaas mayza. <verse eid="GEN 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Seema adde nayti, Elama, Asoore, Arfakisaade, Luudenne Araame.<verse eid="GEN 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Araame adde nayti, Uxa, Hula, Geteranne Masheka.<verse eid="GEN 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Arfakisaadi Saala yelis. Saali Eboora yelis.<verse eid="GEN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>Ebooras nam7u adde nayti yeletidosona. Sa7an de7iya asay iya wode shaaketida gisho issuwa Pelega<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pelega: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha suntha birshethay “Shaaketethi” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis. Iya ishaa sunthay Yoqxaana.<verse eid="GEN 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Yoqxaana sheeshati haysata. Entika Almodaada, Salefa, Hasermoota, Yaraha, <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>Hadoraama, Uzaala, Diqila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>Obaala, Abmaala, Saaba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>Ofira, Hawilanne Yobaaba. Haysati ubbay Yoqxaana sheeshata.<verse eid="GEN 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>Enti de7ida heeray Meesape bidi doloha baggara de7iya derey dariya Safaara biitta gakees. <verse eid="GEN 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Haysati ubbay Seema sheeshata; entaw dumma dumma dooni, dumma dumma biittinne dumma dumma kawotethi de7ees.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Haysati ubbay banta sheeshan sheeshaninne banta kawotethan kawotethan xaafetida Nohe nayta. Dhayo haathaafe guye kawotethati haysatape sa7a ubbaa laaletidosona.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Babiloone Gimbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Sa7a bolla de7iya asi ubbay koyro issi doonan odetees. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Enti doloha baggafe dendidi bida wode Sana7oora biittan demba bessi demmidi yan uttidosona.<verse eid="GEN 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>Enti issoy issuwako, “Haa yiite, xuube medhidi, minnana mela taman xuuggoos” yaagidosona. Enti shucha gisho xuube, urqa gisho made melaba, <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>ekidi, “Haa yiite, nu sunthaa xeegisanawunne qassi nuuni ha sa7a bolla laaletonna attana mela issi gita katamaanne xeeray salo gakiya pooqe keexoos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>Shin Goday asati keexida gita katamaanne pooqiya be7anaw duge wodhis. <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>Goday haysada yaagis; “Heko, enti issi asi; enti ubbayka issi doonan odetidosona. Enti ha7i haysa oothanaw doomidosona. Enti bantaw oothanaw halchidaba polonna aggokona. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>Yaaniya gisho, haayite; duge wodhidi enti issoy haasayiya doona issoy eronna mela enta doona dummayos” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Goday enta hessafe sa7a ubbaa bolla laallin, enti katama keexeysa aggaagidosona. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Goday sa7an de7iya asa doona yan buqida gisho he katamaa sunthay Babiloone<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Babiloone: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha suntha birshethay “Walaketis” guussu </char></note> geetetis. Goday enta hessafe sa7a ubbaa bolla laallis.<verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seema Yeletetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>Seema yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa; dhayo haathaafe guye, nam7u laythi gidin, Seemas laythi xeeta gidida wode, Seemi Arfakisaade yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Seemi Arfakisaade yelidaape guye, ichashu xeetu laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Arfakisaadi 35 laythi de7idi, Salaha yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>Arfakisaadi Saala yelidaape guye, 403 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Saali 30 laythi de7idi, Eboora yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>Saali Eboora yelidaape guye, 403 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Eboori 34 laythi de7idi, Pelega yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>Eboori Pelega yelidaape guye, 430 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Pelegi 30 laythi de7idi, Ra7a yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>Pelegi Ra7a yelidaape guye 209 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Ra7i 32 laythi de7idi, Saruga yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>Ra7i Saruga yelidaape guye, 207 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Sarugi 30 laythi de7idi, Nakoora yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>Sarugi Nakoora yelidaape guye, 200 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Nakoori 29 laythi de7idi, Taara yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>Nakoori Taara yelidaape guye, 119 laythi de7is. Hara adde naytanne macca nayta yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Taari 70 laythi de7idi, Abrame, Nakooranne Haarane yelis.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taara Yeletetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>Taara yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa; Taari Abrame, Nakooranne Haarane yelis. Yaatin Haraani Looxe yelis. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Haraani ba aaway Taari paxa de7ishin, ba yeletida Kaldaaweta biittan, gita Uure kataman hayqis. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Abrameynne Naakorey nam7ayka machidosona. Abrame mache sunthay Soora. Qassi Nakoora mache sunthay Milko. Milka Haarana na7iw; Haaraney Milkanne Yosika aawa. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/>Soora maynthi gidida gisho iw na7i baawa.<verse eid="GEN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Taari ba na7aa Abrame, ba na7aa Haarane na7aa Looxenne, ba na7aa Abrame machiw Soora ekidi, Kanaane biitta baanaw Kaldaaweta katamaa Uurepe dendis. Shin enti Kaarane katama gakidi yan uttidosona. <verse eid="GEN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Taari 205 laythi de7idi Kaaranen hayqis.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Abrame Xeegetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>Goday Abrameko, “Ne biittafe, ne deriyape, ne soo asaape, shaaketada ta nena bessiya biitta ba. <verse eid="GEN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/>Ta nena wolqaama dere oothana, nena ta anjana ne suntha gita kessana; ne haratas anjo gidana. <verse eid="GEN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Taani nena anjeyisata anjana; nena baaddeyisata baaddana, biitta bolla de7iya dere ubbay ne gaasora anjetana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Hessa gisho, Abramey Xoossay iya kiitidaysada keyis. Looxey iyara issife bis. Abramey Kaaranepe keyiya wode iyaw laythi laapun tammanne ichasha. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>Abramey ba machiw Soora, ba isha na7a Looxe, Kaaranen de7ishe shiishida shaluwanne ba aylleta ubba ekidi Kanaane biitta bidi gakidosona. <verse eid="GEN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Abramey Seekeman de7iya More geetetiya gita mithaako gakanaw kanthidi bis. He wode Kanaane asati he biittan de7oosona. <verse eid="GEN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>Xoossay Abrames yan qoncidi, “Ha biitta taani ne sheeshas immana” yaagis. Ika ba qoncida Godaas he bessan yarsho bessi giigisis. <verse eid="GEN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>He bessaafe dendidi Beetelepe doloha baggara de7iya zumako bis. Yan Beetele wuloha baggan, Gaye doloha baggan aggidi, ba dunkaaniya tokis; yan Godaas yarsho bessi giigisidi Godaa sunthaa xeegis. <verse eid="GEN 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Hessafe guye, Abramey bessafe besse aadhishe Negebe gakis.<verse eid="GEN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abramey Gibxe Biittan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>He wode Kanaane biittan koshi keyis. Koshay minnida gisho guutha wode yan daanaw Abramey Gibxe biitta bis. <verse eid="GEN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Gibxe gelanaw matiya wode Abramey ba mache Soorako, “Neeni mala lo77o gideysa taani erayis; <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/>Gibxe asati nena be7idi, ‘Hanna iya machiw’ yaagidi tana wodhidi nena aggaagana. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>Hessa gisho, ne gisho gidi taw lo77oba oothana melanne ta shempiya attana mela ‘Ta iyaw micho’ yaaga” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Abramey Gibxe biitta gakida mela Gibxe asati Soora mala lo77o maccasi gidoysa be7idosona. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Gibxe Paarona moorinnati iyo be7idi daro nashshidi kawa Faaronas odidosona, iyoka kawa sinthe efidosona. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>I gaason kawoy Abrame bonchidi mokis. Gujidika dorsata, miizata, hareta, gimaleta, adde aylletanne macca aylleta iyaw immis. <verse eid="GEN 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Shin Goday Abrame mache Soora gaason Gibxe kawanne iya keetha gado hargen shocis. <verse eid="GEN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy Abrame xeegisidi, “Ne ta bolla oothidabay haysi aybee? Iya ne macho gideysa ayis taw odabikii? <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Ayis ta micho gada wordotadii? Ta iyo macho oothada ekas, shin attis; ne machiya hannashu eka ba” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Hessafe guye, Abramenne iya machiw iyaw de7iyaba ubbara kessi yeddana mela Kawoy ba asata kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Abramenne Looxe Shaaketetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Abramey ba machiw Sooranne baw de7iyaba ubba ekidi Gibxefe Negebe mela biitta bis. Looxeyka iyara wolla bis. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Abramey he wode mehen, biraninne worqan daro duretis.<verse eid="GEN 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>Abramey Nagebepe dendidi bessafe besse aadhishe Beetele gakanaw bis. Beetelepenne Gayepe giddon I koyro dunkaaniya tokida bessaanne <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>Godaas kase yarsho yarshida bessa gakidi, yan Abramey Godaa sunthaa xeegis.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Abramera wolla hemetiya Looxesika daro dorsati, deeshati, meheti, soo asatinne aylleti de7oosona. <verse eid="GEN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>He wode Abramesinne Looxes daro mehey de7iya gisho enti banta meheta heemmiya bessay xuummis. <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Hessa gisho, Abrame meheta heemmeyisata giddoninne Looxe meheta heemmeyisata giddon kachi keyis. He wode Kanaane asatinne Parze asati he biittan de7oosona.<verse eid="GEN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>Hessa gisho, Abramey Looxeko, “Nuuni ishanta gidiya gisho nu giddon woyko nu meheta heemmeyisata giddon kachi daanaw bessena. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Biittay dalga gidiya gisho nu wolipe shaaketana. Ne haddirsa bagga biiko taani ushacha bagga baana; neeni ushacha bagga biiko taani haddirsa bagga baana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Looxey biitta yuuyi aadhidi xeelliya wode Yordaanose zangaaray, Godaa gannatiyada woyko Zo7aare baggara de7iya Gibxe biitta mela haathi kumidaysa be7is. Hessika, haniday Goday Soodomenne Gamoora geetetiya katamata dhaysanape sinthe. <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Hessa gisho, Looxey Yordaanose zangaara ubba baw dooridi doloha bagga bis. Hessada hanidi issoy issuwafe shaaketidosona. <verse eid="GEN 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Abramey Kanaane biittan de7is. Shin Looxey Zangaaran de7iya katamata giddon Soodome matan ba dunkaaniya tokis. <verse eid="GEN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>He wode Soodome asay daro iitanne Godaa sinthan nagaranchota. <verse eid="GEN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>Looxey Abramepe shaaketidaape guye, Goday Abrameko, “Ne de7iya bessaafe pude dhoqu gada pudeha bagganne dugeha bagga, doloha bagganne wuloha bagga yedda xeella. <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/>He neeni be7iya biitta ubba taani merinaw newunne ne sheeshas immana. <verse eid="GEN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>Taani ne sheesha biitta baanada darsana. Oonika biitta baana taybanaw danda7onaysada ne sheeshayka taybetenna. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Taani ha biitta new immana gisho dendada biitta adussatethaninne dalgatethan simereta.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Hessa gisho, Abramey ba dunkaaniya shoddidi Kebroonan de7iya Mamire gita mithata matan de7anaw bis. Yan Godaas yarsho bessi giigisis.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Abramey Looxe Wosisetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>Sana7oora kawoy Amrafeeli, Elsaare kawoy Ariyooki, Elama kawoy Kolodogomoorinne Goyma kawoy Tidaley oyddu kawotethati wolla, <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>ichashu kawotethatara, Soodome kawa Beraara, Gamoora kawa Bersara, Adaama kawa Sen7abera, Xiboyma kawa Sambaranne Zo7aara geetetiya Beella kawuwara oletanaw dendidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Ha ichashu kawotethati issife shiiqidi Maxine Abba geetetiya Sidima zangaaran banta toora shiishidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Ha kawotethati tammanne nam7u laythi Kolodogomooras haaretidosona shin tammanne heedzantho laythan iyaw kiitetonna ixidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>Tammanne oyddantho laythan Kolodogomoorinne iyara tobbida kawotethati banta olanchota eki bidi Raafaymeta Astarooten de7iya Qarnayman, Zuzayteta Haaman, Emimeta Sawen de7iya Qiratayman; <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>Qassi Hoora biitta asataka derey dariya Sayre biittan oli xoonidi, mela biitta matan de7iya Elfaraana geetetiya bessa gakanaw goodidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Yaape simmidi, Qaadesa geetetiya Ayin Mispata yidosona. Amaaleqata biitta ubbanne Hazazon Tamaaren de7iya Amooreta biitta oli xoonidi oykidosona.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Hessafe guye, Soodome kawoy, Gamoora kawoy, Adaama kawoy, Zeboyma kawoy, Zo7aare geetetiya Beella kawoy dendidi Sidima zangaaran olas giigidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>Ha ichashu kawotethati, Elama kawara, Goyma kawara, Sana7oora kawaranne Elsaare kawara ha oyddu kawotethatara oletidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>He wode Sidima zangaaran madeda oykiyabati de7iya ollati de7oosona. Soodome kawoynne Gamoora kawoti olape attanaw baqatishe he ollan wullidosona. Shin hanko heedzu kawotethati zumako baqatidi attidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Oyddu kawotethati Soodomeninne Gamooran de7iyaba ubba hari attoshin, enta kathaaka bonqidi efidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>Abrame isha na7ay Looxey Soodomen de7iya asi gidiya gisho ika baw de7iyaba ubbara di7etis.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Hessafe guye, di7eti bida asaape kessi ekida issi asi yidi hanidaba ubba Ibraawe addiya Abrahaames odis. He wode Abramey Amoore addiya Mamire gita mithata matan de7ees. Mamireynne iya ishati Eskolinne Aneeri olaa zaaranaw Abramera caaqidi uttidosona. <verse eid="GEN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Abramey ba isha na7ay di7etidaysa si7ida wode ba son yeleti diccidi loohida 318 tooranchota ekidi enta geedo kaallidi Daane katama gakanaw bis. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/>I baara eki bida tooranchota qamma cugan cugan shaakidi morketa olidi xoonis. Damasqofe pudeha baggara de7iya Hoobe geetetiya bessi gakanaw goodis. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>Yaatidi de7etidaba ubba, ba isha na7a Looxenne iyaw de7iyaba ubba, maccasaanne hara asata woossis ekis.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malkexaadeqanne Abrame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Abramey Kolodogomoorinne iyara tobbida kawota xoonidi simmiya wode Soodome kawoy, Kawota Zangaara geetetiya Sawe Zangaaran iya mokanaw keyis.<verse eid="GEN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Ubbaafe Dhoqa Xoossaa kahiney, Saleema kawoy Malkexaadeqi uythinne woyne ekidi yis. <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>I haysada Abrame anjis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:19">“Salonne sa7a medhida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:19">Ubbaafe Dhoqa Xoossay nena anjo.<verse eid="GEN 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Ne morketa ne kushen aathidi immida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:20">Ubbaafe Dhoqa Xoossay galatetto” yaagidi anjis.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Abramey ba demmidaba ubbaafe asraata kessidi Malkexaadeqas immis.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Soodome kawoy Abrameko, “Shaluwa ne ekada, asaa taw imma” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Shin Abramey Soodome kawako, “Taani Godaas, saluwanne sa7a medhida Ubbaafe Dhoqa Xoossas ta kushiya denthas. <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>Neeni, ‘Abrame dure oothiday tana goonnaada’ hari attoshin kire woyko caamma wodoroka ekike. <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>Ta asati midaysafe attishin ta aybibaaka ekike. Qassi taara bida Aneeri, Askoolinne Mamirey bantana gakiyaba eko” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Abramera Caaqida Caaquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Abrames amuhon qoncidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 15:1">“Abrame babofa, taani new gondalle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">Ne woytoy gita” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Shin Abramey, “Abeeti Ubba Haariya Godaw, neeni immiya woytoy taw aysee? Taw yeloy baawa; buroo tana laattanay Damasqo Eli7azara gidennee? <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>Abramey, neeni taw yelo immaboonna gisho ta keethan de7iya ta aylley tana laattana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Goday iyako, “Ha aylley nena laattenna, shin ne gulbatape keyana ne na7ay nena laattana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>Yaagi simmidi iya kare kessidi, “Pude salo xeella, neeni xoolintota paydanaw danda7iko payda, hiza ne sheeshayka hessada gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>Abramey Godaa ammanis; Goday iyaw hessa xillotethi oothidi ekis.<verse eid="GEN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Qassika Goday iyako, “Neeni ha biitta laattana mela Kaldaaweta biittafe Uure katamaape nena kessida Goday tana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Shin Abramey iyako, “Abeeti Ubba Haariya Godaw ha biitta ta laatanaysa aybin ero?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Goday iyako, “Heedzu laythi gidida issi ussi, issi deeshi, issi dorsenne hessadaka hollenne gorille taw ekada ya” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Abramey hessata ubba Xoossas ehidi kafoti attishin, harata qanxidi nam7u kessi shaakidi issuwa issuwa ginan wothis. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Ankoti he ashuwa maanaw bollafe wodhidosona; shin Abramey enta goodis.<verse eid="GEN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Awi wullana haniya wode Abrame wolqaama dhiskoy shoci yeggis. Daganthiya wolqaama dhumi iya bolla wodhis. <verse eid="GEN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>Goday Abrameko, “Ne sheeshay allaga biittan bete asi gididi daanaysa loythada era; enti aylletethan oyddu xeetu laythi naaqeti haaretana. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Shin entana aylletethan haariya deriya ta pirdana; enti he biittafe keyishe daro shalo ekidi keyana. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>Nena gidiko, neeni ne mayzatako sarotethan baana. Neeni daro cimada moogetana. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>Ne sheeshay buroo oyddantho yeletethan ha biitta simmana. Ayis giiko, Amooreta nagaray pirdetana likiya buroo gakibeenna” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Awi wullin sa7i dhuma linxi gin, cooce tama cuyinne tama lacoy bentidi shaaketida ashuwa giddora aadhis. <verse eid="GEN 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>He gallas Goday Abrames, “Gibxe shaafape doomidi Efraxiisa shaafa gakanaw de7iya biitta ubbaa taani ne sheeshas immana. <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/>He biittay Qeenata biitta, Qenezata biitta, Qadimooneta biitta, <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>Hiteta biitta, Parzeta biitta, Raafaymeta biitta, <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>Amooreta biitta, Kanaaneta biitta, Gergeseta biittanne Yaabuseta biitta” yaagidi caaqis.<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Aggaaronne Isma7eela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Abrame machiya Soora iyaw na7a yelabuuku. Shin iw Gibxefe yida Aggaaro geetetiya gadhindoy de7awusu. <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>Soora Abrameko, “Taani na7a yelonna mela Goday tana yelo diggis. Neeni bada ta ayllera aqa; taani I baggara na7a demmanekonne ooni eri” yaagasu. Abramey I qofa ekis. <verse eid="GEN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Abramey Kanaane biittan tammu laythi de7idaape guye, iya machiya Soora Gibxefe yida ba aylliw Aggaaro ba azinaas macho oothada immasu. <verse eid="GEN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Abramey Aggaaro ekis, iyaka qanthatasu. Iya baw qanthatidaysa erida wode ba godatiw kadhasu.<verse eid="GEN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Soora Abrameko, “Ha qohuwas tana gathiday nena; taani ta aylliw new immin, iya qanthatidysa be7ada tana kadhawusu. Nebaanne tabaa Goday pirdo” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Abramey Soorako, “Hanno be7a ne aylliw iya ne kushena; nena lo77idaba ootha” yaagis. Hessafe guye, Soora Aggaaro un7ethin yaape keyada baqatasu.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Godaa kiitanchoy Aggaaro mela biittan, pulto haatha matan demmis; he pultoy shuura biitta efiya ogiya matan de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Kiitanchoy Aggaaro, “Soora ayllete, Aggaare, awupe yadii? Awu bay?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Aggaara zaarada, “Taani ta godate Soorape baqatas” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Godaa kiitanchoy iiko, “Ne godateko simma bada iw haareta” yaagidi odis. <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/>Gujidika Godaa kiitanchoy iiko, “Ne yeletetha oonika taybanaw danda7onnaada oothada darsana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>Qassika Godaa kiitanchoy iyo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 16:11"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">“Heko neeni qanthatadasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">Neeni adde na7a yelana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">Xoossay ne waasuwa si7ida gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">Iya neeni Isma7eela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isma7eela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan “Xoossay si7ees” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthana<verse eid="GEN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>I bazzo hare mela gidana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">I ba qesiya asa ubba bolla denthana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">Qassi asa ubbayka banta qesiya iya bolla denthana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:12">I ba ishata ubbara ixon de7ana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 16:12">yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Aggaara baara odetida Godaa, “Neeni Tana Be7iya Xoossa” yaagada xeegasu. “Taani tana be7eysa be7as” yaagasu. <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Hessafe dendoysan he pulto haathay, “Tana Be7iya De7o Xoossa Pultuwa” geetetidi xeegetis. He haatha pultoy Qaadesapenne Bareedape giddon de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Aggaara Abrames adde na7a yelasu; Abramey yeletida na7a Isma7eela gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Aggaara Abrames Isma7eela yeliya wode Abrames laythi hospun tammanne usupuna.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Qaxaroy Qaala Caaquwas Malla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Abrames laythi uddufun tammanne uddufuna gidiya wode, Goday iyaw qoncidi, “Taani Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossa, taw kiiteta, ta sinthan polo gida. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>Ta giddoninne ne giddon de7iya caaquwa ta minthana; ne zeretha ta taybanaw danda7etonada oothana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Abramey ba som7uwara sa7an duge gufannin Xoossay iyako, <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>“Heko ta new caaqiya caaqoy haysa; ne daro kawotethatas aawa gidana. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>Ta nena daro kawotethatas aawa oothana gisho hizape ne sunthay Abrame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abrame: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan Abrame guussay bonchetida aawa guussu.</char></note> gidi xeegetenna, shin ne sunthay Abrahaame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abrahaame: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan Abrahaame guussay daro deriyas woyko kawotethatas aawa guussu.</char></note> gidi xeegetana. <verse eid="GEN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>Taani ne yeletetha darsana, ta nena daro dere kessana, kawoti neepe keyana. <verse eid="GEN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>Taani newunne neepe guyen ne sheeshas Xoosse gidana mela merina caaquwa ta giddoninne ne giddon, neepe guyera yaa ne sheesha giddon, yeletethafe yeletetha gakanaw ta caaqas. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>Neeni ha77i bete gidada de7iya Kanaane biitta ubba newunne neepe guyera yaa ne sheeshas merina laata gidana mela new immana; qassi taani enta Xoossa gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Qassika Xoossay Abrahaame, “Nena gidiko ta caaquwa naaga; neka neepe guyera yaa ne sheeshati, yeletethafe yeletetha gakanaw naagite. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/>Ta gidduwaninne ne gidduwan, neepe guyera yaa ne sheesha giddon hinte naagana caaqoy haysa; hinte gidduwan de7iya adde ubbay qaxareto. <verse eid="GEN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>Hinte addetetha koohuwa dookalite; hessi ta giddoninne hinte giddon de7iya caaquwas malla gidana. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Hizape yaana yeletethan adde nayti ubbay yeletida hospuntho gallasan qaxareto. Ne son yeletidaysata gidin, woyko allagape miishen shametida aylleta gidin, ne zerethafe gidonayisata dookala. <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>Ne son yeletidaysata gidin woyko miishen shametidaysati qaxaretanaw bessees. Haysan hinte ashuwan de7iya ta caaqoy merina caaqo gidana. <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Oonika qaxaretona de7iya adde asi ubbay ta caaquwa menthida gisho ba asaape duuxo” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Xoossay Abrahaameko, “Hizape ne mache sunthay Soora gidi xeegetofo; hachife doomidi I sunthay Saara geeteto. <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>Taani iyo anjana; taani iipe new adde na7a immana. Taani iyo anjana gisho iya kawotethatas aayo gidana; deriya kawoti iipe keyana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Abrahaamey ba som7uwara sa7an gufannidi, “Hay asaw, xeetu laytha asi na7a yelanee? Uddufun tammu laythi gidida Saarika na7a yelanee?” yaagidi ba wozanan miicis. <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>Abrahaamey Xoossako, “Isma7eeli tana laattana mela ne iya anjarki” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Shin Xoossay, “Akay, ne machiya Saara new adde na7a yelana, neeni iya Yisaaqa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yisaaqa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntha birshethay “I miicees” guussu </char></note> gada sunthana. Taani iyape guyera yaa iya zerethas merina caaqo gidana mela iyara ta caaquwa caaqana. <verse eid="GEN 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>Isma7eelaba ne tana oychida oysha si7as. Taani iyaka anjana. Ta iya ayfisana, iya yeletetha loytha darsana. I tammanne nam7u haareysatas aawa gidana. Taani iya gita kawotethi kessana. <verse eid="GEN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>Shin ta caaquwa wonto laythi hanoode Saara new yeliya na7a Yisaaqara caaqana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Xoossay Abrahaamera odetidi ongidaape guye iyape shaaketidi pude bis.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>He gallas Abrahaamey ba na7a Isma7eela, ba son yeletidaysatanne ba miishen shammidaysata, ba son de7iya adde asa ubba Xoossay iya kiitidaysada qaxaris <verse eid="GEN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Abrahaamey qaxaretiya wode iyaw laythi uddufun tammanne uddufuna. <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>Iya na7ay Isma7eeli qaxaretiya wode tammanne heedzu laytha na7a. <verse eid="GEN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26"/>Abrahaameynne iya na7a Isma7eeli nam7atika he gallas qaxaretidosona. <verse eid="GEN 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27"/>Abrahaame son de7iya adde ubbay, iya son yeletidaysatinne miishen shammetidaysati ubbay iyara qaxaretidosona.<verse eid="GEN 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Heedzu Imathata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>Abrahaamey Mamire gita mithata garsan ba dunkaaniya pengen seeta gallas uttidashin Goday iyaw qoncis. <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>Abrahaamey dhoqu gidi xeelliya wode iya matan eqida heedzu asata be7is. I enta be7idi entara gahetanaw ba dunkaaniya pengefe dendidi entako woxi bidi enta sinthan ziggis. <verse eid="GEN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>Yaani simmidi, “Abeeti ta godaw, ta ne sinthan saba demmidaba gidiko tana ne aylliya aggada aadhofa. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>Guutha haathi yiiko hinte tohoy meecetiko ha mitha kuyan shempi ekite. <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>Hinte taako hinte aylliyako yida gisho xaalidi hinte biya bessi baana mela taani hintew miyaba ehana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Entika, “Daro lo77o, ne gidaysada ootha” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Abrahaamey ellesidi Saariko dunkaaniya giddo gelidi, “Ellesada heedzu gabate lo77o dhiille eka munuqada uythu uuka” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Abrahaamey qassi ba meheta giddo woxi bidi lo77o buldubulda mara dooridi ba issi aylliyas immin I ellesidi shukidi giigisis. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Yaatidi Abrahaamey meqa maathinne giigisida mara ashuwa imathata sinthe aathis; enti mishin I mitha garsan enta matan eqis.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Enti Abrahaameko, “Ne machiya Saara awunee?” yaagidi oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Ika, “Hini dunkaaniya giddona” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Goday iyako, “Wonto laythi hannoode tuma ta neeko simmana; ne machiya Saara adde na7a yelana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Saara he wode iyape guye baggara de7iya dunkaaniya pengen eqada hessa si7awusu. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Abrahaameynne Saari banta laythan daro cimidosona. Saara na7a yeliya wodepe aadhasu. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>Hessa gisho, Saara ba wozanan, “Taaninne ta goday nam7ayka cimidaape guye waanidi ha ufaysay hananee?” yaagada miicasu.<verse eid="GEN 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Goday Abrahaameko, “ ‘Taani cimidaape guye na7a yelane’ gada Saara ayis miicay? <verse eid="GEN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/>Godaas danda7etonabay tuma de7iyee? Ta new gidaysada wonto laythi hannoode ta simmada yaana; he wode Saara adde na7a yelana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Saara yashetida gisho, “Taani miicabike” gada lahasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Shin I, “Ne tuma miicadasa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abrahaamey Soodomes Gaannatis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Asati baanaw dendishe Soodome duge xeellidosona. Abrahaamey entana moyzanaw entara keyis. <verse eid="GEN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>Xoossay iyako, “ta oothanaw haniyaba Abrahaamepe qosaneyee? <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>Abrahaamey tuma gitanne wolqaama kawotethi gidana. Ha biitta kawotethati ubbay iyan anjetana. <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>Xillotethinne suure pirda oothidi Godaa ogiya naagana mela ba naytanne iyape guyera yaa ba soo asaa zorana mela taani iya dooras. Hessika, Xoossay Abrahaames immana gida ufaysa polanaasa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Goday Abrahaameko, “Soodome bollanne Gamoora bolla waassiya waasoy daris; enta nagarayka daro deexis. <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>Hessa gisho, enta oosoy enta waasuwa meleko be7anaw taani duge wodhana; qassi hessa mela iita gidonaako shaaka erana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Hessafe guye, nam7u asati Soodomeko simmidi bidosona, shin Abrahaamey Godaa sinthan eqidasuwan de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Abrahaamey Godaako shiiqidi, “Tuma neeni xillota iitatara issife dhaysannee? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>He katamen ishatamu xillo asati de7iko ne dhaysannee? Yan de7iya ishatamu xillo asata gisho he katama ashshikii? <verse eid="GEN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>Hessa mela oosoy neepe haako; xilluwa iitaara woli gathada wodheysi, xilluwanne iita issi ayfiyan xeeleysi neepe haako. Ha biitta ubba pirdiya neeni xillo pirdikii?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>Goday, “Ta Soodomen ishatamu xillota demmiyako he bessa ubba enta gisho gada ashshana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Abrahaamey zaaridi, “Taani biittanne bido gidada ta Godaara odetanaw minetakichas; <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>ishatamu xillotape ichashati pacikochii? Neeni he ichashata gisho gada he katama ubba dhaysaneyee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Goday, “Taani oytamanne ichashu xillota demmiko he katama dhaysike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Abrahaamey zaaridi, “Yan oytamu xalaali de7ikochii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Ika, “Oytamata gisho gada he katama dhaysike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Qassika Abrahaamey zaaridi, “Hay ta Godaw, tana hanqetofa, taani gujadaka odetana. Hastamu xalaali de7ikochii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Goday zaaridi, “Taani yan hastamu demmiko dhaysike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Abrahaamey, “Taani Godaara odetanaw minetakichas; ooni eri yan laatamu xalaali de7ikochi” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Godayka, “He laatamata gisho gada dhaysike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Abrahaamey qassika, “Hay ta Godaw, tana hanqetofa ta issi toho odetana, yan tammu xalaala demmikochii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Ika, “Tammata gisho gada taani he katama dhaysike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>Goday Abrahaamera odetidi ongidaape guye bis; Abrahaameyka ba soo simmis.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Soodomenne Gamoora Dhayuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Nam7u kiitanchoti omarsishin Soodome katamaa gakidosona. He wode Looxey he katamaa pengen uttis. Looxey enta be7idi mokanaw dendidi entako bis. Ba som7uwa sa7a gathidi entaw ziggis. <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>I entako, “Ta godato, hinte aylliya soo gelerketi, hinte tohuwa meecetidi qamma haysan aqite; wonta guura hinte biya bessi biite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Enti, “Akay, nuuni ha katamaa dabaaban aqana” yaagidi zaaridosona.<verse eid="GEN 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Shin I enta minthi woossida gisho bidi iya soo gelidosona. I entaw uythi uukidi aathin midosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Enti zin7ana hanishin Soodome katama adde asa ubbay na7atethinne dondzi issoyka attona yidi keethaa yuuyi aadhidosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>Enti Looxe xeegidi, “Hachi omarsi ne soo gelida adde asati awun de7oona? Nuuni entara gahetana mela enta nuuko kare kessa” yaagidosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Yaatin Looxey entara odetanaw kare keyishe pengiya guyera gordidi, <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>entako, “Ta dabboto, hayyana ha iita oosuwa oothopite. <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>Taw adde eronna nam7u geela7oti de7oosona. Taani enta hintew kare kessiko hinte koydaba oothite. Shin haysati ta imathe gidiya gisho ta kaarape garsan de7oosona; ha asata bolla aybibaaka oothopite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Asati, “Nu sinthafe gede kicha” yaagidosona. Qassi, “Ha addey baw bete asi shin, nu bolla pirdanaw koyees? Nuuni enta bolla oothanaw koyida iitaape aathidi ne bolla oothana” yaagidosona. Enti Looxe guye sugi yeggidi pengiya menthanaw shiiqidosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Shin nam7u asati banta kushiya kare yeddidi Looxe soo goochi gelsidi pengiya gordidosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Hessafe guye, enti keetha pengey de7iyasuwa demmona mela guuthafe gita gakanaw qooqisidosona.<verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>He nam7u asati Looxeko, “New haysan adde na7i woyko macca na7i, ne macca nayta oychiday woyko hara dabboy ha kataman de7ii? De7iko entana haysafe kessa. <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>Ayis giiko, nu ha katama dhaysanaw hanoos. Enta bolla waassiya waasoy Godaa sinthan gita gidiya gisho ha katama dhaysana mela Goday nuna kiittis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Yaatin Looxey ba macca nayta oychidaysatako bidi, “Goday, ha katama dhaysana haniya gisho ellessidi ha bessaafe keyte” yaagis. Shin iya macca nayta oychidaysati I qelqisees gidi qopidosona.<verse eid="GEN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Sa7i wontanaw gontey zo77iya wode he kiitanchoti Looxeko, “Denda, ne machiwnne haysan de7iya ne nam7u nayta ekada ellesada keya. Akay giiko, ha katamay pirdetiya wode neka dhayasa” yaagi dirgisidosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>Shin Looxey keyanaw gam7in, Goday iyaw qadhetida gisho, he kiitanchoti iya kushiya, iya mache kushiyanne nam7u nayta kushiya oykidi he katamaape kessidosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Kiitanchoti enta kessida mela he kiitanchotape issoy, “Hinte shempuwa ekidi baqatite! Guye xeellofite! Ha heeran awunka eqofite! Hinte dhayona mela zamaako baqatite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Shin Looxey entako, “Hay ta godato, yaagopite. <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>Taani hinte aylley hinte sinthan saba demmida gisho tana ashshanaw taw daro qadhetideta. Shin taani zumako baqatanaw danda7ike; ha dhayoy gakidi tana dhaysana. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>Heko, haysan issi katami de7ees; yaa woxidi baanaw matanne guutha katama. Ta shempuwa ashshanaw ta yaa baqato? I daro guutha katama gidennee?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Kiitanchoy, “Lo77o! Taani ne woosa ekas; he ne odida katamaa dhaysike. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>He katamaako ellesada baqata; ne yaa gakanaw ta aybibaaka oothike” yaagis. Hessa gisho, he katamaa sunthay Zo7aare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zo7aare: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay “Guutha” guussu.</char></note> geetetis.<verse eid="GEN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Looxey Zo7aare gakiya wode buroo xalqey caares. <verse eid="GEN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Goday he wode salope tamanne xuuggiya diine Soodome bollanne Gamoora bolla bukisis. <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/>Hessada oothidi Goday he katamata, heera ubba, katamatan de7iyaba ubbaa he biittan de7iya mithaanne maata dhaysis. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Shin Looxe machiya guye simma xeellada maxine shuchu gidasu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Wontetha gallas wonta guura Abrahaamey dendidi kase I Godaa sinthan eqida bessaa bis. <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>I Soodomenne Gamoora, he heeran de7iya biitta ubbaa duge xeelliya wode xuussa tamada cuyay biittafe dendeysa be7is.<verse eid="GEN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Xoossay he heeran de7iya katamata dhaysiya wode Abrahaame qopidi, Looxey de7iya katamata dhaysidi, Looxe dhayope ashshis.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Looxenne Iya Macca Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Looxey Zo7aaren daanaw yashetida gisho, yaape dendidi ba macca nayta nam7atara zuma bolla keyis. Yan gongolo giddon ba nam7u macca naytara de7is. <verse eid="GEN 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Issi gallas bayra na7iya ba kaalo micheko, “Nu aaway cimis, biitta ubban de7iya wogaatho nuura aqanaw issi addey haysan baawa. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Yaaniya gisho, haaya! Nu aawa ushshu ushshidi, iyara aqidi, nu aawape nuus koche ashshos” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>He wode qamma banta aawa ushshu ushshidosona. Bayra na7iya gelada iyara aqasu. Iya iyara aqiya wodenne dendiya wode I eribeenna.<verse eid="GEN 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Wontetha wode bayriya kaaliw, “Zine qamma taani ta aawara aqas; hachi qammaka iya ushshu ushshiko, neka gelada iyara aqa. Yaatidi nuuni nu aawape koche ashshos” yaagasu. <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>He wode qamma banta aawa ushshu ushshidosona. Kaalo na7iya gelada iyara aqasu. Ha77ika iya iyara aqiya wodenne dendiya wode I eribeenna.<verse eid="GEN 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Yaatidi Looxe macca nayti nam7ay banta aawape qanthatidosona. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Bayriya adde na7a yelasu; iya sunthaa Moo7abe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Moo7abe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha sunthaa birshethay “Ta aawape” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu. I hachi gakanaw Moo7abeta mayza. <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>Kaaliyaka adde na7a yelasu; iya sunthaa Beni7aama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Beni7aama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha sunthay “Ta asata woyko ta dabbota na7aa” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu. I hachi gakanaw Amooneta mayza.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Abrahaamenne Abimeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Abrahaamey Mamirepe dendidi Negebe mela biitta heera bidi Qaadesapenne Shura biittatas gidduwan de7is. Geraaranka guutha wode gam7is. <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>Yan de7ishe Abrahaamey ba machiw Saaro, “Iya ta michiw” yaagida gisho, Geraara kawoy Abimelekey kiittidi Saaro baako efis. <verse eid="GEN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Shin Xoossay issi qamma amuhon Abimelekeko yidi, “Neeni ehida macaase gaason hayqaasa, iya azinara de7awusu” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Hanoshin, Abimelekey iyo bochibeenna. I, “Godaw, neeni tananne ta derey qohonna de7ishin coo dhaysaneyee? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>I, ‘Iya, ta micho’ gibeennee? Qassi iyaka, ‘I, ta isha’ gabikee? Taani ta wozana xillotethaninne ta kushe geeshshatethan haysa oothas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Xoossay amuhon iyako, “Ee, neeni ne wozana xillotethan oothidaysa ta erayis. Hessa gisho, neeni iyo bochonaadanne ta sinthan nagara oothonnaada nena taani teqas. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>Ha77i ha addiya machiw zaara. I nabe gidiya gisho, new Xoossa woossiko ne attana. Shin iyo zaarona ixiko, neeninne new de7iyaba ubbay hayqanaysa era” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Abimelekey wontetha gallas daro guura ba moorinnata baako xeegis. He hanidaba ubba entaw odin enti daro babidosona. <verse eid="GEN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>Yaatin Abimelekey Abrahaame xeegidi, “Neeni aybiba nu bolla oothadii? Ne ta bollanne ta kawotetha bolla haysa mela qoho ehanaw ta new ay iitaba oothadina? Neeni ta bolla oosetanaw bessonnaba oothadasa” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Qassi Abimelekey Abrahaame, “Neeni haysa ayis oothadii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Abrahaamey zaaridi, “ ‘Ha bessan Xoossas yashetiya asi bayna gishonne qassi ta mache gaason enti tana wodhana’ gada qopida gishosa. <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Hessa bolla iya tumaka ta micho; iya ta aawa na7ape attishin ta aaye na7a giduku, yaaniya gisho, iya ta macho gidasu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Xoossay tana ta aawa keethafe kessida wode taani iiko, ‘Neeni bida biitta ubban ne taw oothana keehatethay haysa; “I ta isha” gada’ oda yaagas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Hessafe guye, Abimelekey dorse, mehe, macca aylletanne adde aylleta kessidi Abrahaames immis; iya machiw Saaro iyaw zaaris. <verse eid="GEN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>Abimelekey Abrahaameko, “Heko, ta biittay haysish nena lo77oson de7a” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>Saariko, “Taani ne ishas issi mukulu bira santime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Issi mukulu bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hessi tammanne issinni kilo giraame deexiya walahi bayna bira.</char></note> immayis. Hessi neera de7iya ubba sinthan neeni xillo gideysanne aybi iitabaka oothonaysa eriseysa gido” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 20:16"/><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17-18"/>Goday Abrahaame mache Saari gaason Abimeleke keetha ubba maynisida gisho Abrahaamey Xoossa woossin, Abimelekey, iya machiyanne iya macca aylleti na7a yelana mela Xoossay enta pathis.<verse eid="GEN 20:17-18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqa Yeletetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>Goday ba odidaysada Saaro anjis; ba gelida qaalaka polis. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/>Saara qanthatada Xoossay gida wodey gakin cimida Abrahaames adde na7a yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Abrahaamey Saara yelida na7a suntha Yisaaqa gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>Abrahaamey ba na7a Yisaaqa Xoossay kiitidaysada yeletida hospuntho gallasan qaxaris. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Iya na7a Yisaaqi yeletiya wode, Abrahaames laythi xeeta. <verse eid="GEN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Saara, “Xoossay taw miiche immis; qassi haysa si7iya ubbay taara miicana” yaagasu. <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>Qassika Saara, “Saara Abrahaames na7a yelada dhanthana giday oonee? Gidikoka taani ha7i iyaw I cimida wode na7a yelas” yaagasu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Miiche: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Yisaaqa” guussay “I miicees” guussu.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isma7eelanne Aggaari Goodetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Guutha na7ay diccidi; dhanthi duuthis; Abrahaamey Yisaaqi dhanthi duuthida gallas wolqaama gibira giigisis. <verse eid="GEN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Shin Gibxefe yida Aggaara Abrahaames yelida na7ay Yisaaqa toochishin Saara be7asu. <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>Saara Abrahaameko, “Ha aylle na7ay ta na7a Yisaaqara ubbaka laattonna gisho, gadhindiwunne I na7aa kessada goodda” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>He oday ba na7a bochiya gisho, Abrahaamey daro metootis. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Shin Xoossay Abrahaame, “Ne kochay Yisaaqa baggara xeegetana gisho ne na7aasinne ne ayllees daro metootopa; Saara new odiyaba ubba si7a. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>Qassi ika ne koche gidiya gisho aylle na7a taani iya gita dere oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Wonta guura Abrahaamey dendidi guutha kathinne koddan haathe kunthidi, Aggaaro toossidi, I na7a iyo idinthidi kessi goodis. Iya bada, Barsaabe mela biittan daaburasu. <verse eid="GEN 21:14"/><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15-16"/>Haathay koddaafe wurida wode iya, “Na7ay hayqishin, uttada be7ike” gada, na7a issi buure garsan yeggada, nam7u xeetu wadha gideysa mela bada utta aggasu. Yan uttada, ba qaala dhoqu oothada yeekasu.<verse eid="GEN 21:15-16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Xoossay na7a waasuwa si7is. Xoossa kiitanchoy Aggaaro salope xeegidi, “Aggaare, waanadii? Xoossay na7a yeehuwa si7ida gisho babofa; <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>danda eqada, na7a denthada ne kushiyan oyka; taani iya gita dere oothana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Xoossay iyo haatha olla bessin, bada koddan haathe kunthada na7aa ushshasu. <verse eid="GEN 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>Na7ay dicciya wode ubban, Xoossay iyara gidis. I mela biittan de7idi, dongen dukiya ase gidis. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/>I Paarana mela biittan de7ishin, iya aayiya Gibxefe iyaw macho immasu.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarotetha Caaqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>He wode, Abimelekey, ba toora mocona Fikoolara Abrahaameko bidi, “Neeni oothiyaba ubban Xoossay neera de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>Neeni ta bolla woyko ta nayta bolla woyko ta zeretha bolla cimmada gene oothonna mela, ha7i haysan, Xoossa sinthan taw caaqa. Taani new keehidaysada, neenika taasinne neeni betetethan de7ida ha biittees keeha” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Abrahaamey, “Taani caaqayis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>He wode, Abrahaamey Abimeleke aylleti ekida haatha ollaba Abimelekes maggannis. <verse eid="GEN 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Shin Abimelekey, “Hessa ooni oothidaako taani erike. Neenika qassi taw odabaaka; taani hachi gakanaw hessa si7abike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Hessafe guye, Abrahaamey dorsatanne miizata ehidi, Abimelekes immin, enti nam7ay caaqidosona. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Abrahaamey laapun uzzo dorsata wudiyape shaakis; <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Abimelekey Abrahaame, “Ha neeni dumma shaaka wothida laapun uzzo dorsata ayis shaakadii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Abrahaamey, “Taani ha haatha olla bookidaysas marka gidana mela, ha laapun uzzo dorsata taape eka” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Hessan he nam7u asati caaqida gisho, he bessay Barsaabe (Caaqo Haatha Olla woyko Laapun Haatha Olla).<verse eid="GEN 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>Barsaaben caaquwa caaqidaape guye, Abimelekeynne iya toora moconay Fikooli dendidi, Filisxeeme biitta simmidosona. <verse eid="GEN 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Abrahaamey Barsaaben tamarsiik geetetiya mithi tokis. Hessan Godaa, Merina Xoossa xeegidi iyaw goyinnis. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Abrahaamey Filisxeeme biittan daro wode de7is.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Abrahaame Paacetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossay Abrahaame paacis; iya, “Abrahaame” yaagidi xeegis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">I, “Yee” gidi koyis.<verse eid="GEN 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Xoossay, “Neeni dosiya ne issi na7a Yisaaqa ekada, Mooriya biitta ba. Yan taani nena bessiya issi dere bolla iya xuussa yarsho oothada taw yarsha” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Wontetha gallas Abrahaamey guura dendidi, ba hariya caanis. Ba aylletape nam7atanne ba na7a Yisaaqa baara ekidi, xuussa yarshuwas gidiya mitha qeri ekidi, Xoossi iya bessiya bessi baanaw dendis. <verse eid="GEN 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Heedzantho gallas Abrahaamey dhoqu gidi, he bessa haahora be7is. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>Abrahaamey ba aylleta, “Hinte hariyara haysan de7ishite. Taara ta na7aara ya bidi Xoossas goyinnidi, hinteko simmana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Abrahaamey yarshuwa mitha denthidi, ba na7a Yisaaqa toossis. I baw tamanne mashshe oykis. Enti nam7ay issife bishin; <verse eid="GEN 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Yisaaqi ba aawa Abrahaame, “Ta aawaw” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Abrahaamey, “Yee, ta na7aw” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Yisaaqi, “Tamaynne mithay haysish; shin xuussa yarsho urge dorsay awunee?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Yaatin Abrahaamey, “Ta na7aw, xuussa yarsho urge dorsa Xoossay baw immana” yaagis. Yaagin enti nam7ay issife bidosona.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>Enti Xoossay iyaw odida bessa gakida wode, Abrahaamey yan yarsho bessi giigisidi, mithi hiixis. Ba na7a Yisaaqa qachidi, he mitha bolla zin7isis. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Abrahaamey ba na7a shukanaw ba kushiya yeddidi mashshe ekis. <verse eid="GEN 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>Shin Godaa Kiitanchoy salope, “Abrahaame, Abrahaame” yaagidi xeegis. I, “Yee” yaagidi koyis.<verse eid="GEN 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Kiitanchoy, “Na7a bolla ne kushiya wothofa; iya aybibaaka oothofa. Neeni ne issi na7aa tana diggona gisho, neeni Xoossas yayyeysa taani erayis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Abrahaamey dhoqu gidi xeellis; heko kacey turan qaxetida issi dorsi de7eysa be7is. Abrahaamey bidi he dorsa ekidi, ba na7a bessan xuussa yarsho oothidi yarshis. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Hessa gisho, Abrahaamey, “Goday immana” gidi he bessa sunthis. Hachi gakanaw hessi, “Godaa zuma bolla imetana” geetetees.<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Godaa kiitanchoy saluwape nam7antho Abrahaame xeegidi, <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>“Taani Goday, haysada gada taani ta huuphen new caaqayis; neeni haysa oothida gishonne ne issi na7aa tana diggona gisho, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>taani nena tuma anjana. Ne zeretha taani salo xoolinto melanne abba gaxan de7iya shafe mela oothana. Ne zerethati banta morketa katamata laattana. <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/>Neeni taw kiitetida gisho, ha sa7a kawotethati ubbay ne zeretha baggara anjetana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>Hessafe guye, Abrahaamey ba aylletako guye simmin, enti ubbay issife Barsaabe dendidi bidosona. Abrahaamey Barsaaben de7is.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nakooranne Iya Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Hessafe guye, Abrahaames, “Milka ne isha Naakoras nayta yelasu; <verse eid="GEN 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>entika bayray Uxa; Uxa ishati Buza, <verse eid="GEN 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>Araame aawa Qameela, Kesada, Haazo, Pildasha, Yidlaafanne Batu7eela geetetoosona” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Ha hospun nayta Milka Abrahaame isha Naakoras yelasu. Batu7eeli Irbiqa yelis. <verse eid="GEN 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Re7uma geetetiya iya nam7antho maccasiya qassi Xeba, Gahaama, Tahasanne Maka yelasu.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Saari Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Saara xeetanne laatamanne laapun laythi de7asu. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>Hessafe guye, iya Kanaane biittan de7iya Qiriyaat-Arba (Kebroona) kataman hayqasu. Abrahaamey Saaris yeekisinne kayotis.<verse eid="GEN 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Yeeki simmidi, Abrahaamey ba mache aha matape dendidi bidi, Hiteta haysada yaagis; <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>“Taani hinte giddon imathe; ta mache aha mooganaw taw hinte gadiyape duufo bessi bayzerketi” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5-6"/>Hiteti Abrahaame, “Godaw, nuuni odeysa si7a; neeni nu giddon wolqaama halaqa; neeni ne mache aha nu duufuwape nena lo77idason mooga; neeni ne mache aha mooganaw ba duufuwa oonika nena diggenna” yaagi zaaridosona.<verse eid="GEN 23:5-6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Abrahaamey dendi eqidi, Hiteta sinthan ziggis. <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8-9"/>I entako, “Hinte tana, ‘Ne mache aha mooga’ giiko, taani giyaba si7ite. Zohaara na7a Efroonas iya gadiya gaxan de7iya Makifeela geetetiya gongoluwa ta duufo oothanaw bayzana mela kumetha gaten nuna zal7iserketi” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 23:8-9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Hite addiya Efrooni he wode katama pengen shiiqida ba asa giddon uttis. Hiteti ubbay si7ishin, Abrahaameko yaagis; <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>“Hessada gidenna; ta godaw, ta odeysa si7a; taani gadiyaka iya giddon de7iya gongoluwaka new immayis; taani new iya ta asa sinthan immayis; neeni ne mache aha mooga” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Abrahaamey he biitta asa sinthan zaari ziggidi, <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>asay si7ishin Efroona, “Ta odeysa si7arki! Taani he gadiya gate qanxana; neeni taape ekarki. Hessan taani ta mache aha moogana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14-15"/>Efrooni Abrahaameko zaaridi, “Ta godaw, taani odeysa si7a; gadey oyddu xeetu bira santime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14-15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Oyddu xeetu bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haysi oyddu kilo giraamenne bagga deexiya walahi bayna bira.</char></note> kessana; shin hessi ne giddoninne ta giddon aybika gidenna; ne mache aha mooga” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 23:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Abrahaamey Hiteti si7ishin, Efrooni gida gatiya ekis; he wode miishen oyddu xeetu bira santime Efroonas immis.<verse eid="GEN 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Yaati simmidi, Mamire katama matan Makifeelan de7iya Efroona gadey, yan de7iya gongoloynne he gadiyan de7iya mitha ubbay, <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>katama pengen shiiqida Hiteta ubba sinthan wogatho Abrahaame gade gidis.<verse eid="GEN 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Hessafe guye, Abrahaamey ba machiw Saara Kanaane biittan (Kebroona) geetetiya Mamire katama matan de7iya Makifeela geetetiya gade gongoluwan moogis. <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Hessa gisho, he gadeynne yan de7iya gongoloy Hiteta sinthan higgiyan Abrahaames duufo gidis.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqi Macho Ekuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Abrahaamey daro cimis. Goday iya ubbabanka anjis. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>Abrahaamey ba aylliya, ba soo asa ubbaas halaqatiya, ba aqo ubbaa bolla sunthetidaysa haysada yaagis, “Ne kushiyan ta gulbata oyka; <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>taani enta giddon de7ida Kanaaneta macca naytape ta na7aas macho oychonna mela, Godan, salonne sa7a Xoossa sunthan taani nena caaqisayis; <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>shin neeni ta yeletida biitta, ta dabbotako bada, ta na7a Yisaaqas macho oycha” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>Iya aylley, “He maccasiya taara yaanaw dosona ixiko, ne na7a neeni yida biitta guye efo?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Abrahaamey, “Ta na7a ay gaasonka yaa efonnaada nena era! <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/>Goday, saluwa Xoossay, tana ta aawa soopenne ta yeletida biittafe kessidaysi taw, ‘Ne zerethas taani ha biitta immana’ yaagidi caaqidaysi, neeni ta na7aas yaape macho demmana mela, I ba kiitanchuwa neepe sinthe kiittana. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>He maccasiya neera yaanaw dosona ixiko, ha taani nena caaqisida caaqoy new gome gidenna; shin ta na7a yaa ubbaka efopa” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Aylley ba godaa Abrahaame gulbata oykis; he odaas caaqis.<verse eid="GEN 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Hessafe guye, aylley ba godaa gimaletape tamma ekidi, ba godaa miishiyapeka muruuta muruuta eki bidi Masephexoome biittan Nakoora katama gakis. <verse eid="GEN 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Omarsi, maccasi haathe tikanaw yaa wode, katamaape gaxan haatha olla matan ba gimaleta gulbatisis.<verse eid="GEN 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>I woossishe, “Godaw, ta godaa Abrahaame Xoossaw, hachi taani qopada yidaysa taw giigisa; qassi ta godaa Abrahaames keehaba ootha. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>Heko, taani ha haatha pultuwa matan eqayis; ha katama macca nayti haatha tikanaw haa yoosona. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>Taani, ‘Ane otuwa ziqi oothada tana haathe ushsha’ giya wode, iya, ‘Heko uya; qassi ne gimaleta taani ushshana’ giyara, hinna ne aylliya Yisaaqas neeni dooridaro gido; neeni ta godaas keehaba oothidaysa taani hessan erana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Buroo I woosa zaarona de7ishin, Irbiqa haatha oto tookada puttu gasu. Iya Batu7eela na7a, Batu7eeli Milka na7a, Milka Abrahaame isha Nakoora machiw. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>Irbiqii daro yegelsinne adde eronna geela7o. Pultuwa duge wodhada, ba otuwa kunthada baanaw dendasu. <verse eid="GEN 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Yaanin, he aylley iiko woxi bidi iyo, “Ne tana guutha haathe ushsharki” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>Iya, “Ero ta godaw, uya” yaagasu. Ellesada otuwa ba hashepe wothada, gedi ootha oykada iya ushshasu. <verse eid="GEN 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>Iya ushshidaape guye, “Ne gimaletika alana gakanaw taani entaw haatha duuqana” yaagasu. <verse eid="GEN 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>Attida haatha ellesada gongen tigada, hara haathe duuqanaw olla woxasu; gimaleti ubbay alana gakanaw, haatha ollafe duuqa duuqa ehada gongen tigada ushshasu. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/>I qopidi yida qofa Goday injeyishe de7iyakonne eranaw addey si77i gidi iyo xeellees.<verse eid="GEN 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Gimaleti haatha uyi simmin, addey ichashu giraame bagga siidhen aathiya worqa xeetanne tammu giraame gidiya nam7u worqa sagaayota giigisis. <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>Iyo, “Neeni oodde na7ee? Ane taw oda; ne aawa son nuus aqiya bessi daanee?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>Iya, “Taani Batu7eela na7a; Batu7eeli Milka Naakoras yelida na7a. <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Nu son gidiya kaleynne harqoy de7ees; qassi hinte aqanaw bessi de7ees” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Addey gulbatidi Godaa goyinnidi, <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>haysada yaagis; “Ta godaas keeheysanne ammaneteysa aggiboonna Goday, ta godaa Abrahaame Xoossay galatetto; taani yishin, Goday tana ta godaa dabbota soo kaalethis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Na7iya woxa bada, ba aaye son de7iya asaas hanidaba odasu. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29"/>Irbiqas Laaba geetetiya ishay de7ees. Laabi kare keyidi haatha pultuwa matan de7iya addiyako woxis. <verse eid="GEN 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30"/>Siidhe worqanne ba miche kushen de7iya sagaayota be7ida wode Irbiqa addey bana gidoysa odin si7ida wode, keyidi addiyako bis. Addeyka gimaletara pultuwa matan eqidaysa demmis. <verse eid="GEN 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>Iyako, “Goday nena anjidayso, haaya, neeni karen ayis eqadii? Taani new keethenne gimaletaska besse giigisas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Yaatin addey soo gelis. Laabi gimaleta caana billidi, kalenne dhiille gimaletas immas. Toho meeccanaw iyasinne iyara de7iya asaas haathe ehis. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>Kathi iya sinthe aadhis. Shin, “Taani tana ehidaba hintew odonna de7ashe kathi miike” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Laabi, “Yaako oda” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Hessa gisho, I, “Taani Abrahaame aylliya. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/>Goday ta godaa daro anjida gisho I duretis. Dorse, miizi, bira, worqa, adde aylleta, macca aylleta, gimaletanne hareta iyaw immis. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>Ta godaa machiya Saara ba cimatetha laythan iyaw adde na7a yelasu. Yaatin I baw de7iyaba ubba iyaw immis. <verse eid="GEN 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/>Ta goday tana haysada caaqisis, ‘Taani de7iya Kanaane biitta macca naytape ta na7aas macho oychofa. <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>Shin ta aawa asaako, ta dabbotako bada ta na7aas macho oycha’ yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>Taani ta godaa, ‘Na7iya taara yaanaw dosona ixikochi?’ yaagada oychas. <verse eid="GEN 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>Ika, taani iya sinthan kiitetida Goday ba kiitanchuwa kiittana; neeni ta na7aas ta aawa asaape, ta kochaafe macho demmana mela, ne beysaka injeyana. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Neeni ta kochatako bin, enti new iyo immonna ixiko, he wode new caaqoy gome gidenna” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>“Taani hachi he pultuwako yaa wode yaagas; ‘Godaw, ta godaa Abrahaame Xoossaw, ne shene gidiko, taani biya allalliya giigisa. <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>Heko, taani ha pultuwa matan eqayis; geela7o issinniya haathe tikanaw yiiko, taani iyo, tana ne otuwape guutha haathe ushsharki’ yaagana. <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>Iya, ‘Ero uya, qassi ne gimaletaska taani haathe duuqana’ giyara, Goday ta godaa na7aas dooridaro gido” yaagas.<verse eid="GEN 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>“Taani ta wozanan wooseysa zaarona de7ishin, Irbiqa ba otuwa tookada, puttu gasu; pultuwa duge wodhada haatha duuqasu; taani iyo, ‘Tana haathe ushsharki’ yaagas.<verse eid="GEN 24:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>“Yaagin iya ellesada ba hashiyape otuwa wothada, ‘Heko uya; qassi taani ne gimaleta ushshana’ yaagasu. Yaatin taani uyas; qassi ta gimaleta iya ushshasu.<verse eid="GEN 24:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>“Taani iyo, ‘Neeni oodde na7ee?’ yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">“Iya zaarada, ‘Taani Batu7eela na7aa; Batu7eeli, Milka Naakoras yelida na7a’ yaagasu. Taani worqa I siidhen, sagaayota I kushen aathas. <verse eid="GEN 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>Hessafe guye, taani gulbatada, Godaas goyinnas. Taani Godaa, ta godaa Abrahaame Xoossa, ta godaa isha na7a na7iw iya na7aas ekanaw tana like ogiya kaalethidaysas galatayis. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Ha77ika hinte ta godaas keehanabanne ammanetanaba gidiko, taw odite; gidonna ixikoka odite; hessafe guye taani hananaba erana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Laabinne Batu7eeli zaaridi yaagidosona; “Ha oday Godaape yis; nuuni yaa haa gaanaw danda7oko. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>Irbiqo hanno be7a; ekada ba; Goday gidaysada ne godaa na7aas macho gido” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 24:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Abrahaame aylley enti giyaba si7ida wode, sa7an gulbatidi Godaas goyinnis. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Aylley bira alleeqo, worqa alleeqo, ma7onne kessidi Irbiqas immis. Qassi al7o miisheta I ishaasinne I aayes immis.<verse eid="GEN 24:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Hessafe guye, inne iyara de7eysati midosona uyidosona; yan aqidosona. Enti guura dendin, I, “Tana ta godaako yeddite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>Yaatin I ishaynne I aayiya, “Na7iya issi tammu gallasa mela nuura tako, hessafe guye iya baana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 24:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Shin I, “Goday ta yidaysa injeyin, hinte tana gam7isopite. Taani ta godaako baana mela tana moyzite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 24:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>Enti, “Na7iw xeegidi ane iyo oychoos” yaagidosona. <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>Irbiqa xeegidi, “Ha addiyara baanee?” yaagidi oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Iya, “Ee; taani baana” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 24:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>Yaanin, enti banta michiw Irbiqa, iyo dichidaaro, Abrahaame aylliyanne iya asata moyzidosona. <verse eid="GEN 24:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>Enti Irbiqa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">“Nu miche Irbiqe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">mukulupe mukulu gakanaw dara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">ne kochay banta morketa katamata laatto”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 24:60">yaagidi anjidosona. <verse eid="GEN 24:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Hessafe guye, Irbiqinne I macca aylleti dendidi, gimaleta toggidi, addiyara bidosona. Yaatin aylley Irbiqa ekidi bis.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>He wode Yisaaqi, “Tana Be7iya De7o Xoossa Pultuwa” geetetiya pultuwa mata bidi, Negebe mela biittan de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Issi gallas omarsi Yisaaqi ba wozanan qopishe demba keyidi yuuyees; I dhoqu gidi xeelliya wode, gimaleti yeyisata be7is. <verse eid="GEN 24:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Irbiqaka dhoqu gada xeelliya wode, Yisaaqa be7asu; gimaletape wodhasu. <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>Abrahaame aylliyako, “Ha nuura gahetanaw dembara yaa addey oonee?” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Aylley, “I, ta godaa” yaagis. Iya ba laxana ekada guuluntasu.<verse eid="GEN 24:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Qassi aylley ba oothidaba ubba Yisaaqas odis. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Yisaaqi Irbiqa ba aaye Saara dunkaaniya giddo efis. Iyo machis; iyaka iyaw macho gidasu. I iyo dosis; ba aaye kayuwa wothis.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Abrahaame Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Abrahaamey Keexura geetetiya hara macho ekis. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/>Iya Zimiraana, Yoqsaana, Madaane, Midiyaame, Yasboqanne Siwa iyaw yelasu.<verse eid="GEN 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Yoqsaani Saabanne Dedaana yelis. Dedaani Ashooreta, Lexusetanne Le7umata yelis.<verse eid="GEN 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Midiyaame nayti Gefera, Efera, Henooha, Abidanne Elda. Haysati ubbay Keexura sheeshata.<verse eid="GEN 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/>Abrahaamey babaa ubbaa Yisaaqa laatisis. <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>Shin I paxa de7ishe, hara machetape yelida nayta baw de7iyabaape woytis. Ba na7a Yisaaqape enta shaakidi, doloha bagga biitta yeddis.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Abrahaamey kumethi issi xeetanne laapun tammanne ichashu laythi de7is. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>Abrahaamey daro wode de7idi, lo77o cimidi, hayqidi ba mayzatan gahetis. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>Iya nayti Yisaaqinne Isma7eeli iya Makifeela geetetiya gongolo duufuwan moogidosona; he gongoloy Mamire matan, Hite addiya Xohaara na7a Efroona gadiyan de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/>Hessi Abrahaamey Hitetape shammida gadiya. Abrahaamey ba machiya Saara moogetida duufuwan moogetis. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Abrahaamey hayqidaape guye, Xoossay iya na7a Yisaaqa anjis. He wode Yisaaqi, Beer-lay-ro7i (Tana Be7iya De7o Xoossa Pulto) geetetiya pultuwa matan de7ees.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isma7eelanne Iya Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Saara aylliya, Gibxefe yida Aggaara, Abrahaames yelida na7a Isma7eela yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa. <verse eid="GEN 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>Isma7eela nayti banta sunthaninne banta yeleta maaran haysata; entika, Nabayoota, Qedaare, Adbeela, Mibsaama, <verse eid="GEN 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>Misima, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>Kudane, Teema, Ixura, Nafisanne Qedima. <verse eid="GEN 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>Isma7eela nayti haysata; enta sunthay enta moothaninne de7iya bessan haysa. Enti banta yaranka tammanne nam7u halaqata. <verse eid="GEN 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Isma7eeli kumethi xeetanne hastamanne laapun laythi de7idi, hayqidi ba mayzatan gahetis. <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Isma7eela kocheti Gibxefe doloha baggan de7iya Hawilapenne Suurape gidduwan, Asoore efiya ogiya matan de7idosona. Enti banta ishata ubbara morketethan de7idosona.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobanne Eesawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>Abrahaame na7a Yisaaqa yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa; Abrahaamey Yisaaqa yelis. <verse eid="GEN 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>Yisaaqas laythi oytama gidin, Irbiqa ekis; iya Masephexoomen de7iya Araame addiya Batu7eela na7iwunne Laaba michiw. <verse eid="GEN 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Yisaaqi ba machiya maynthi gidida gisho, iw Godaa woossis; Goday iya woosa si7is. Yaatin iya machiya Irbiqa qanthatasu. <verse eid="GEN 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Shin I ulon de7iya nayti mente gidi uttidi, issoy issuwara sugetidosona; iya, “haysi taw ayis hanii?” yaagasu. Hessa gisho, Godaa oychanaw basu.<verse eid="GEN 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>Goday iyo, “Ne ulon nam7u kawotethi de7ees; qassi ne giddon de7iya nam7u dere asati issoy issuwafe shaaketana; issi dere asati hankotape minnana; qassi bayray kaaluwas kiitetana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>Iwu yelo wodey gakin, I uluwan mente adde nayti de7oosona. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Koyro yeletidaysi aarise; iya bolla ubba ikisey ma7is; Hessa gisho, enti iya Eesawe (Iksaama) gidi sunthidosona. <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Hessafe guye, iya ishay yeletis. I ba kushiyan Eesawe gindiya oykidi keyis, Hessa gisho, iya Yayqooba (Ginde Oykeysa) gidi sunthidosona. Irbiqa enta yelida wode Yisaaqas usupun tammu laythi gidis.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Nayti diccidosona; Eesawey shanka hiilla eriya bazzo ase gidis. Shin Yayqoobi dunkaanen de7iya wopa ase gidis. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Yisaaqi Eesawe dosis; ayis giiko, I shankateysafe maanaw dosees; shin Irbiqa Yayqooba dosawusu.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Issi wode Yayqoobi woxe kathishin, Eesawey koshatidi bazzofe yis. <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>Eesawey Yayqooba, “Tana ha zo7o woxiyape muza, tana koshi wodhees” yaagis. (Hessa gisho, qassi iya sunthay Edoome (Zo7o) geetetis).<verse eid="GEN 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Yayqoobi iya, “Koyro taw ne bayratetha bayza” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Yaatin Eesawey, “Heko, taani hayqana hanayis, ha bayratethay tana ay maaddii?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Yayqoobi zaaridi, “Ane taw koyro caaqa” yaagis. I caaqis, ba bayratetha Yayqoobas bayzis. <verse eid="GEN 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Yayqoobi Eesawes uythinne misire woxe immin mis uyis. Hessafe guye dendidi bis. Eesawey ba bayratetha haysada kadhis.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqanne Abimeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>He biittan kase Abrahaame wode keyida koshaape hara koshi keyis. Yaanin, Yisaaqi Filisxeeme kawa Abimelekeko Geraara bis. <verse eid="GEN 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/>Goday Yisaaqas qoncidi “Gibxe biitta duge boopa, taani new odida biittan de7a. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>Ha biittan guutha wodiya gam7aasha, taani neera gidana, nena anjana. Ha biitta ubba taani newunne ne sheeshas immana. Taani ne aawa Abrahaames caaqida caaquwa polana. <verse eid="GEN 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>Ne sheesha salo xoollintoda darsana, ha biitta ubba taani entaw immana. Sa7a kawotethati ubbay ne sheesha baggara anjetana. <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>Hessika, Abrahaamey ta qaala si7idi, ta awaajota, ta kiitatanne ta higgeta naagida gishosa” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Hessa gisho, Yisaaqi Geraaran de7is.<verse eid="GEN 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>He biitta asay Irbiqaba denthidi, “Hanna new aybee?” gidi Yisaaqa oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:7">I, “Hanna taw micho” yaagis. Hessa I giday, Irbiqa daro mala lo77o gidiya gisho, “Iya ta macho giiko, ha asay I gaason tana wodhana” yaagi qopidi babis.<verse eid="GEN 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Yisaaqi yan daro wode de7idaape guye, Filisxeeme kawoy Abimelekey maskootera duge xeelliyade, Yisaaqi ba mache Irbiqara kaa7ishin be7is. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Hessa gisho, Abimelekey Yisaaqa xeegisidi, “Heko, iya ne macho; neeni ayis iya ta micho gadii?” gidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Yisaaqi, “Iya ta macho giiko, asay tana I gaason wodhana gada gas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>Abimelekey, “Haysi neeni nu bolla oothidabay aybee? Ta asaape issi asi ne machera aqis shin atis, neeni nu bolla gome ehadasa” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Hessa gisho, Abimelekey ba asa, “Ha ura woyko iya machiw bochiya oonika tuma hayqana” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Yisaaqi he biittan kathi zeridi, Goday iya anjida gisho he laythan xeetu kushe ekis. <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>I duretethan eretana gakanaw daro duretishe bis. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/>Yisaaqas dorsa wudey, miiza wudeynne aylleti aadhidi darida gisho, Filisxeeme asati iya qanaatidosona. <verse eid="GEN 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Hessa gisho, iya aawa Abrahaame wode iya aawa aylleti bookida haatha olla ubba Filisxeemeti biitta ushshidi kunthidosona.<verse eid="GEN 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>He wode Abimelekey Yisaaqako, “Neeni nuupe aadhada minnida gisho nu matape ba” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Yisaaqi hessafe dendidi, Geraara zangaara bidi dunkaane tokidi yan de7is. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Yisaaqi ba aawa Abrahaame wode booketida haatha ollata, Abrahaamey hayqidaape guye, Filisxeemeti kunthidaysata zaari booki kessidi, iya aaway sunthida sunthan xeegis.<verse eid="GEN 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Yisaaqa aylleti he zangaaran haatha olla bookidi yan lo77o pulto haatha demmidosona. <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>Shin Geraara henthanchoti Yisaaqa henthanchotara, “Haathay nubaa” yaagidi ooyetidosona. Enti palametida gisho, Yisaaqi he haatha olla “Eseeqa”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eseeqa guussay Ibraawetho doonan palama guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>Hessafe guye, enti hara haatha olla bookidosona. Shin enti he haatha olla geedonka ooyetidosona. Hessa gisho, Yisaaqi he haatha olla “Siixina”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:21: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siixina guussay Ibraawetho doonan morketethi guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>Hessafe guuthi sinthe shiiqidi hara haatha olla bookisis. Iya gaason oonika ooyetiboonna gisho, “Xoossay ha7i nuus dalgisis nuuni ha biittan darana” gidi he bessa Rehoboota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:22: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha qaala birshethay dalga bessi guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>Hessafe dendidi pude Barsaabe keyis. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>He bida gallas qamma Goday iyaw qoncidi, “Taani ne aawa Abrahaame Xoossa, taani neera de7iya gisho, babofa. Ta aylliya Abrahaame gisho taani nena anjana, ne sheeshaka darsana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Yisaaqi yan yarsho bessi giigisidi Godaa suntha xeegis. Yan I ba dunkaaniya tokis, iya aylleti yan haatha olla bookidosona.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Hessafe guye, Abimelekey bana zoriya Ahuzanne toora mocona Fikoola ekidi, Geraarape Yisaaqako yis. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Yisaaqi entako, “Hinte kase tana ixidi, hinte biittafe kessi yeddibeeketii? Ha7i taako ay ekanaw yidetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>Enti, “Goday neera de7eysa nuuni geeshshi erida. Hessa gisho, sarotetha caaqoy nu giddoninne ne giddon daanaw koshshees. <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>Nuuni nena bochibooko, new keehatetha xalaala oothidi, nena sarotethan moyzidi yeddida. Hessadaka neeni nu bolla iitaba oothonna mela, ane neera caaqoos. Tumaka ha7i nena Goday anjis” yaagidosona. <verse eid="GEN 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>He wode Yisaaqi entaw gibira giigisin midosona, uyidosona. <verse eid="GEN 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Wontetha gallas wonta guura dendidi enti issoy issuwara caaqidosona. Yisaaqi enta moyzin, enti saro shaaketidi bidosona.<verse eid="GEN 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>He gallas Yisaaqa aylleti yidi, “Nuuni haathe demmida” yaagidi banta bookida haatha ollaba iyaw odidosona. <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>I he haatha olla Saabe (Caaqo) gidi sunthis. Hessa gisho, he katama sunthay hachi gakanaw Barsaabe (Caaqo haatha olla) geetetees.<verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Eesawes laythi oytama gidida wode Hite addiya Bi7eera na7iw Yooditonne Hite addiya Eloona na7iw Basemaato machis. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/>Enti Yisaaqanne Irbiqa azzanthishe de7idosona.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Yisaaqa Anjuwa Ekishin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Yisaaqi cimin iya ayfey xeelo ixida wode ba bayra na7a Eesawe xeegidi, “Ta na7aw” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Ika, “Yee” gidi koyis.<verse eid="GEN 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>Yisaaqi, “Heko, ha7i taani cimas, taani awude hayqaneko erike. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>Yaaniya gisho, ha7i ne shanka dongiya ekada bazzo bada do7a shankatada asho ekada ya. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>Mal7o kathi ta doseysatho ootha kathada taw eha. Taani hayqanaape sinthe ma simmada nena anjana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Yisaaqi ba na7a Eesawes odiya wode Irbiqa si7awusu. Eesawey do7a shankatidi ehanaw bazzo bidaape guye, <verse eid="GEN 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/>Irbiqa ba na7a Yayqooba, “Ne aaway ne isha Eesawe, <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>‘Do7a shankata ehada taw mal7o kathi ta maanaw katha. Taani hayqanaape sinthe ma simmada Godaa sinthan nena anjana’ yaagishin taani si7as. <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Ta na7aw, ha7i taani new odeysa loytha si7a. <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Wudiya giddo bada nam7u modho deesha marata taw ekada ya. Taani ne aawas mal7o kathi I doseysada oothada kathana. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>Ne aaway hayqanaape sinthe midi nena anjana mela iyaw aatha” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Shin Yayqoobi ba aayiw, “Ta isha Eesawe bolla ikisey de7ees shin ta bollay liiqo. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/>Ta aaway tana oyki be7idi taani iya cimmidaba daaniko, taani anjuwa gisho baadethi ta bolla ehanaysa erikii?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>Iya aayiya, “Ta na7aw, he baadethay tana gako. Taani new odeysa ootha, bada deesha marata taw ekada ya” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Ehidi ba aayes immin iya aayiya mal7o kathi iya aaway doseysada oothada kathasu. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Hessafe guye, Irbiqa bayra na7a Eesawe ma7o lo77uwa ehada Yayqooba mayzasu. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>Qassi he deeshata itiya iya kushiyanne iya liiqo qoodhiya mayzasu. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>Ba kathida mal7o kathaanne uythaa ba na7a Yayqoobas immasu.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>Yaatin, I ba aawako gelidi, “Ta aawaw” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Ika, “Yee, ta na7aw, neeni oonee?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Yayqoobi ba aawa, “Taani ne bayra na7a Eesawe. Neeni tana kiitidaysada taani oothas; ha77i denda uttada, taani shankata ehidaysafe mada, tana anja” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Yisaaqi ba na7a, “Ta na7aw, waata ellesada demmadii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yayqoobi, “Goday, ne Xoossay taw giigisis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Yisaaqi Yayqooba, “Ta na7aw, neeni tuma ta na7a Eesaweko ta nena oyka be7ana ane ha shiiqa” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Yayqoobi ba aawako shiiqin oyki be7idi, “Ne qaalay Yayqooba qaala shin kushey Eesawe kushiya daanees” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>Iya kushey iya isha Eesawe kushiyada ikisera de7iya gisho, shaakidi eriboona iya anjis. <verse eid="GEN 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>Iya, “Tuma neeni ta na7a Eesawee?” yaagidi zaari oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Ika, “Ee, tana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Yaatin I, “Ta na7aw, taani ne shankata ehidabaape mada nena anjana mela ane ha aatha” yaagis. Yayqoobi aathin mis, qassi iyaw woyne ehin uyis.<verse eid="GEN 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Hessafe guye, iya aawa Yisaaqi, “Ta na7aw, ha shiiqada tana yeera” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Yayqoobi shiiqidi iya yeeris. Yisaaqi iya ma77uwa singi si7idi,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 27:27"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">“Ta na7a peenoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">Goday anjida goshshada sawees.<verse eid="GEN 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Xoossay salo akanne sa7a shica,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">kathinne woyne darsidi new immo.<verse eid="GEN 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Kawotethati new haareto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">asay new gulbato.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Neeni ne ishatas godaa gida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ne aaye sheeshati new gulbato.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Nena baaddeysati baadetidaba gido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">nena anjeysati anjetidaba gido” yaagidi anjis.<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Yisaaqi Yayqooba anjidi ongidaape guye, Yayqoobi ba aawa sinthafe buroo keyiya wode Eesawey shankafe puttu gis. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>Ika qassi mal7o kathi kathidi ba aawas aathidi, “Ta aawaw, danda uttada ta shankatidabaape ma, yaatada tana anja” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>Yisaaqi, “Ne oonee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Ika, “Taani ne bayra na7a Eesawe” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Yisaaqi dagammidi kokorishe, “Yaatin do7a shankatidaysafe taw aathiday oonee? Taani ha7i neeni yaana sinthan mada, iya anjas. Ika tuma anjetidaysa gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Eesawey ba aawa qaala si7ida wode ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, daro iita yeeho yeekishe, “Ta aawaw, tanaka anja” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Shin I, “Ne ishay cimmidi ne anjuwa eki diggis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Eesawey, “I eridi Yayqooba (Cimmeysa) gidi sunthetis. I tana cimmishin haysi nam7antho, kase ta bayratetha ekis, ha7i qassi ta anjuwa ekis” yaagis. Yaatin, “Neeni taw anjuwafe aykoka ashshabikii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Yisaaqi Eesawe, “Taani iya new godaa oothas. Iya ishata ubbataka iyaw aylle oothas. Qassi taani kathaninne woynen iya minthas. Yaatin, ta na7aw, new ta ay ootho?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Eesawey ba aawa, “Ta aawaw, new issi anjo xalaali de7ii? Ta aawaw, tanaka qassi anja” yaagis. Hessafe guye, Eesawey ba qaala dhoqu oothidi yeekis.<verse eid="GEN 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>Iya aawa Yisaaqi zaaridi,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 27:39"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Ne de7iya bessay ha sa7a duretethafe haaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">salo akika new wodhenna.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>Neeni ne mashshan aqana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">ne ishaas haaretana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Shin neeni iyara eqetiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">iya qambara ne gannaafe holana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqi Yayqooba Laabako Yeduwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Yayqooba iya aaway anjida gisho, Eesawey ba ulon iya morkis. I ba wozanan, “Ta aaway hayqanaw matis. I hayqida mela ta isha Yayqooba wodhana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Shin Irbiqa he ba bayra na7a Eesawe qaala si7ida gisho, ba kaalo na7a Yayqooba xeegisa ehada, “Ne isha Eesawey nena wodhidi haluwa kessanaw halchees. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Hayyana ta na7aw, taani new odeysa ootha. Dendada Kaaranen de7iya ta isha Laabako baqata. <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>Ne isha hanqoy irxana gakanaw guutha wode iyara de7aasha. <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>Ne ishaa yiloy wodhiya wodenne neeni iya bolla oothidaba I dogiya wode taani kiittada nena ehana. Taani issi gallas hinte nam7aafeka mela atanaw koyke” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Hessafe guye, Irbiqa Yisaaqako, “Eesawey ekida Hiteta macca nayta gaason taani ta de7uwa shaatetas. Qassi Yayqoobika haysatho Hiteta macca naytape macho ekiko, taw hayqoy lo77o” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Hessa gisho, Yisaaqi Yayqooba xeegidi, “Kanaane biitta macca naytape macho ekofa. <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>Dendada ne aaye aawa Batu7eelako Masephexoome biitta bada yaape ne aaye isha Laaba macca naytape macho eka. <verse eid="GEN 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay nena anjo, I new nayta immo, daro dere gidana gakanaw I nena darso. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Neeni ha7i betetethan uttida ha biitta nebaa oothana mela newunne ne sheeshas Xoossay Abrahaame anjuwa immo” yaagi anjidi kiittis. <verse eid="GEN 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Yaagidi Yisaaqi Yayqooba yeddis. Yayqoobi Masephexoome biitta Laabako bis. Laabi Yayqoobanne Eesawe aaye Irbiqa ishanne Araame addiya Batu7eela na7a.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eesawey Hara Macho Ekuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Yisaaqi Yayqooba anjidi Masephexoome biittafe macho ekana mela iya yedidaysa, I Yayqooba anjida wode, “Kanaane maccas ekofa” gidi kiittidaysanne, <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>Yayqoobi ba aawasinne ba aayes kiitetidi Masephexoome biitta bidaysa, Eesawey eris. <verse eid="GEN 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Eesawey hessan Kanaane biitta maccas ba aawa Yisaaqi ay mela ixiyako eris. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Hessa gisho, Eesawey Abrahaame na7a Isma7eelako bidi, iya na7iw Mahlaato, Nebayoota michiw, ba macheta bolla gujidi ekis.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Beetelen Amuho Be7uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Yayqoobi Barsaabepe Kaarane baanaw keyis. <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>I, issi bessi gakiya wode awi wullin, qamma yan aqis. He bessan de7iya shuchatape issuwa borkotidi he bessan dhiskis. <verse eid="GEN 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>I amuho amuhidi kodo issoy sa7an eqin xeeray salo gakidaysanne, Xoossa kiitanchoti iya bollara pude keyeysatanne duge wodheyisata be7is. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>He koduwas xeeran Goday eqidi, “Taani Godaa, ne aawa Abrahaame Xoossa, Yisaaqa Xoossa, ha neeni zin7ida biitta newunne ne sheeshas immana. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>Ne sheesha sa7a shafeda darsana. Neeni doloha bagga, wuloha bagga, pudeha bagganne dugeha bagga dalgana. Biitta bolla de7iya asa ubbay ne baggaranne ne sheesha baggara anjetana. <verse eid="GEN 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>Taani neera de7ayis. Neeni biya bessa ubban taani nena naagana. Taani nena ha biitta guye zaarada ehana. Taani new oothana gidaysa polana, nena aggike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Yayqoobi dhiskofe barkidi, “Ta erabikefe attishin, tuma Goday ha bessan de7ees” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>I babidi, “Ha bessay waani yashshi! Ha bessay Xoossa keethife attishin, haraso gidenna. Haysi salo penge” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>Wontetha gallas wonta guura Yayqoobi dendidi, Xoossas dummayanaw ba borkotida shucha ekidi tuussatho essidi iya bolla zayte tigis. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>Yayqoobi he bessa Beetele (Xoossa keethi) gidi xeegis. Shin he katamay hessafe kase Looza geetetees.<verse eid="GEN 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Yayqoobi, “Ta biya ogiyan ne tana naagiko, taw kathinne ma7o immiko, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>ne tana ta aawa soo saro zaariko, ne ta Xoossa gidana. <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>Taani dummayanaw tuussatho essida ha shuchay Xoossa keetha gidana. Tuma neeni taw immiyaba ubbaafe tammaafe issuwa new immana” yaagidi Xoossas caaqis.<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Laaba Soo Gaketha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobi dendidi, bidi doloha bagga asa biitta gakis. <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>Yanka demba bessan haatha olla demmis. Heedzu dorsa wudeti he haatha olla matan de7oosona. Wude ubbay haathe uyey he ollafe. He haatha olla doona gordiya shuchay gita. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Dorsa wude ubbay yaa shiiqiko, wudiya heemmeysati haatha olla doonape he shucha gondorsidi wudiya haathe ushshoosona. Ushshi simmidi he shucha olla doonan zaari wothoosona.<verse eid="GEN 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Yayqoobi entako, “Hinte awupe yidetii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Entika, “Nuuni Kaaranepe yida” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>I, “Nakoora na7a na7aa Laaba ereetii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">“Ee, iya eroos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>Yayqoobi enta, “I lo77o de7ii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">“Ee, lo77o, iya na7iw Raheelo dorsata laaggada yaaro hini be7a” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>Yayqoobi entako, “Heko, ha7i awi dhoqan de7ees. Wude mehey soo simmiya wodey buroo gakibeenna, dorsa ushshi efidi heemmite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>Shin enti, “Wude ubbay shiiqin shucha haatha olla doonape gondorsana gakanaw nu ushshanaw danda7oko. Hessafe guye, shucha gondorsidi dorsata ushshana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>I buroo odishin, Laaba na7iya Raheela dorsata heemmiya gisho, ba aawa dorsata laagga ekada gakasu. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Yayqoobi ba aaye isha Laaba na7iw Raheelo Laaba dorsata laaggada yaaro be7ida wode bidi olla doonape shucha gondorsidi dorsata haathe ushshis. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Yayqoobi Raheelo yeeridi, ufaysan ba qaala dhoqu oothidi yeekis. <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>Yayqoobi, “Taani ne aawa miche Irbiqa na7a” yaagidi iw odis. Hessa gisho, iya woxa bada ba aawas odasu.<verse eid="GEN 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Laabi ba miche na7a Yayqooba yuussaa si7ida mela mokanaw woxidi bis. Iya idimi yeeridi ba soo efis. Yan Yayqoobi hanidaba ubba Laabas odis.<verse eid="GEN 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Laaba Nayta Machis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Laabi iya, “Neeni tuma ta ashonne ta suuthi” yaagis. Yayqoobi iyara issi ageena kumethi uttis. <verse eid="GEN 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>Hessafe guye, Laabi Yayqooba, “Neeni taw dabbo gidida gisho, taw mela coo oothaneyee? Ane ta new ay qanxanaw koshshiyako taw oda” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Laabas nam7u macca nayti de7oosona. Bayre sunthay Liya, kaaliya qassi Raheelo geetetawusu. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Liya ayfera cuuca, shin Raheela yegelsinne mala lo77o.<verse eid="GEN 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Yayqoobi Raheelo dosidi, “Taani ne kaalo na7e Raheeli gisho new laapun laythi oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Laabi, “Iyo hara asas immanaape new imoy lo77o, ne taara haysan de7a” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Hessa gisho, Yayqoobi Raheelo ekanaw laapun laythi oothis. Shin I iyo daro dosiya gisho, iyaw guutha gallas daanis.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobi, “Ta machiw taw imma, ta laythay wuris taani iyo ekanaw koyayis” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Hessa gisho, Laabi asa ubba xeegidi yaagano kessis. <verse eid="GEN 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Shin sa7i qammin Laabi ba na7iw Liya efidi Yayqoobas immis. Yayqoobi iyo ekis. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Qassi Laabi ba aylliw Zalafa ba na7e Liyas aylle oothidi immis.<verse eid="GEN 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Sa7ay wontin I xeelliya wode, heko, Liya. Yayqoobi Laaba, “Haysi neeni ta bolla oothidaysi aybee? Taani new oothiday Raheeli gishosa gidenneyee? Tana ayis cimmadi” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Laabi iyako, “Nu biittan bayriya de7ishin kaaliw azinas immeysi woga gidenna. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Mishiratethan iira saaminta ongiko, qassi kaaliwka taani new immana. Hessafe guye, hara laapun laythi taw oothaasa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Yayqoobi oda ma77idi saaminta iira ongis. Hessafe guye, Laabi ba na7iw Raheelo iyaw immis. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>Qassi Laabi ba aylliw Baalo ba na7e Raheelis aylle oothidi immis. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Yayqoobi Raheeloka ekis. Raheelo Liyape aathidi dosis. Hara laapun laythi Laabas oothis.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobanne Iya Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>Goday Liya Raheelitho dosetabonaro be7idi, iw yelo uluwa dooyis. Shin Raheela na7a yelonna gam7asu. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Liya qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. Iya, “Goday ta metuwa be7is, ha7i tana ta azinay dosana” gada he na7a Robeela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Robeela: Ibraawetho doonan ha suntha birshethay “Hashshu, adde na7a” woyko “Ta metuwa be7is” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 29:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>Iya nam7antho qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. Iya, “Goday taani dosetabonaysa be7ida gisho, taw haysaka gujis” gada Simoona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Simoona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntha birshethay Ibraawetho doonan “Si7is” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 29:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>Iya heedzantho qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. Iya, “Taani iyaw heedzu adde nayta yelida gisho, ta azinay ha7i taara siiqon waaxetana” gada iya Leewe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Leewe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntha birshethay “Waaxetana” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>Iya hara qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. Iya, “Ha7i taani Godaa galatana” gada iya suntha Yihuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yihuda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha sunthay “Galata” guussu.</char></note> gada unthasu. Hessafe guye, yelo eqasu.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Raheela Yayqoobas nayta yelonnaysa be7ada ba michiw qanaatasu. Hessa gisho, Yayqooba, “Taw na7a imma, ixiko taani hayqana” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Yayqoobi Raheelo hanqetidi, “Tana new yelo immanaw woyko digganaw Xoosse gadiyee?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Iya, “Ta gadhindiw Baalo hinno be7a. Iya ta gisho yelana mela neeni iira aqa, yaaniko, taani I baggara na7a demmana” yaagasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>Ba gadhindiw Baalo macho oothidi ekana mela iyaw immasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>Baala qanthatada adde na7a Yayqoobas yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Yaatin Raheela, “Xoossay taw pirdis, ta woosaka si7idi taw adde na7a immis” yaagada he na7a Daane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntha birshethay Ibraawetho doonan “Pirdis” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Raheeli gadhindiya Baala qanthatada Yayqoobas nam7antho adde na7a yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Raheela, “Taani ta michera wolqaama baaxe baaxetada xoonas” yaagada he na7a Niftaaleme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niftaaleme geetetiya suntha birshethay “Baaxe” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Liya yelo eqidaysa be7ada, ba gadhindiya Zalafa Yayqoobas macho oothada immasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Liya gadhindiya Zalafa adde na7a Yayqoobas yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Liya, “La haysi aybi lo77o qaade!” yaagada, he na7a Gaade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaade guussay “Lo77o qaada” guussu.</char></note> sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Liya gadhindiya Zalafa Yayqoobas nam7antho adde na7a yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Liya, “Tana daro ufaysees; maccasi ubbay tana ufaytiyaro gaana” gada he na7a Aseera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aseera geetetiya suntha birshethay “Ufaysi” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Giste cakiya ageenan Robeeli gade bidi inkoya mitha ayfe demmidi ba aaye Liyas ekidi yis. Raheela Liyako, “Ne na7ay ehida enkoya mitha ayfiyape taw imma” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Shin Liya, “Ta azinaa neeni wolqan ekidaysi gidonna ixin ha7i qassi ta na7a inkoya mitha ayfiya ekanee?” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Raheela, “Ne na7a inkoya ayfiya taw immiko, Yayqoobi hachi qamma neera aqo” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>He gallas omarsi Yayqoobi bazzofe yaa wode Liya iya mokanaw keyada, “Neeni taara aqanaw koshshees; taani ta na7a inkoya ayfiyan nena shammas” yaagasu. Hessa gisho, I he qamma iira aqis.<verse eid="GEN 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Xoossay Liya woosa si7is. Iya qanthatada ichashantho adde na7a Yayqoobas yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Liya, “Taani ta aylliw ta azinas immida gisho, Xoossay hessa taw qanxis” yaagada he na7a Yisakoora<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yisakoora geetetiya suntha birshethay “Damooze” woyko “Woyto” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Liya hara qanthatada usupuntho adde na7a Yayqoobas yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Liya, “Xoossi taw al7o imota immis. Taani ta azinaas usupun adde nayta yelida gisho, ha7i I tana bonchana” yaagada he na7a Zabloona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntha birshethay “Boncho” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu. <verse eid="GEN 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Hessafe guye, issi macca na7a yelasu, iyo Diina gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Xoossay Raheelo qopis. I woosa si7idi I yelo uluwa dooyis. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>Iya qanthatada adde na7a yelasu; “Xoossay ta yeella qaaris. <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>Goday taw hara adde na7aka gujo” yaagada he na7a Yoosefa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntha birshethay “Taw gujo” woyko “Taape qaaris” guussu.</char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobanne Laaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Raheela Yoosefa yelidaape guye, Yayqoobi, “Taani ta aawa biitta simmada bana tana moyza. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>Taani enta gisho new oothida ta macceetanne ta nayta imma. Taani baana, taani new ay mela ooso oothidaako neeni eraasa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Shin Laabi iyako, “Taani new issiba odayis, Goday ne gaason tana anjidaysa taani ta Xoossafe eras. <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>Ne damooziya taw oda, taani new qanxana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Yayqoobi, “Taani new waata oothidaako, ne mehetika waani yeletidaako neeni eraasa. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Taani yaanape kase new de7iya guuthay ha7i loythi daris. Goday nena taani aadhida bessa ubban anjis. Shin ha7i, taani ta soo asaas oothana wode” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Laabi, “Yaatin taani new ay immo?” yaagidi iya oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yayqoobi, “Taw aykoka immofa, neeni taw issiba oothana gidiko, taani ne wudiya ha7ika heemmananne naagana. <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>Taani hachi ne wude ubbaa giddora aadhana. Hessan ne dorsatape wancuwa woyko gazza, kareetha marazeta ubbaa, deeshape gazzanne wanco ubbaa taani shaakana, enti ta damooze gido. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>Hessa gisho, ta xillotethay ne taw qanxida damooziya be7anaw yaa wode taw markatana. Ta deeshape gazza woyko puncare gidonabay woyko kareethi gidonna ay dorsati ta matan bentiko, kaysotetidaada tayba” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Laabi, “Ero, neeni gidaysada gido” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Shin he gallasan Laabi kalaade woyko gazza gidida kole ubba, wanco woyko gazza gidida macca deesha ubba, bootha wanco deeshatanne kareetha wanco dorsata ubba kessidi ba adde nayta heenthis. <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Yaatidi he wudiya heedzu gallasa ogiya Yayqoobape haassidi efis. Shin Yayqoobi attida Laaba wudiya heemmis.<verse eid="GEN 30:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Yayqoobi ongafirepe, bar7efenne lawuze mithafe xam7a kessidi, poquwa poqidi giddo bootha bagga qaaridi shiloyis. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>Wudey haathe uyanaw yaa wode gongen wudiya sinthan poqida xam7a wothis. Biraysi keydaysati haathe uyanaw yidi, <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>he xam7ata sinthan biraysetosona. He biraysidaysati kalaade, wanconne gazza marata yelidosona. <verse eid="GEN 30:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Yayqoobi deesha maratanne dorsa wudiyape shaakidi dumma wothis. Attida wudiya kalaadenne kareethi gidiya Laaba mehiyako zaaridi essis. Yaatidi Laaba wudiyara gathonna ba wudiya dummayidi darsis.<verse eid="GEN 30:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Wudiyape gooba maccati biraysas keyiya wode he xam7ata matan biraysetana mela Yayqoobi he xam7ata haatha gongen meheta sinthan wothees. <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>Shin meheti laafa gidiko enta sinthan xam7a wothenna. Hessa gisho, laafa meheti Laababa gidin goobati Yayqoobaba gididosona. <verse eid="GEN 30:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Hessada oothidi Yayqoobi daro duretidi, daro wudiya, macca aylletanne adde aylleta, daro gimaletanne hareta haaris.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Laabape Baqatuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Laaba adde nayti, “Yayqoobi nu aawaba ubba ekidigis. Ha shalo ubba nu aawabape demmis” yaagishin Yayqoobi si7is. <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Yayqoobi Laaba som7oy iyaw kase mela gidonaysa be7is.<verse eid="GEN 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>He wode Goday Yayqooba, “Neeni ne aawata biitta, ne dabbotako guye simma. Taani neera gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Yayqoobi Raheelonne Liya ba wudey heemetiya bessaa yaana mela kiittidi xeegisis. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>I entako, “Hinte aawa som7oy taw kase mela gidonaysa taani be7ayis. Shin ta aawa Xoossay taara de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/>Taani ta kumetha wolqan hinte aawas oothidaysa hinte ereeta. <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>Shin hinte aaway tana cimmidi, ta damooziya tammu toho laammis. Gidikoka Xoossay tana I qohonnaada diggis. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>I, ‘Puncareti ne damooze gido’ gin wude ubbay puncare yelis. Qassi I, ‘Kalaadeti ne damooze gido’ gin wude ubbay kalaade yelis. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Xoossay hessan hinte aawa mehiya wothi ekidi taw immis.<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>“Meheti biraysas keyiya ageenan taani issi amuho amuhas. He amuhuwan taani xeelliya wode mehiya biraysiya deesha urgeti kalaade, puncarenne gazza. <verse eid="GEN 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>Xoossa kiitanchoy amuhon tana, ‘Yayqooba’ yaagis. Taani, ‘Yee’ gada koyas. <verse eid="GEN 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>Ika, ‘Dhoqu gada mehiya biraysiya deesha urge ubba kalaade, puncarenne gazza be7a. Laabi ne bolla oothiyaba ubba taani be7ida gisho hessa oothas. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>Neeni essida shucha zayte tiyada taw caaqida Beetele Xoossay tana. Ha7i dendada ha biittafe keya. Guye ne yeletida biitta simma’ gis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Hessafe guye, Raheeliranne Liyara “Nu aawabape nuna gakiyabay aybee? <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>I nuna allagada xeellees gidennee? I nuna bayzi ekis. Bayzi ekidaba ubbaa midi dhaysis. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Xoossay nu aawape wothi ekida shalo ubbay tumaka nubaanne nu naytabaa. Hessa gisho, Xoossay new odidaba ubba ootha” yaagi zaaridosona.<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17-18"/>Yayqoobi Kanaane biittan de7iya ba aawa Yisaaqako baanaw dendis. I ba naytanne ba macheta gimale togisis. Wude ubba laaggidi, Masephexoomen de7ishe shiishida shalo ubba ekidi bis. <verse eid="GEN 31:17-18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Laabi ba dorsata ikisiya qanxanaw bidashin, Raheela ba aawa soo eeqa misileta kaysotasu. <verse eid="GEN 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Qassi Yayqoobi Araame addiya Laabas ba buussaa odonna ixidi cimmis. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>I baw de7iyaba ubba ekidi ellesidi Efraxiisa shaafa pinnidi, derey dariya Galada biitta bis.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laabi Yayqooba Kaallidi Buussaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>Heedzu gallasape guye, Yayqoobi baqatidi bidaysa Laabi si7is. <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>Ba dabbota baara ekidi, laapun gallasa oge Yayqooba geedo kaalli derey dariya Galada biittan iya gakis. <verse eid="GEN 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>He wode Xoossay qamma Soore Laabako amuhon qoncidi, “Neeni Yayqooba bolla iitaba gidin lo77oba, aybibaaka odetiko nena era” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Laabi gakiya wode Yayqoobi derey dariya Galada biittan dunkaane tokidi uttis. Laabika dabbotara yan dunkaanidosona.<verse eid="GEN 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Hessafe guye, Laabi Yayqooba, “Neeni haysada tana ayis cimmadii? Ta macca naytaka olan di7etidabada ayis laagga kessadii? <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Neeni ayis qosan taape kessa ekada tana cimmadii? Taani nena ufaysaninne yethan, karaaboninne diithan moyzana mela ayis taw odabikii? <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Neeni hari attoshin, ta nayta naytanne ta macca nayta taani yeera ekona mela diggadasa. Neeni iita oothadasa. <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>Taani nena genanaw taw wolqi de7ees shin ne aawa Xoossay zine qamma tana, ‘Yayqooba bolla iitaba gidin lo77oba aybibaaka odetonaada nena era’ yaagidi taw odis. <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Ha7i neeni ne aawa soo baanaw daro laamotida gisho keyadasa. Shin ta soo eeqa misileta ayis kaysotadii?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Yayqoobi Laaba, “Neeni ne nayta taape wolqan wosisa ekanekonne gada qopida gisho yayada haysada oothas. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/>Shin ne soo eeqa misileta ekida asi oonaka neeni demmiko, he uray hayqo. Nu dabbota sinthan nebaa gididaba ubba koyada eka” yaagis. Yayqoobi Raheela ba aawa soo eeqa misileta kaysotidaysa eribeenna.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Hessa gisho, Laabi Yayqooba dunkaaniya giddo, Liya dunkaaniya giddonne nam7u aylleta dunkaaniya giddo gelidi koyis. Shin aykoka demmibeenna. Liya dunkaaniyape keyidi, Raheeli dunkaaniya gelis. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Raheela soo eeqa misileta ekada gimale koora garsan qosada iya bolla uttasu. Laabi dunkaaniyan de7iyaba ubba pilgidi koyis. Shin aykoka demmibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Raheela ba aawa, “Ta godaw, tana hanqetofa. Taani new denda eqanaw danda7ike, ta kushe metora de7ayis” yaagasu. I koyidi soo eeqa misileta demmibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Yayqoobi yilotidi Laabako, “Taani ay iissadina? Haysa neeni tana kaallanaw ta ay qoho oothadina? <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>Ha7i neeni ta miishe ubba pilgada koyadasa. Ne soo eeqa misiletape ay demmadii? Enti nu nam7a giddon pirdana mela ne dabbota sinthaninne ta dabbota sinthan haysan wotha.<verse eid="GEN 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>“Taani neera laatamu laythi kumethi de7as. Ne dorsatinne deeshati awucaybokona woyko ne wudiyape issuwaka qottada mabike. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>Do7i mida gawuxaka ta new eha erike; taani taape ciggayis. Gallas woyko qamma kaysotetidaysata qanxisaasa. <verse eid="GEN 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Gallasa suulan, qamma meegon taani qohetas. Maara dhisko dhiska erike. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>Taani haysada hanada ne son laatamu laythi de7as. Tammanne oyddu laythi ne nam7u macca nayta gisho, usupun laythi ne mehiya gisho new oothas. Shin neeni ta damooziya tammu toho laammadasa. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Ta aawa Xoossay, Abrahaame Xoossay, Yisaaqi Xoossay taara gidonaba gidiyako, sidhey bayna neeni tana mela kushe kessa yeddadasa. Shin Xoossay ta metuwanne ta daabursa be7idi zine qamma nena hanqis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobanne Laaba Caaquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Laabi zaaridi Yayqooba, “Maccasati ta macca nayta, enta nayti ta nayta, ha meheyka ta mehiya, neeni be7iya ubbay taba. Hachi ha macca nayta bollanne enta nayta bolla ay oothanaw danda7ayna? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Ane haaya, neeranne taara wolla ane caaqoos. Hessi ne giddoninne ta giddon marka gido” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 31:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Hessa gisho, Yayqoobi issi shucha ekidi tuussatho essis. <verse eid="GEN 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Ba dabbota, “Shucha shiishite” yaagis. Enti shucha shiishidi keelidosona. He keela matan kathi midosona. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Laabi he keela, Yigar-Sahaduta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yigar-Sahaduta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aramike doonan “Marka keela” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis. Yayqoobi qassi iya Galada<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Galada: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan “Marka Keela” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 31:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Laabi, “Ha keelay neepenne taape giddon hachi marka” yaagis. Hessa gisho, iya sunthay Galada geetetis.<verse eid="GEN 31:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>Laabi, “Nuuni issoy issuwafe haakidi de7iya bessan Goday nenanne tana naago” gidi he bessa Mixipha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:49 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mixipha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doona naago bessi guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Laabi, “Neeni ta macca nayta naaqiko, woyko neeni ta macca nayta bolla hara macco ekiko, ta eronna ixikoka ne giddoninne ta giddon Xoossay marka gideysa akeeka” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Laabi qassika, “Keeletida shuchaynne taani ne giddoninne ta giddon essida shucha tuussay haysish. <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Taani ha keelape nena genanaw neeko kanthonnaada, neka tana genanaw ha keelapenne ha shucha tuussafe haa aadhonada ha keelaynne ha shucha tuussay marka. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Abrahaame Xoossay, Nakoora Xoossay, enta aawa Xoossay, nu giddon pirdo” yaagis. Yayqoobi ba aawa Yisaaqa Xoossa sunthan caaqis. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Yayqoobi zuma bolla yarsho yarshis. Ba dabbota kathi maanaw xeegis. Enti midi zuma bolla aqidosona.<verse eid="GEN 31:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55"/>Wontetha gallas guura Laabi dendidi ba nayta naytanne ba macca nayta anjidi, yeeridi ba soo simmis.<verse eid="GEN 31:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobanne Eesawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Yayqoobi dendidi ba ogiya bishin Xoossa kiitanchoti iyara gahetidosona. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Yayqoobi enta be7ida wode “Haysati Xoossa olanchota” yaagidi, he bessa Mahanayma (Nam7u guta) gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Yayqoobi Edoome biittan Sayre giya bessan de7iya ba isha Eesaweko kiita baape sinthe kiittis. <verse eid="GEN 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>I enta, “Hinte ta godaa Eesawes gaanabay haysa, ‘Taani ne aylley Yayqoobi, ha77i gakanaw Laaba matan gam7as. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>Taw miizi, harey, dorsinne deeshi, adde aylletinne macca aylleti de7oosona. Ha7i taani ha kiita ta godaa sinthan saba demmandinasha gada kiittas yaagis’ yaagite” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Kiitetidaysati Yayqoobako simmidi, “Nuuni ne isha Eesaweko bida. Ika qassi neera gahetanaw yees. Iyara oyddu xeetu asay de7oosona” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Yayqoobi daro babidi baara de7iya asa nam7u cugan shaakis. Ba dorsa, deesha, miizanne gimaleta nam7u cugan shaakis. <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>I, “Eesawey yidi issi cuga oliyaba gidiko, attida cugay kessi ekana” gidi qopis.<verse eid="GEN 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>He wode Yayqoobi haysada yaagidi woossis, “Abeeti Godaw, ta aawa Abrahaame Xoossaw, ta aawa Yisaaqa Xoossaw, tana, ‘Ne biitta, ne dabbotako simma, taani new lo77oba oothana gidayso, tana si7arki’, <verse eid="GEN 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>neeni ne aylliyas keehidabasinne ammanetetha ubbaas taani bessona asi. Taani Yordaanose shaafa pinniya wode taw issi xam7a xalaali de7ees; shin ha7i taani nam7u cuga godaa gidas. <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/>Taani nena woossayis ta isha Eesawe kushepe tana ashsha. I yidi, tananne aayeta enta naytara dhaysona aggenna gada yayyayis. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>Shin neeni tana, ‘Taani new tuma lo77oba oothana. Taani ne sheesha taybanaw danda7etona abba shafeda oothana’ gidaysa qopa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>He gallas qamma I yan aqis. Baw de7iyaba ubbaafe ba isha Eesawes immanaba qoridi kessis. <verse eid="GEN 32:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14-15"/>I, nam7u xeetu macca deeshatanne laatamu deesha marazeta, nam7u xeetu macca dorsatanne laatamu dorsa marazeta, hastamu dhanthiya gimaleta enta maratara, oytamu macca miizata, tammu korma boorata, laatamu macca haretanne tammu adde hareta qoridi kessis. <verse eid="GEN 32:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>Hessata wuden wuden shaakidi ba aylletas immidi, “Taape sinthe bidi wudiya wudiyape haahon haahon laaggite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>Sinthan kaaletheysa, “Ta ishay Eesawey neera gahetidi, ‘Neeni oodesee? Neeni aw bay? Ne sinthan de7iya mehe ubbay oodebayee?’ yaagidi oychiko, <verse eid="GEN 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>ne iyako, ‘Haysati ne aylliya Yayqoobasa, I ta godaa Eesawes immanaw yeddidaysata. Ika nuupe guyera yees’ yaaga” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>Qassi nam7anthuwa, heedzanthuwanne wudiya kaalliya harata ubbaa, “Hinte Eesawera gahetiya wode haysada geeta; <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>‘Ne aylliya Yayqoobi nuupe guyera yees’ goonna aggofite” yaagidi kiittis. I, “Taani immanaw sinthe yeddidaysan iya irxisana. Ooni eri hessafe guye taani iyara gahetiya wode I tana moki ekana” yaagidi qopis. <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Hessa gisho, ba immanaba baape sinthe yeddis. Shin I ba huuphen he gallas qamma yan aqis.<verse eid="GEN 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Xoossara Baaxetuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>He qamma Yayqoobi dendidi, ba nam7u macheta, ba nam7u aylleta, ba nayta tammanne issota ekidi, Yaaboqa shaafa pinnis. <verse eid="GEN 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>I enta shaafa pinthi simmidi baw de7iyaba ubbaa pinthidi yeddis. <verse eid="GEN 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>Shin Yayqoobi barka guye attis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">He wode issi asi sa7i wontana gakanaw iyara baaxetishe aqis. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>He uray iya xoonanaw danda7onaysa be7ida wode Yayqoobas bulxiya bochin, iya bulxey kesuwape keyis. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>Yaatin uray iya, “Sa7i wontana haniya gisho, tana yedda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Shin Yayqoobi, “Neeni tana anjonna nena yeddike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Uray, “Ne sunthay oonee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">I zaaridi, “Yayqooba” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Uray, “Neeni Xoossaranne asara baaxetada xoonida gisho, hizape ne sunthay Yayqooba geetetofo, Isra7eele (Xoossara baaxetis) geeteto” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Yayqoobi uraa, “Ne sunthay oonee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Shin uray, “Neeni ta suntha ayis oychay?” yaagidi iya anjis.<verse eid="GEN 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Hessa gisho, Yayqoobi, “Taani Xoossa som7on be7as shin paxa de7ayis” yaagidi, he bessa Phin7eela (Xoossa som7o) gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>I Phin7eelape dendiya wode iya bolla xalqey dolis. Iya bulxe kessay sakiya gisho dogees. <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Yayqooba bulxey wodire ashuwa matan boshetida gisho, Isra7eele asay mehes bulxe asho hachi gakanaw mookonna.<verse eid="GEN 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Eesawera Gahetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Yayqoobi dhoqu gidi xeelliya wode Eesawey ba oyddu xeetu asaara yeysa be7is. Hessa gisho, nayta Liyas, Raheelisinne nam7u aylletas shaaki immis. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>Aylletanne enta nayta sinthan, Liyanne I nayta enta geedon, Raheelonne Yoosefa wursethan wothis. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>Shin I baw sinthe aadhidi ba ishaako matishe sa7a gaki gaki laapuntoho ziggis.<verse eid="GEN 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Shin Eesawey iyara gahetanaw woxi yidi iya qoodhiya qoomidi yeeris. Nam7ayka yeekidosona. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Eesawey dhoqu gidi xeellidi maccasatanne nayta be7idi, “Ha neera de7eysati oonantee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yayqoobi, “Ta godaw, haysati Xoossay ne aylliyas ba keehatethan immida nayta” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Aylleti banta naytara shiiqidi iyaw ziggidosona. <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>Kaallidi Liyaranne I naytara yidi ziggidosona. Wursethan Yoosefaranne Raheelira yidi ziggidosona.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Eesawey, “Ha sinthan bishe taara gahetida wudey ubbay aybee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yayqoobi, “Ta godaw, hessi taani ne sinthan saba demmanaw yeddidaysata” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Shin Eesawey, “Ta ishaw, taw gidiya shaloy de7ees, nebay new gido” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Yayqoobi, “Hayyana, ha7i taani ne sinthan saba demmidaba gidiko, ha taani immeysa eka. Neeni tana moka ekida gisho, ta ne som7uwa be7eysi Xoossa som7o be7eysa mela. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>Taani new ehida ha imota eka. Xoossay taw keehi immida gisho kumis” yaagis. Yayqoobi woossidi aggonna ixida gisho, Eesawey iya imota ekis.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Eesawey, “Ane yedha, taani neera issife baana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Shin Yayqoobi, “Ta godaw, nayti shugo gideysa eraasa. Qassi taani galo marata dhanthiya dorsatanne miiza naaganaw koshshees. Asay enta hari attoshin, issi gallas minthi laagiko, mehe ubbay hayqana. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>Hessa gisho, ta godaw, ne aylletape sinthatada ba. Taani Sayren ta godaa gakanaw, ta sinthan de7iya mehiyanne nayta hemethaa mela loddan kaallada ta godaa taani Edoomen gakana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Eesawey, “Yaaniko, taani ta asaape guuthara new asho” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Shin Yayqoobi, “Koshshenna; taani ta godaa sinthan sabetidaysi taw gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Hessa gisho, Eesawey he gallas ogen wodhidi Sayre simmis. <verse eid="GEN 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Shin Yayqoobi Sukota bis. Yan baw keethe keexis, ba mehetas shaqara shaqaris. Hessa gisho, he bessa Sukota (Kuya woyko Gaabba) gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Yayqoobi Masephexoomepe simmidi Kanaane biittan de7iya Seekema katama saron gakis. I he katamas sintha baggara dunkaane tokidi uttis. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/>Ba dunkaaniya tokidi uttida gadiya Seekema aawa Hamoora naytape issi xeetu bira santimen shammis. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>Yan yarsho bessi giigisidi, “Godaa, Isra7eele Xoossa” gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Seekemanne Diina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Liya Yayqoobas yelida na7iya Diina, he wode Kanaane maccasata be7anaw keyasu. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>He biitta haariya Hiwe addiya Hamoora na7a Seekemi iyo be7idi, dafidi iissis. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Iya wozanay Yayqooba na7iw Diinas qadhetis. I iw mishetida gisho lo77o qaalara iyo odisis. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>Seekemi ba aawa Hamoora, “Taw ha na7iw macho oycharki” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Yayqoobi ba na7iw, Diina, azini dafidaysa si7ida wode iya adde nayti mehera bazzon de7oosona. Hessa gisho, enti yaana gakanaw si77i gis.<verse eid="GEN 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Hessafe guye, Seekema aawa Hamoori Yayqooba odisanaw yis. <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>Yayqooba adde nayti bazzofe yidi hessa si7idosona. Enti Seekemi Yayqooba na7iw dafidi, iissidi Isra7eele yeellayida gisho daro yilotidosona.<verse eid="GEN 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Shin Hamoori entako, “Ta na7ay Seekemi hinte na7ees daro mishetees, hayyana iyo iyaw macho immerketi. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>Nuura eketitenne geletite, hinte macca nayta nuus immite, nu macca naytaka hintew ekite. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Hinte nu giddon daanaw danda7eeta. Biittay daro dalga, iya oothidi zal7idi hintew aqo demmanaw danda7eeta” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>He wode Seekemi Diina aawanne I ishata, “Taani hinte sinthan sabetiko, hinte koyiyaba aybiba gidikoka immana. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Hinte mishira na7ees immanabaanne koyta hinte koyda mela tana oychite. Taani hinte tana oychidaba ubba immana. Shin taani machanaw na7iw taw immerketi” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Banta michiw Diina Seekemi tunisida gisho, Yayqooba adde nayti Seekemasinne iya aawa Hamooras wordotidosona. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>Entako, “Nuuni hessa mela palabaa oothanaw danda7oko, nuuni nu michiw qaxaretiboona asas immoko, hessi nuna kawushiyaba. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Hinte nuus issiba ero giiko nu hintew ero gaana. Hessika, hinte biitta adde asa ubbay qaxaretidi nuuda haniko, <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>nuuni nu macca nayta hintew immanaw Ero gaana. Hinte macca naytaka nuus ekana. Nuuni hinte giddon de7idi hintera issi ase gidana. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Shin hinte qaxaretanaw ero goonna ixiko, nuuni nu michiw eki baana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Yaatin ha enti gidabay Hamoorasinne iya na7a Seekemas lo77o daanis. <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>He panthay ba aawa keethan de7iya ubbaafe aadhidi bonchetida gisho koydaba oothanaw iyaw maati de7ees. Yayqooba na7iw daro dosida gisho, enti gidaba oothanaw guye gibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>He wode Hamoorinne iya na7ay Seekemi banta katama dabaaba bidi, banta katama asaas haysada yaagidi odidosona. <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>“Ha asati nuura siga de7oosona. Biittay daro dalga gidiya gisho enti ha biittan goyo zal7o. Enta macca naytaka nuuni ekana, entika nu macca nayta ekona. <verse eid="GEN 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>Shin nuura enti issi asada de7anaw nuuni issiba ero gaanaw koshshees. Hessika, enti qaxaretidaysada nu adde asa ubbay qaxaretanaysa. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Nuuni hessada oothiko, enta meheynne, enta aqo ubbay nubaa gidennee? Hessa gisho, ane nuuni enti geysa ero goos. Entika nu giddon de7ana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Katamaa dabaaba shiiqida asati ubbay Hamoorasinne iya na7a Seekemas, “Ero” gidoosona. Yaatin he katama adde asati ubbay qaxaretidosona.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>Heedzantho gallas, enti ubbay banta qaxara maduntha saketishin, Yayqooba adde naytape nam7ay, Diina ishati, Simoonaranne Leewera banta mashsha ekidi oonika eronna katama gelidi adde asa ubba wodhidosona. <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>Hamooranne iya na7a Seekema mashshan wodhidi, banta michiw Diina Seekema keethafe eki bidosona. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Yayqooba hara adde nayti ahata bolla gelidi banta michiw Diina tunisida katama ubbaa bonqidosona. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>Enta dorsa wudiya, miiza wudiya, hariya, katama giddon de7iyabaanne gaxan de7iyaba ubba ekidosona. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Enta keethan de7iya aquwa ubba, enta nayta ubbaanne maccasata ubba di7idosona.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Yayqoobi Simoonanne Leewe, “Hinte ta bolla gita meto ehideta. Ha biittan de7iya Kanaanetinne Parzeti tana ixana. Nuuni taybon guutha, enti issife gididi ta bolla dendiko, taaninne ta soo asay dhayana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>Shin enti, “Yaatin, I nu michiw layma maccasada oothanaw bessii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Beetele Simuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Hessafe guye Xoossay Yayqooba, “Dendada pude Beetele keyada yan de7a. Neeni ne isha Eesawepe baqatida wode new qoncida Xoossas yan yarsho bessi giigisa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Hessa gisho, Yayqoobi ba soo asaanne iyara de7eyisata ubba, “Hinte giddon de7iya allaga xoossata diggite. Hintena geeshshite, hinte ma7uwa laammite. <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>Haysafe dendidi pude Beetele boos. Ta metuwa gallas taw si7ida, taani bida bessa ubban taara gidida Xoossas taani yan yarsho bessi giigisana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Enti bantaw de7iya allaga xoossata ubbaanne banta haythan aathida worqa ubba kessidi Yayqoobas immidosona. Yayqoobi hessata Seekeman de7iya wolaa garsan moogis.<verse eid="GEN 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobinne iya adde nayti dendidi biyade enta yuushuwan de7iya asa bolla Xoossa yashshay wodhida gisho entana kaallidi oykanaw oonika danda7ibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Yayqoobinne iyara de7iya asa ubbay Kanaane biittan de7iya Beetele geetetiya Looza gakidosona. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/>Yan I yarsho bessi giigisis. I he bessa El-Beetele (Beetele Xoossa) gidi sunthis. I ba ishaape baqatidi biya wode Xoossay iyaw qonciday he bessaana.<verse eid="GEN 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Irbiqa dichiya Diboora yan hayqasu. Beetelepe garsara de7iya wolaa garsan iya moogetasu. Hessa gisho, he mitha sunthay Alon-Bakute (Yeeho Wola) geetetis.<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Yayqoobi Masephexoomepe simmidaape guye, Xoossay iyaw zaari qoncidi iya anjis. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/>Xoossay, “Ne sunthay Yayqooba. Shin hizape neeni Yayqooba geetetaka, ne sunthay Isra7eele geetetana” yaagidi iya “Isra7eele” gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>Qassi Xoossay Yayqooba, “Taani Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossa. Neeni yeleta, dara. Dereynne kawotethati neepe keyo. Kawotika ne gulbatape keyo. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/>Taani Abrahaamesinne Yisaaqas immida biitta, new immana. Neepe guye taani ha biitta ne sheeshas immana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Xoossay iyara odetida bessaafe pude keyis.<verse eid="GEN 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Yayqoobi Xoossay iyara odetida bessan qofisiya shucha mala essidi iya bolla woyniyanne zayte tigis. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>Yayqoobi Xoossay iyara odetida bessa “Beetele” gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Raheeli Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Enti hessafe guye, Beetelepe dendidi bidosona. Enti Efraata gakanaw guuthu attishin, Raheelo iqethi oykin daro waayetasu. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Iqethay iyo waaysida wode iyo yelisiyara, “Babofa; haysika adde na7a” yaagasu. <verse eid="GEN 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Shin iya hayqos matada shempoy keyana hanishin, ba na7a Benoona (Meto na7a) gada sunthasu. Shin iya aaway Biniyaame (Ta ushacha) gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>Hessafe guye, Raheela hayqa aggasu. Beeteleme geetetiya Efraata efiya ogiya gaxan moogetasu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Yayqoobi I duufuwa bolla hawulte shucha essis. He hawultey hachu gakanawuka Raheeli duufuwa erisees.<verse eid="GEN 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Isra7eeley hessafe dendidi Edera gimbiyafe hefinthan ba dunkaaniya tokis. <verse eid="GEN 35:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Isra7eeley he biittan de7ishin, Robeeli ba aawas yelida aylle Baalira aqis. Isra7eeley he odaa si7is.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yayqooba adde nayti tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="GEN 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/>Liya nayti Yayqooba bayra na7a Robeela, Simoona, Leewe, Yihuda, Yisakooranne Zabloona. <verse eid="GEN 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/>Raheeli adde nayti Yoosefanne Biniyaame. <verse eid="GEN 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/>Raheeli aylle Baali adde nayti Daanenne Niftaaleme. <verse eid="GEN 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/>Liya aylle Zalafa adde nayti Gaadenne Aseera. Ha nayti Yayqoobas Masephexoomen yeletida adde nayta.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Yayqoobi Kebroona geetetiya Qiriyaat-Arba matan Mamiren de7iya ba aawa Yisaaqa soo bis. He bessay kase Abrahaameynne Yisaaqi de7ida bessaa. <verse eid="GEN 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Yisaaqi xeetanne hospun tammu laythi de7is. <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>I daro wodiya de7idi lo77o cimidi, hayqidi ba mayzatan gahetis. Iya nayti Eesaweynne Yayqoobi iya moogidosona.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Eesawenne Iya Yeletetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>Edoome geetetiya Eesawe yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa; <verse eid="GEN 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Eesawey Kanaane biitta macca naytape baw machota ekis. Entika Hite addiya Eloona na7iw Ado, Hiwe addiya Xiba7oona na7ay Ani yelida Oholbaamonne <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>Isma7eela na7iw, Nebayoota michiw Basemaato. <verse eid="GEN 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ada Eesawes Elfaaza yelasu. Basemaata Ragu7eela yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>Oholbaama Ye7usa, Ya7ilamanne Qore yelasu. Kanaane biittan Eesawes yeletida adde nayti haysata.<verse eid="GEN 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>Eesawey ba macheta, ba adde naytanne macca nayta, ba soo asa ubbaa, ba miizanne ba hara mehe ubbaa Kanaane biittan haaridaba ubbaa ekidi ba isha Yayqoobape haakidi hara biitta bis. <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>Enta shaloy darida gisho, enti issife daanaw danda7ibookona. Enta mehey darida gisho, enti de7iya biittay enta nam7aas gidonna ixis.<verse eid="GEN 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Yaanin, Edoome geetetiya Eesawey derey dariya Sayre biittan de7is.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>Derey dariya Sayre biittan de7ida Edoometa mayza Eesawe yeletethay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa; <verse eid="GEN 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>Eesawe adde nayta sunthay, Eesawe mache Adi na7aa Elfaazanne Eesawe mache Basemaati na7a Ragu7eela.<verse eid="GEN 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Elfaaza nayti Temaana, Omaara, Xafa, Ga7itamanne Qeneza. <verse eid="GEN 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Qassi Timnaa7a Eesawe na7a Elfaazas aylle. Iya Elfaazas Amaaleqa yelasu. Haysati Eesawe mache Adi na7aa nayta.<verse eid="GEN 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>Ragu7eela adde nayti Nahaata, Zara, Shamanne Miiza. Haysati Eesawe mache Basemaati na7a nayta.<verse eid="GEN 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Xiba7oona na7ay Ani yelida Oholbaama adde nayti haysata; Entika Ye7usa, Ya7ilamanne Qore.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>Eesawe yeleta halaqati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata; Eesawes bayra na7a Elfaaza adde nayti, halaqa gididaysati Temaana, Omaara, Xafa, Qanaza, <verse eid="GEN 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>Qore, Ga7itamanne Amaaleqa; Edoome biittan Elfaazi yelida halaqati haysata; hessati ubbay Adi na7aa nayta.<verse eid="GEN 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Eesawe na7a Ragu7eela adde nayti, halaqa gididaysati Nahaata, Zaraha, Shamanne Miiza; Edoome biittan Ragu7eeli yelida halaqati haysata; enti Eesawe mache Basemaati na7a nayta.<verse eid="GEN 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Eesawe mache Oholbaami adde nayti, halaqa gididaysati Ye7usa, Ya7ilamanne Qore; enti Ana na7e, Eesawe mache Oholbaamipe yeletida halaqata.<verse eid="GEN 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Edoome geetetiya Eesawe adde nayti haysata; enta halaqatika haysata.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sayrenne Yeletetha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Taari 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Edoome biittan de7iya Hoora Sayre adde nayti haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata; hessatika Loxaana, Shobaala, Xiba7oona, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>Disoona, Exeranne Disaana; hessati, Edoome biittan de7iya Sayre adde nayti, Hoorata halaqata.<verse eid="GEN 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Loxaana adde nayti Hooranne Hemaama; Loxaana michiya Timnaa7o.<verse eid="GEN 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Sobaala adde nayti Aliwa, Manahoota, Ebaala, Sifanne Onaama.<verse eid="GEN 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Xiba7oona adde nayti Ayanne Ana; haysi Ani mela biittan ba aawa Xiba7oona hareta heemmishe bilbo haatha pultuwa demmidaysa.<verse eid="GEN 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Ana na7ay Disoona; na7iya qassi Oholbaamo.<verse eid="GEN 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Disoona adde nayti Hemdaana, Esbaana, Yitraananne Kaarana.<verse eid="GEN 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Exera adde nayti Bilihaana, Zawananne Aqana.<verse eid="GEN 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Disaana adde nayti Uxanne Arana.<verse eid="GEN 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>Hoorata halaqati haysata; Loxaana, Shobaala, Xiba7oona, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>Disoona, Exeranne Disaana. Haysati Sayre biittan banta yaran yaran shaaketida Hoorata halaqata.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoome Ayseysata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Taari 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Isra7eelen Kawoy kawotanaape kase Edoome biittan kawotida kawoti haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.<verse eid="GEN 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Bi7oora na7ay Balaaqi Edoomen kawotis; iya katamaa sunthay Dinaaba geetetees.<verse eid="GEN 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Balaaqi hayqin, Baasora addey Zaara na7ay Yobaabi iya bessan kawotis.<verse eid="GEN 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Yobaabi hayqin, Temaana addey Husami kawotis.<verse eid="GEN 36:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Husami hayqin, Badada na7ay Hadaadi, Midiyaameta Moo7abe biittan xoonidaysi kawotis; iya katamaa sunthay Awiita geetetis.<verse eid="GEN 36:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Hadaadi hayqin, Masreeqa addey Samili kawotis.<verse eid="GEN 36:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Samili hayqin, shaafa matan de7iya Rehoboota addey Saa7uli kawotis.<verse eid="GEN 36:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Saa7uli hayqin, Akboora na7ay Ba7al-Hanani kawotis.<verse eid="GEN 36:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Akboora na7a Ba7al-Hanani hayqin, Hadaadi kawotis; iya katamaa sunthay Paa7u geetetees; iya machiya Mezahaaba na7iya Maxireeda yelida Mahexabeelo geetetawusu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>Eesawe yeleta halaqati banta yaran yaran, banta bessan bessan banta sunthan sunthan haysata; Timina, Aliwa, Yeteta, <verse eid="GEN 36:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>Oholbaama, Ela, Pinoona, <verse eid="GEN 36:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>Qanaza, Temaana, Mibsaara, <verse eid="GEN 36:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>Magdelanne Irama. Haysati banta aysiya biittan, banta de7iyasuwan de7iyasuwan Edoome halaqata. Haysi Eesawey, Edoometa aawa.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefanne Iya Ishata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Yayqoobi iya aaway Yisaaqi de7ida Kanaane biittan de7is.<verse eid="GEN 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>Yayqooba yeletetha taarikey haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yoosefi tammanne laapun laytha na7a gidida wode ba aawa machetape, Baalipenne Zilpafe yeletida ba ishatara mehe heemmees. I ba aawas ba ishati oothida iitabata odees.<verse eid="GEN 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Isra7eeley Yoosefa cimidi yelida gisho, ba hara adde nayta ubbaafe aathidi dosees. Hessa gisho, iyaw alleeqetida ma7o giigisis. <verse eid="GEN 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Iya ishati enta aaway iya entafe aathidi doseysa be7ida wode iya ixidosona. Mal7o qaalaka iyako odetanaw danda7ibookona.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Issi wode Yoosefi amuho amuhidi, ba ishatas odin enti iya kaseysafe aathidi ixidosona. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>I entako, “Taani amuhida amuhuwa si7ite. <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>Nuuni gaden giste mirqishin ta mirqey dendidi luule eqis. Hinte mirqeti yuuyi aadhidi ta mirqiyas ziggidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>Iya ishati, “Neeni nu bolla kawotada nuna haaranaw qopay?” yaagidi oychidosona. Enti iya amuhuwa gishonne iya odaa gisho, kaseysafe aathidi ixidosona.<verse eid="GEN 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Qassika Yoosefi hara amuho amuhidi ba ishatas odis. “Heko, taani hara amuhoka amuhas. He amuhuwan awi, ageeninne tammanne issi xoolintoti taw ziggoosona” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>Ba ishatas odida amuhuwa ba aawas odida wode iya aaway, “Haysi waanida amuho? Tuma taani, ne aayanne ne ishati yidi, ne sinthan zigganeyee?” yaagidi hanqetis. <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/>Iya ishati iya qanaatidosona, shin iya aaway he odaa ba wozanan wothis.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefa Bayzetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Issi gallas iya ishati Seekeman banta aawa meheta heemmanaw bidosona. <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>Isra7eeley Yoosefa, “Ne ishati Seekeman meheta heemmeysa eraasa. Haaya, taani nena entako kiittana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yoosefika, “Ero” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>I iyako, “Bada ne ishatinne mehey saro gideysa be7ada entaba taw yada oda” yaagidi Yoosefa Kebroona zangaarape kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yoosefi kiitetidi Seekema bis. <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>Yan demba bessan enta koshshan yaa haa simeretishin, issi asi iya demmidi, “La na7aw, ay koyay?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>I, “Ta ishata koyayis; enti mehiya heemmiya bessaa be7idaako, hayyana taw odarkii” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Uray, “Haysafe bidosona; enti, ‘Nuuni Dootane baana’ gishin si7as” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Yoosefi ba ishata geedo kaalli bidi, enta Dootanen demmis.<verse eid="GEN 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>Shin I haahon de7ishin, enti iya be7idosona. I entako gakonna de7ishin, wodhanaw iya bolla maqetidosona. <verse eid="GEN 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>Enti issoy issuwako, “Hini be7ite, amuhuwa goday yees. <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Haayite, iya wodhidi, ha ollatape issuwan yeggoos. Hessafe guye, ‘Do7i iya mis’ yaagana. Yaatidi, iya amuhuwa wursethaa be7ana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Robeeli hessa si7ida wode, enta kushepe iya ashshanaw koydi, “Iya wodhoko; <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>iya wodhanaape mela biittan de7iya ha ollan yeggite; iya bolla kushe wothofite” yaagis. Robeeli hessa giday, iya enta kushepe ashshidi guye aawako zaaranaasa.<verse eid="GEN 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Yoosefi ba ishatako gakida wode I ma77ida alleeqetida ma7uwa iyape qaari ekidosona. <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>Iya efidi haathi bayna mela ollan yeggidosona.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Enti kathi mishin hassayoona Isma7eela asati Galadape Gibxe bishin, dhoqu gidi be7idosona. Enti banta gimaleta bolla sawuwa, madiyanne karbiya caanidosona.<verse eid="GEN 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Yihudi ba ishata, “Nuuni nu isha wodhidi, iya suuthaa qottiko nuna ay maaddanee? <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/>Haayite, iya Isma7eela asaas bayzoos. I nu isha, nu suuthunne nu asho gidiya gisho iya bolla nu kushiya wothoko” yaagis. Iya ishati iya odaa ma77idosona. <verse eid="GEN 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Hessa gisho, Midiyaame biitta zal7anchoti yaara aadhishin, iya ishati Yoosefa ollafe kessidi, Isma7eela asatas laatamu bira santimen bayzidosona. Enti Yoosefa Gibxe biitta efidosona.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Robeeli ollaako simmidi, Yoosefi yan baynaysa be7ida wode, azzanidi ba ma7uwa daakis. <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>I guye ba ishatako bidi, “Na7ay yan baawa; hiza, taani ay hanosha?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>Enti Yoosefa ma7uwa ekidi, issi deeshe shukidi, he suuthan naaqidosona. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Alleeqetida iya ma7uwa banta aawako efidi “Nuuni haysa demmida; haysi ne na7a ma7uwakonne ane be7a” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Yayqoobi ma7uwa eridi, “Haysi ta na7aa ma7uwa; ta na7aa do7i mis. Yoosefi tumaka zaazetis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Yayqoobi azzanidi, ba ma7uwa peedhis. Kayo ma7o ma7idi, ba na7aas daro gallas yeekis. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>Iya adde naytinne macca nayti ubbay iya minthethanaw yidosona. Shin I minettonna ixidi, “Akay, taani yeehoy yeehoshin duufo gelana” yaagidi, Yoosefas yeekis.<verse eid="GEN 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>He wode Midiyaame biitta asati Yoosefa, Gibxe kawa moorinnatanne kawa naageysata halaqa gidida Phoxfaaras bayzidosona.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Yihudanne Timaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>He wode Yihudi ba ishatape shaaketidi, Adulaama kataman de7iya Hira geetetiya uraara daanaw bis. <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>Yan Yihudi Shuu7a geetetiya Kanaane ura na7iw machis. <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>Iya Yihudas qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. I he na7a Era gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>Qassika qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. Iya he na7a Onaana gada sunthasu. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Zaaradaka hara adde na7a yelasu. Iya he na7aa Seela gada sunthasu. He na7ay yeletiya wode Yihudi Akziiba biittana.<verse eid="GEN 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Yihudi ba bayra na7a Eras Timaaro geetetiya macho immis. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Yihuda bayra na7ay, Eri, Godaa sinthan iita asi gidiya gisho, Goday iya wodhis.<verse eid="GEN 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Yihudi Onaanako, “Wogay nena kiiteysa mela ne ishaa machera aqa. Ne ishaas na7a yelada iya suntha xeegisa” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Shin Onani yeletana nayti iyabaa gidonaysa erida gisho, ba ishaa machera aqiya wode ba ishaas na7i yeletonna mela ba attunta sa7an gussees. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>I oothidabay Godaa sinthan iitaba gidida gisho, Goday iyaka wodhis.<verse eid="GEN 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Hessafe guye, Yihudi ba na7aa machiw Timaaro, “Ta na7ay Seeli diccana gakanaw ne aawa soo bada, am7etethan de7aasha” yaagis. Hessa I giday, ika ba ishatada hayqanekonne gidi hirgida gishosa. Hessa gisho, Timaara bada ba aawa son de7asu.<verse eid="GEN 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>Daro wodepe guye, Yihuda machiya, Shuu7a na7iya hayqasu. Yihudi ba kayo wodiya ongidi, ba dorsata ikisiya meediya asatako Timina geetetiya bessi ba laggiya Adulaama addiya Hirera bis.<verse eid="GEN 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Asay Timaaro, “Heko, ne azina aaway Yihudi, ba dorsata ikisiya meedanaw Timina bees” yaagidi odidosona. <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>Iya ba am7etetha ma7uwa laammada, bana balethanaw shaashe ekada guuluntasu. Yaatada, Timina efiya ogiya doonan de7iya Enayme katama gaxan uttasu. Hessa iya oothidaysi, Seeli diccidi gakinka iyaw macho gidada imetonaysa iya erida gishosa.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Iya ba som7uwa guuluntida gisho, Yihudi iyo be7ida wode, layma maccas gidi qopis. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>Ba na7aa machiw gideysa eronna de7ishe, ogiya gaxa iiko shiiqidi “Taara aqanee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Iya, “Taani neera aqiko, ne taw ay immanee?” gada oychasu.<verse eid="GEN 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>I, “Taani ta mehiyape issi kole new yeddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Iya, “Neeni hessa taw yeddana gakanaw ay oythanee?” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>I, “Ay oytho?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Iya, “Ne maatamiya iya gooshuwaranne ne kushiyan de7iya xam7a oytha” yaagasu. I hessata immidi, iira aqis; iyaka qanthatasu. <verse eid="GEN 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>Iya hessafe dendada bidaape guye, ba guulunthaa qaarada, ba am7etetha ma7uwa ma7asu.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Yihudi ba oythidaba he maccaseepe zaari ekanaw deesha ba laggiya Hira bolla iw yeddis. Shin I iyo demmibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>I he biitta asaako, “Enayme kataman, oge doonan uttida layma maccasiya awunee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Asay, “Layma maccas haysan ubbaka baawa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>I Yihudako simmidi, “ ‘Taani iyo demmabike; hessa bollaka he biitta asay, layma maccas haysan ubbaka baawa’ yaagidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Yihudi, “Ba oykidaysa baw eko, atto giiko, asi nuna miicana. Hiza taani iw deeshe yeddas shin neeni iyo demmabaaka” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Heedzu ageena gidishin asay, “Ne na7aa maccasiya Timaara laymatada qanthatasu” yaagidi Yihudas odidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yihudi, “Iyo kare kessidi taman xuuggite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>Iyo kare kessiya wode, “Taani qanthatiday ha miisheta godaasa. Ha maatameynne xam7ay oodebayeko eranaw danda7iko era” gada ba azina aawaka kiittasu.<verse eid="GEN 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Yihudi he miisheta eridi, “Taani ta na7aa Seelas iyo immaboonna gisho, taape iya xillo” yaagis. Hessafe guye, I iira zaaridi aqibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>Iwu yelo qammi gakiya wode, I ulon mente nayti de7eysi eretis. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Iya maaretishin, entafe issoy ba kushiya kessin yelisiyara, “Haysi koyro keyis” gaanaw zo7o qacina ekada iya kushen qachasu. <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Shin I ba kushiya guye ekida wode, iya ishay keyin iya, “Neeni waanada porxu gada keyadii?” yaagasu. Hessa gisho, Paaresa (Porxu gis) gada sunthasu. <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Hessafe guye, iya kushiyan zo7o qacini de7iya iya ishay yeletis. Iya sunthay Zaara (Zo7o) geetetis.<verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefanne Phoxfaara Machiw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Isma7eela asati Yoosefa Gibxe biitta efidosona. Gibxe kawa moorinatape issuwas, kawa naageysata halaqaas Yoosefa bayzidosona.<verse eid="GEN 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>Goday Yoosefara de7iya gisho, I oothiyaba ubbaa iyaw injeyis. Yaatin, ba Gibxe godaa son de7is. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>Goday iyara de7eysanne I oothiyaba ubbaa iyaw injeyidaysa Phoxfaari be7ida wode, <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>Yoosefa dosis, baw mata oosancho oothis. Phoxfaari iya ba keetha bollanne baw de7iyaba ubbaa bolla shuumis. <verse eid="GEN 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>He wodepe doomidi, Goday Gibxe ura keetha Yoosefa gisho anjis. Godaa anjoy Phoxfaara sooninne iya gaden de7iyaba ubbaa bolla wodhis. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>I miya kathiw eriyaripe attishin, baw de7iya haraba ubbaa Yoosefa kushen sheedhis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yoosefi yegelsinne mala lo77o asi. <verse eid="GEN 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>Guutha wodepe guye, iya godaa machiya Yoosefa be7ada, “Haaya, taara zin7a” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Shin I ixidi, iiko, “Be7a, ta goday, baw de7iyaba ubbaa ta kushen yeggida gisho, ba son de7iyabas aykoka hirgenna. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/>Ha son taape aadhey oonika baawa. Neeni iya macho gidiya gisho, neepe attishin, haraa, I taw immonabay baawa. Yaatin, taani waatada haysa mela daro iitaba hanada Xoossa bolla nagara ootho?” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Iya he odaa wonta wonta Yoosefas odinka, I iira aqonna woyko I mata shiiqona ixis.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Shin issi gallas I ba ooso oothanaw soo geliya wode, soo aylletape oonika son baawa. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Iya Yoosefa afila oykada, “Taara zin7a” yaagasu. Shin I ba afila I kushiyan yeggi aggidi, soope kare woxi keyis.<verse eid="GEN 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Yoosefi ba afila I kushiyan yeggi aggidi, soope kare woxi keydaysa iya be7ida wode, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>ba soo aylleta xeegada, “Heko, ta azinay ehida ha Ibraawe uray tana kawushshanaw oykis. I tana iissanaw ta de7iyasuwa gelis, shin taani waassas. <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>I ba afila ta matan yeggi aggidi, soope kare woxidi keyis” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>I azinay soo yaana gakanaw iya Yoosefa afila ba matan wothasu. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>I yin, iyaw haysada gada odasu; “Haysi ne ehida Ibraawe aylley tana iissanaw taako gelis. <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>Shin taani waassin, ba afila ta matan yeggi aggidi, soope kare woxi keyis” yaagasu.<verse eid="GEN 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Iya goday hanidaba si7ida wode daro yilotis. <verse eid="GEN 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>Iya goday Yoosefa efidi, kawa qasho asay de7iya qasho keethan yeggis.<verse eid="GEN 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/>Shin Yoosefi qasho keethan de7iya wode, Goday iyara de7ees. Ba keehatetha iyaw darsidi, qasho keetha kaapuwa sinthan iyaw saba immis. <verse eid="GEN 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Yaanin, qasho keetha kaapoy qasho asa ubba Yoosefa kushen yeggis. Yan oosetiyaba ubbaas aawatetha immis. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>Goday Yoosefara gididi, I oothiyaba ubbaa iyaw injeyida gisho, qasho keethaa kaapoy Yoosefa kushen de7iyabas aykoka hirgenna.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefi Amuho Bilethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Guutha wodepe guye, Gibxe kawa ushsha kaapoynne katha kaapoy banta godaa, Gibxe kawa naaqidosona. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Kawoy he nam7u kaapota bolla daro yilotidi, <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>Yoosefi qashetida, qasho keetha naageysata kaapuwa son enta qachis. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Naageyseta halaqay enta Yoosefas sheedhis, ika entaw kiitetees. Enti qasho keethan daro wode uttidosona.<verse eid="GEN 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>Gibxe kawa ushsha kaapoynne katha kaapoy, qasho keethan de7ishe nam7ayka issi qamma dumma dumma amuho amuhidosona. He amuhotas dumma dumma birshethay de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Yoosefi wonta entako geliya wode enti azzanidi uttidashin be7is. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>I entana, “Hachi hinte som7oy ayis dhumidee?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>Enti, “Nu nam7ayka amuho amuhida, shin nuus birshiya asi dhayis” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yoosefi entako, “Amuho birshiya eratethay Xoossaba gidenneyee? Ane hinte amuhuwa taw odite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Yaatin ushsha kaapoy ba amuhuwa Yoosefas odis; “Taani ta amuhon issi woyne ta sinthan be7as. <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>He woyniyas heedzu tasheti de7oosona. I hayxidi, ciiyi simmidi teeris. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Kawo wanci ta kushen de7ees. Taani woyne teera ekada iyan gum7ada, he wanca kawa kushen wothas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Yoosefi, “Ha amuhuwa birshethay haysa; heedzu tasheti heedzu gallasata. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Heedzu gallasata giddon Kawoy nena qashope billana. I nena kase shuumatethaako zaarana. Kase neeni ushsha kaapo gidada ootheysada neeni kawa wanca iya kushiyan wothana. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Shin new sa7i lo77ida wode tana dogopa; taw keeha. Tabaa kawas odada, ha qasho keethafe tana kesisa. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Tana Ibraawe biittafe wolqan ehidosona. Hari attoshin, haysan tana qashos gathiyaba aybibaaka oothabike” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Kathaa kaapoy Yoosefi amuhuwa loythidi birshidaysa be7ida wode Yoosefako, “Taani amuhida amuhoy haysa; ta huuphen heedzu gabate uythi de7ees; <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>bolla bagga gabatiyan Gibxe kawas dumma dumma katha qommofe uuketida uythay de7ees. Shin kafoti he ta huuphen de7iya gabatiyape moosona” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Yoosefi, “He amuhuwa birshethay haysa; heedzu gabateti heedzu gallasata. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Heedzu gallasa giddon Kawoy nena qashope billana. Ne qoodhiya qanxisidi mithan kaqisana; ne ashuwaka kafoy maana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Heedzantho gallasan Gibxe Kawoy ba yeletida gallasan ba moorinnata ubbaas gibira giigisis. Ushsha kaapuwanne katha kaapuwa billi ehidi ba asa sinthan essis. <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Ushsha kaapuwa iya shuumatethaako zaarin, I kawa kushiyan wanca wothis. <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>Shin Kawoy kathaa kaapuwa kaqisis. Ubbayka Yoosefi enta amuhuwa birshidaysada hanis. <verse eid="GEN 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>Shin ushsha kaapoy Yoosefa hassayonna dogi aggis.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Kawa Amuho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Nam7u laythafe guye, Gibxe Kawoy amuho amuhis. He amuhuwan I Nayle Shaafa gaxan eqis. <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>Laapun ordenne modho miizati Nayle Shaafape keyidi, maata mishin be7is. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Entafe kaallidi, hara laapun gilqa miizati Nayle Shaafape keyidi, shaafa gaxan de7iya hara miizata matan eqidosona. <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>He gilqa miizati laapun ordenne modho miizata mittidosona. Hessafe guye, Kawoy barkis.<verse eid="GEN 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>I zaari dhiskidi, hara amuhoka amuhis. Laapun lo77onne muruuta mor7eti issi maqa bolla keyidosona. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Entafe kaallidi, lee7onne doloha bagga carkon shullida hara laapun mor7eti keyidosona. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>He lee7ida mor7eti lo77onne muruuta mor7eta mittidosona. Hessafe guye, Kawoy barkidi amuho gideysa eris. <verse eid="GEN 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Sa7ay wontin dhiskofe I dendiya wode iya wozanay yarkis. Hessa gisho, Gibxen de7iya bitanchotanne eranchota ubbaa kawoy xeegisidi entaw ba amuhuwa odis. Shin iyaw he amuhuwa birshiya asi dhayis.<verse eid="GEN 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Ushsha kaapoy he wode Gibxe kawako, “Taani ta naaquwa hachi hassayayis. <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Issi wode Kawoy ba aylleta hanqetidi, tananne kathaa kaapuwa qasho keethan yeggis. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/>Yan de7ishe nu nam7ati amuho amuhida. He amuhotas dumma dumma birshethay de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>He wode naageysata kaapuwa aylley, Ibraawe panthay, nuura qashon de7ees. Nuuni nu amuhuwa iyaw odin, I nuus huuphen huuphen amuhuwa billis. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>Yaanin, he hanoti I nuus billidaysada hanidosona. Hessi aybe giiko, taani ta shuumatethaako simmas, hankoy kaqetis” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Yaatin, Gibxe Kawoy Yoosefa xeegisis. Enti iya qasho keethafe ellesidi ehidosona. I meedetidi ba ma7uwa laammidi, kawako gelis. <verse eid="GEN 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Kawoy Yoosefa, “Taani amuho amuhas, shin taw issi asika billanaw danda7ibeenna. Taani, ne amuho billanaw danda7eysa si7as” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Yoosefi, “Taani hessa danda7ike, shin Xoossay kawas lo77onne like birshethi immana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Kawoy, “Taani ta amuhora Nayle Shaafa gaxan eqidashin, <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>laapun ordenne modho miizati Nayle Shaafape keyidi, maata moosona. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Entafe kaallidi, hara laapun gilqanne laafida miizati keyidosona. Taani hessa mela gilqa miizi Gibxe biittan ubbaka be7a erike. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>He gilqanne laafida miizati koyro keyida laapun modho miizata mittidosona. <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>Shin enta mittidaape guye kaseysada gilqi uttida gisho, enti mittidaba oonika eranaw danda7ibeenna. Hessafe guye, taani barkas.<verse eid="GEN 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>“Taani ta amuhuwan qassi laapun lo77onne muruuta mor7eti issi maqa bolla keydaysata be7as. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Entafe kaallidi, lee7onne doloha bagga carkuwan shullida hara laapun mor7eti keyidosona. <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>He lee7ida mor7eti laapun lo77o mor7eta midosona. Taani ha amuhuwa bitanchotas odas, shin taw amuhuwa birshiya asi bentibeenna” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Hessafe guye, Yoosefi Gibxe kawako, “kawa amuhota birshethay issino. Xoossay ba oothana haniyaba kawas qoncisis. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>He laapun lo77o miizati laapun laythata, qassi laapun lo77o mor7eti laapun laythata, ha amuhota birshethay issino. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>He laapun gilqanne laafida miizati laapun laythata, qassi doloha bagga carkuwan shullida, lee7o laapun mor7eti laapun kosha laythata.<verse eid="GEN 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>“Taani kawas odidaysadaka, Xoossay ba oothana haniyaba kawa bessis. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>Laapun daro kalo laythati Gibxe biitta ubban yaana. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Shin hessafe guye, laapun kosha laythati kaallidi yaana. He wode Gibxe kaaloy ubbay dogetana, koshi biitta caacana. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Koshay daro iita gidiya gisho he biitta kaaloy dogetidi attana. <verse eid="GEN 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>Nam7u ogiyan kawas he amuhoy bentiday Xoossay ba qopidaba oothanaw qanxida gishosa. Hessa Xoossay mata woden oothana.<verse eid="GEN 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>“Ha7i hiza, neeni eranchonne cinca asi koyada Gibxe biittan shuuma. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Laapun kalo laythan kaxiya kathaafe ichashu kushiyape issuwa shiishana asata shuuma. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>Enti yaa kalo laythan kathaa shiishidi, banta aawatethan kataman kataman minjidi wothana mela kiita. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Biittay koshan dhayona mela ha kathay Gibxe biittan laapun laythan dendana koshas minjetidi de7o” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefi Gibxe Biittan Shuumetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Yaatin he oday Gibxe kawasinne iya moorinnatas lo77o gididi bentis. <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>Hessa gisho, Kawoy entako, “Yoosefape aadhiya hara Xoossa Ayyaanara de7iya asi demmanaw danda7oko” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 41:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Hessafe guye Kawoy Yoosefa, “Xoossay haysa ubba nena erisida gisho, ne mela eranchoynne cinca asi oonika baawa. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/>Taani nena ta biittan shuumas. Ta asa ubbay new kiitetana. Taape hari neepe aadhiya oonika baawa. <verse eid="GEN 41:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Heko, taani nena Gibxe biitta ubba bolla shuumas” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>Hessafe guye, Kawoy ba paramiya migiduwa ba biradhiyafe kessidi, Yoosefa biradhen aathis. Boncho ma7onne qoodhe worqa iya mayzis. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>Kawoy ba nam7antho para gaariya Yoosefa togisis. Boncho wotaadarey, “Ziggite! Ziggite!” yaagishe iyape sinthara hemetees. Hessada oothidi, kawoy iya Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla shuumis.<verse eid="GEN 41:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Hessafe guye Kawoy Yoosefa, “Taani kawo gidikoka ne kiittonna oonika Gibxe biitta ubban ba kushiya woyko ba tohuwa qaaxofo” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Kawoy Yoosefa, “Xafnaat-Pa7ina” gidi sunthis. I iyaw Ona katama kahiniya Phoxfaara na7iw Asnaato macho immis. Yaanin, Yoosefi Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla maata ekis.<verse eid="GEN 41:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Yoosefi Gibxe kawas ooso oykiya wode, iyaw laythi hastama. Yoosefi kawa sinthafe keyidi, Gibxe biitta ubbaa giddon hemetis. <verse eid="GEN 41:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>He laapun kalo laythan biittan daro kathi kaxis. <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Yoosefi Gibxe biittan he laapun kalo laytha katha ubbaa shiishidi, katamatan minjis. Issi issi katama yuushuwan de7iya gadiyape katha ubbaa he katamatan shiishis. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Yoosefi abba shafiya mela daro katha shiishis. Katha darotethaafe dendoysan makanaw danda7etibona gisho, maki maki qoleysa aggaagis.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Kosha laythi yaanape sinthe, Ona katama kahine Phoxfaara na7e Asnaatipe Yoosefi nam7u adde nayta yelis. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Yoosefi ba bayra na7aa sunthaa, “Xoossay tana ta metuwanne ta aawa soo asa ubbaa dogisis” gidi Minaase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:51 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Minaase: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha suntha birshethay “Dogisees” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis. <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>Nam7antho na7aa sunthaaka, “Xoossay ta metootida biittan taw na7a immis” gidi Efreema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:52 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Efreema: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha suntha birshethay “Na7a immees” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis.<verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Gibxe biittan de7iya he laapun kalo laythati aadhidosona. <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>Yoosefi odidaysada laapun kosha laythati kaalli yidosona. Hara biitta ubban koshi keyis, shin Gibxe biitta ubban kathay de7ees. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Gibxe biittay ubbay koshatida wode, asay kathas kawako waassidosona. Kawoy Gibxe asa ubba, “Yoosefako bidi, I odeysa oothite” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 41:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Koshay Gibxe biitta ubba gakida wode, Yoosefi katha minjida shaaleta ubba dooydi, kathi Gibxe asaas bayzis. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Biitta ubban koshi suullida gisho, sa7an de7iya asa ubbay kathi Yoosefape shammanaw Gibxe yidosona.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefa Ishati Gibxe Biittan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Yayqoobi Gibxen kathi de7eysa si7ida wode ba adde nayta, “Hinte issoy issuwa ayis xeelleetii? <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>Gibxen kathi de7eysa taani si7as; yaa bidi, nuuni hayqonna mela guutha kathi shammite” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Yaatin, Yoosefa ishati tammati kathi shammanaw Gibxe bidosona. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Shin Yayqoobi I qohetana gidi hirgida gisho Yoosefa isha Biniyaame iya ishatara yeddibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Kanaane biittan wolqaama koshi de7iya gisho, kathi shammanaw beysatara Isra7eele adde nayti Gibxe gelidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>He wode Yoosefi he biitta aysiya gisho biittan de7iya asa ubbaas kathi bayzees. Hessa gisho, Yoosefa ishati yaa gakida wode banta som7uwa sa7a gathidi iyaw ziggidosona. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Yoosefi ba ishata be7ida melaka eri aggis. Shin I enta eronna asada hanidi; entako, “Hinte awupe yideti?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Enti, “Kathi shammanaw, Kanaane biittafe yida” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Yoosefi ba ishata eris, shin enti iya eribookona. <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Yoosefi entaba amuhida ba amuhuwa akeekidi entako, “Hinte wochanaw yida asi, hinte nu biittan naagoy lepiya baggay awuneko be7anaw yideta” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>Enti, “Akay, nu godaw, nuuni wochanaw yida asi gidoko. Nuuni ne aylleti kathi shammanaw yida. <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>Nuuni ubbayka issi aawa nayta. Nuuni ne aylleti ammanetiya asi” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>Yoosefi entako, “Akay, hinte nu biittan naagoy lepiya baggay awuneko be7anaw yideta” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>Shin enti, “Nuuni ne aylleti Kanaane biittan de7iya issi ura nayta; nuuni tammanne nam7u ishanta. Wursetha kaaloy ha7i nu aawara son de7ees, issoy hayqis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Yoosefi entako, “Taani hintew odidaysada hinte biitta wocheyisata. <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>Hinte paacetanaysi haysana; tuma Kawoy hayqo, hinte wursetha kaalo ishay haysa yoona ixiko, hinte ha bessaafe beeketa. <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Hinte odeysi tuma gideysa paacanaw, hintefe issuwa kiittite. I hinte isha ekidi yo, attidaysati qasho keethan gam7eeta. Hessi hanona ixiko, Kawoy hayqo, hinte biitta wocheyisata” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>Entana heedzu gallas qasho keethan qachis.<verse eid="GEN 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Heedzantho gallasan Yoosefi entako, “Taani Xoosse yayiya asi. Yaaniya gisho, hinte issiba oothiko hinte shempuwa ashshana. <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>Hinte tumaka ammanetiya ase gidiko, hinte ishatape issoy haysan qasho keethan de7o; attidaysati koshatiya hinte soo asaas kathi efite; <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>Shin hinte wursetha ishaa taako ehiko, hinte qaalay tumatana; hinteka hayqonna attana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:20">Entika iya oda ero gidi ekidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>Enti issoy issuwako, “Tuma nuuni nu ishas oothidabay nuna kaa7ees. I ba shempuwas watwatidi woossiya wode nuuni si7ishe ixida. Hessa gisho, ha waayey nuna gakis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Robeeli, “Taani hintena, na7aa bolla nagara oothopite gada odas, Shin hinte si7onna ixideta. Ha7i iya suuthay nuna achees” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>Yoosefi entara turjumaanen odetiya gisho enti giyaba I ereysa enti akeekibokona; <verse eid="GEN 42:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>I entafe haraso bidi yeekis. Shin zaari entako yidi, entaw gujidika odis. I Simoona enta giddofe kessidi enti be7ishin qachis.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefa Ishati Kanaane Simuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>Yoosefi ba aylleta, “Katha enta ogoruwan kunthite; enta miishiyaka zaaridi, enta ogoruwan ogoruwan yeggite. Entaw oges shinqeka immite” yaagidi kiittis. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>Enti I gidaysada oothidaape guye, Yoosefa ishati katha banta hareta bolla caanidi bidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>Enti qamma aqiya bessan entafe issoy ba hariyas kathaafe yegganaw ba ogoruwa billidi, he ogoruwa doonan de7iya ba miishiya demmis. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>I ba ishatako, “Ta miishey taw simmis; tuma haysa be7ite; Ta ogoruwan de7ees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Enti dagammidi kokorishe, issoy issuwako simmidi, “Xoossay nu bolla oothidabay haysi aybee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>Enti Kanaane biittan de7iya banta aawa Yayqoobako yidi, bantana gakidaba ubbaa iyaw odidosona. <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>Enti iyako, “He biitta haariya uray, nuna he biitta wochiya asada oothidi nu bolla yilotidi odetis. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Shin nuuni iyako, ‘Nuuni ammanetiya asi, biitta wocheyisata gidoko. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Nuuni tammanne nam7u ishanti issi aawa nayta. Issoy hayqis; wursetha kaaloy Kanaane biittan ha7i nu aawara de7ees’ yaagida. <verse eid="GEN 42:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>Yaatin he biitta haariya uray nuna, ‘Hinte ammanetiya ase gideysa taani erana mela hinte ishatape issuwa haysan ta matan aggidi, koshatiya hinte soo asaas kathi ekidi biite. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Hinte biitta wocheyisata gidonna, ammanetiya asi gideysa taani erana mela, hinte wursetha isha taako ekidi yiite. Yaatiko, taani han attida hinte ishaa hintew zaarada immana. Hinteka ha biittan de7idi zal7anaw danda7eeta’ ” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 42:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>Enti banta ogoruwape kathaa qolishe, banta ogoruwan ogoruwan banta miishiya qashuwara uttidaysa demmidosona. Entinne enta aaway he qashuwara de7iya miishiya be7idi yayyidosona. <verse eid="GEN 42:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>Enta aawa Yayqoobi entako, “Hinte tana ta naytape mela ashshideta. Yoosefi baawa, Simooni baawa, ha7i qassi Biniyaame efanaw koyeeta. Ubbabay taw zoko zaaris” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 42:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Hessafe guye Robeeli ba aawako, “Taani Biniyaame new zaarada ehonna ixiko, ta adde nayta nam7aaka wodha. Tana ammanetada iya ta kushen yegga; taani iya zaarada ehana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 42:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Shin Yayqoobi entako, “Ta na7ay hintera beenna; iya ishay hayqin, attiday iya xalaala. Hinte efishin, ogen iitabay iya gakiko, hinte ta cimatetha afuthu muzishe ta hayquwa matayeta” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefa Ishati Nam7antho Gibxen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>Kanaane biittan koshay ha77ika kaseysafe aadhidi wolqaamis. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>Yaanin, enti Gibxefe ehida katha ubba midi ongin, enta aaway, “Qassika Gibxe bidi nuus guutha kathi shammite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Shin Yihudi, “He uray nuna, ‘Hinte ishay hintera yoona ixiko, ta som7uwa zaari be7eketa’ yaagidi minthidi odis. <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>Neeni nu isha nuura yeddiko, nuuni Gibxe bidi new kathi shammana. <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>Shin he uray, ‘Hinte ishay hintera yoona ixiko hinte ta som7uwa zaari be7eketa’ ” yaagida gisho, neeni iya yeddonnaba gidiko nuuni booko.<verse eid="GEN 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Yaatin Isra7eeley, “Hinte, ‘Nuus hara ishi de7ees’ gidi odidi ha metuwa ta bolla ayis ehidetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 43:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>Enti zaaridi, “He uray nubaanne nu soo asaaba minthidi oychis. I nuuko, ‘Hinte aaway paxa de7ii? Hintew hara ishi de7ii?’ yaagidi oychis. Nuuni I oychidaysa iyaw zaarida. I nuna, ‘Hinte isha eki yiite’ gaanaba nu awude erido?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Yihudi ba aawa Isra7eeleko, “Nuuni, neeninne nu nayti koshan hayqanaape na7aa taara yedda, nuuni baana. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/>Na7a ta waasetethan imma; iyabaa tana oycha. Taani iya new saro zaarada ehonna ixiko, ta de7o ubban ne baadethay tana gako. <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Nu gam7onaba gidiyako, hannoode nam7antho yaa simmana shin” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>Enta aaway Isra7eeley, “Hessa gidiko haareysas kushe genthiyaba, ha biittan kaxiyaba ubbaafe lo77oba doorite. Hessika, qibaate, shitto, dumma dumma sawo, eessinne, ocholone hinte ogoruwan yeggidi, ekidi biite. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Hinte ogoruwa doonan simmida miishey baletidaba gidanaw danda7iya gisho, miishiya nam7u kushe oothidi eki biite. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Hinte ishaa ekidi, he uraako ellesidi guye biite. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>I hanko hinte ishaanne Biniyaame hintera yeddana mela Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay he uray hintew qadhetanada ootho. Tana gidiko, ta naytape mela attikoka attas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Hessa gisho, ishanti wolla banta immiyabata, nam7u kushe miishiyanne Biniyaame bantara ekidi bidosona. Enti Gibxe gakidi, Yoosefa sinthe shiiqidosona. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Yoosefi Biniyaame entara be7ida wode ba keetha kaapuwako, “Ha asata ta soo ekada ba. Issi mehe shukada giigisa; enti kathi taara maana” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 43:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Yaatin kaapoy, Yoosefi kiitidaysada he asata iya soo efis. <verse eid="GEN 43:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Enti Yoosefa soo bishe, yayidi, “Enti nuna haysa ehiday koyro nu ogoruwan simmida miishiya gisho gidonna aggenna. Enti nuna qohidi aylletethan haaronnanne nu hareta ekona aggokona” yaagi hirgidosona.<verse eid="GEN 43:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>Hessa gisho, enti Yoosefa soo penge gakidi, keetha kaapuwa odisidosona. <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>“Godaw, nuuni koyro kathi shammanaw haysa yida. <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>Guye simmishe nuuni qamma aqiya bessan ogoruwa billiya wode huuphen huuphen nu miishey paconna nu ogoruwan de7eysa demmida. Heko, nuuni he miishiya guye eki yida. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Ha7i nuuni katha shammanaw hara miishe oyki yida. Nu miishiya nu ogoruwan ooni yeggidaako eroko” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>I zaaridi, “Aykoy baawa, yayofite; hinte Xoossay, hinte aawa Xoossay, hinte ogoruwan hintew miishe immis. Taani hinte ciggida miishiya kumethi ekas” yaagis. Hessafe guye, Simoona entako kessis.<verse eid="GEN 43:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>He uray he asata Yoosefa soo efidi, enta tohuwas haathe ehin, enti meecetidosona. Enta haretasika miyaba yeggis. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>Enti Yoosefara kathi maanaysa si7ida gisho banta immanabata Yoosefas giigisidosona.<verse eid="GEN 43:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Yoosefi ba soo gelida wode enti ehida banta immiyabata iyaw immidi, iya sinthan sa7a gakidi ziggidosona. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>I enta sarotetha oychi simmidi, “Hinte taw odida hinte cimida aaway lo77o de7ii? Ha77ika I paxa de7ii?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 43:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>Enti, “Ee, ne aylley, nu aaway paxa de7ees; I lo77o” yaagidi, hokidi iyaw ziggidosona.<verse eid="GEN 43:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>I ba aaye na7aa Biniyaame be7ida wode entako, “Hinte odida wursetha hinte ishay haysee?” yaagis. Biniyaame, “Ta na7aw, nena Xoossay anjo” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>Yoosefi, iya ishaabay iyaw gompan seellida gisho, ellesidi, qol7a gelidi yan yeekis.<verse eid="GEN 43:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>I ba som7uwa meecetidaape guye keyidi bana minthethidi, kathi aathana mela kiittis.<verse eid="GEN 43:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>Enti Yoosefas dumma, iya ishatas dumma aathidosona. Gibxe asay Ibraawe asatara issife meysi bantana kawushiyaba oothi xeelliya gisho iyara miya Gibxe asatas dumma aathidosona. <verse eid="GEN 43:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Enti Yoosefa sinthan bayray ba bayratethan, kaaloy ba kaalotethan maaran uttidosona. Enti issoy issuwa xeellidi, enta waatidi utisidaako be7idi malaaletidosona. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Yoosefa gaytape entaw qumi gishetees, shin Biniyaames haratape aathidi ichashu kushe immis. Yaanidi, enti Yoosefara midi uyidi ufaytidosona.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="s1">Dhayda Wanca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>Yoosefi ba keetha kaapuwa, “Neeni ha asati tookanaw denda7ida keena enta ogoruwan kathi kuntha. Enta ubbaa miishiya enta ogoruwa doonan doonan yegga. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>Yaatada wursetha kaaluwa ogoruwa doonan ta bira wancaanne I shammanaw ehida miishiya yegga” yaagidi kiittis. I Yoosefi gidaysada oothis.<verse eid="GEN 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Sa7i wontin he asati banta hareta ekidi baanaw dendidosona. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>Enti he katamaape keyidi haaki boonna de7ishin, Yoosefi ba keetha kaapuwako, “Ha asata geedo kaalla. Neeni enta gakida wode entako, ‘Hinte ayis keeha iitan zaaridetii? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Haysi ta goday uyeysanne xuuraba demmiya wanca gideysa ereketii? Ayis kaysotidetii? Haysi hinte oothidabay daro iitaba’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Yaatin I enta geedo kaali gakidi, he gidaysadaka entaw odis. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>Shin enti, “Godaw haysa melaba ayis odetay? Hessa melaba oosoy nuupe ne aylletape haako. <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>Nuuni hari attoshin, nu ogoruwa doonape demmida miishiya Kanaane biittafe guye zaaridi new ehidaysa eraasa. Ne godaa keethaafe nuuni worqa woyko bira waati kaysotanee? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/>Ne aylleta giddon he wancay bentida uray hayqo. Qassi attida nuka nu godaas aylle gidana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>I entako, “Hessa gidiko lo77o, hinte gidaysada hano. Wanca ekida oonika ta aylle gidana; attidaysati saron beeta” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>Hessafe guye, enti ellesidi banta ogoruwa ogoruwa sa7an wothidi billidosona. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>He kaapoy ubbaafe bayra ogoruwape doomidi wursetha kaaluwaysa gakanaw koyidi, he wanca Biniyaame ogoruwape demmis. <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>Hessan enti azzanidi, banta ma7uwa peedhidosona. Banta ogoruwa hareta bolla caanidi, guye katama simmidosona.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Yihudi ba ishatara Yoosefako geliya wode Yoosefi son de7ees; enti iya sinthan sa7an gufannidosona. <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>Yoosefi entako, “Hinte aybi palaba oothidetii? Ta mela asi xuuraba demmanaw danda7eysa hinte ereketiyee?” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Yihudi, “Ta godaas nuuni ay gaanee? Nuuni ay odetiyabay de7ii? Nu xillotetha nuuni waati bessanee? Xoossay ne aylleta naaquwa qoncisis. Hiza nuunika he wancay bentida urayka ta godaas aylle gidida” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Shin Yoosefi, “Hessa melaba oothanaysi taape haako; ta wancay iyape bentida ura xalaali ta aylle gidana. Hanko hinte hinte aawako guye saro simmite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Yihudi iyako shiiqidi “Ta godaw, neeni kawa mela gidikoka taani neera odetanaw nena woossayis. Tana ne aylliya hanqetofa. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/>Neeni ta goday nuna ne aylleta, ‘Hintew aawi woyko ishi de7ii?’ gada oychadasa. <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>Nuunika, ‘Nuus cimida aaway de7ees. I cimatethan yelida kaalo na7ayka de7ees. He na7aa ishay hayqis, ba Aayen issino, iya aaway iya daro dosees’ yaagida.<verse eid="GEN 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>“Neeni nuuko, ‘Taani iya be7ana mela taw ehite’ yaagadasa. <verse eid="GEN 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>Yaatin nuuni, ‘He na7ay ba aawape shaaketanaw danda7enna; shaaketiko iya aaway hayqana’ yaagida. <verse eid="GEN 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>Shin neeni, ‘Hinte kaalo ishay hintera yoona ixiko, ta ayfiya zaari be7eketa’ yaagadasa. <verse eid="GEN 44:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>Nuuni nu aawako simmidi bida wode ne gidaysa iyaw odida.<verse eid="GEN 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/>“Nu aaway, ‘Guye bidi guutha kathi shammite’ yaagin, <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>nuuni iyako, ‘Nu kaalo ishay nuura boonna ixiko, ura ayfiya be7anaw danda7oko. Nu kaalo ishay nuura biyaba gidiko, nuuni yaa baana’ yaagida.<verse eid="GEN 44:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>“Yaatin nu aaway nuna, ‘Ta machiya Raheela taw nam7u adde nayta yelidaysa hinte ereeta. <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>Entafe issoy taape shaaketidi bin, iya do7i moonna aggenna yaagas. Hachi gakanaw taani iya be7abike. <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>Haysa qassi taape hinte shaaki efin, iitabay iya gakiko, hinte tana ta cimatethan afuthu muzishe ta hayquwa matayeta’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 44:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30-31"/>“Hessa gisho, ha77i taani guye ta aawako biya wode Biniyaamey taara baanaw bessees. Ta aaway na7aa shempofe dosiya gisho, na7ay nuura baynaysa be7iko hayqana. Nuuni ne aylleti nu aawa cimatetha afuthan duufo gelsoos. <verse eid="GEN 44:30-31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Taani ne aylley na7aa ta waasetethan ekas. Qassi, ‘Ta aawaw, taani iya new saro zaarada ehonna ixiko ta de7uwa ubban ne baadethay tana gako’ yaagas.<verse eid="GEN 44:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>“Yaaniya gisho, taani ne aylley na7aa gisho aylletada haysan attana na7ay ba ishatara guye simmo. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>Na7ay bayna taani waanada guye ta aawako simmanee? Tana ta aaway seeletana seela bessofo” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefi Bana Qoncisetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>He wode Yoosefi ba aylleta sinthan gencanaw danda7iboona gisho, “Asa ubbaa ta sinthafe kessite” yaagidi waassis. Hessa gisho, Yoosefi ba ishatas bana erisida wode iyara oonika allagi baawa. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/>I ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, Gibxeti iya si7ana gakanaw yeekis; kawa soo asayka he woriya si7idosona.<verse eid="GEN 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Yoosefi ba ishatako, “Taani Yoosefabay. Ta aaway hanno gakanaw paxa de7ii?” yaagidi oychis. Shin iya ishati daro dagammida gisho, iyaw aykoka zaaranaw danda7ibookona.<verse eid="GEN 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Yaanin, Yoosefi ba ishatako, “Taako haa shiiqite” yaagis. Enti iyako shiiqin I enta, “Taani hinte tana Gibxe biitta bayzida hinte ishaa Yoosefa. <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Ha77i hinte tana bayzida gisho, qiirotofitenne hintena baaddofite. Ayis giiko, Xoossay tana hintefe sinthe kiitiday asa shempo ashshanaasa. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Ha biitta koshi gelin haysi nam7antho laythi. Asi goyonna woyko cakonna hara ichashu laythati buroo de7oosona. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/>Shin taani sa7an hinte sheeshanne hintena malaalsiya ogen ashshana mela Xoossay tana hintefe sinthe kiittis. <verse eid="GEN 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>Hessa gisho, tana ha bessa kiittiday Xoossafe attishin, hintena gideketa. I tana Gibxe kawas zoriya aawa, iya aqo ubbaa bolla godanne Gibxe biitta haariya asi oothis.<verse eid="GEN 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>“Ha77i ellesidi guye ta aawako bidi iyako, ne na7ay Yoosefi haysada yaagees giite; ‘Xoossay tana Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla godaa kessis; neeni gam7onna taako haaya. <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>Ne nayta, ne nayta nayta, ne dorsaa, ne deesha, ne mehiyanne new de7iyaba ubbaa ekada haaya; ta matan Geesame biittan de7aasa. <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>Buroo ichashu kosha laythati attidosona. Nena, ne soo asaanne ne mehiya koshi qohonna mela taani nena muzana’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>Qassika Yoosefi entako, “Hinteka, ta ishaa Biniyaameyka, ha hintera odetey tuma tana Yoosefa gideysa hinte ayfiyan be7ideta. <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Taw Gibxe biittan de7iya gita bonchuwanne hinte be7idaba ubbaa ta aawas odite. Ta aawaka ellesidi haa ekidi yiite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>Yoosefara Biniyaamera nam7ay wolu qoomidi yeekidosona <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>Yoosefi yeekishe ba ishata ubbaa yeeris. Hessafe guye, iya ishati iyara odetidosona.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Yoosefa ishata yuussaa worey kawo keethi gakida wode kawoynne iya moorinnati ufaytidosona. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Kawoy Yoosefako, “Neeni ne ishatako yaaga; hinte hareta caanidi, Kanaane biitta simmite. <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>Hinte aawanne hinte soo asa ekidi, guye taako haa yiite. Taani hintew Gibxe biittan ubbaafe lo77iya bessa immiko, he biitta modhuwa hinte kaashana. <verse eid="GEN 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>Qassika, banta nayta, banta machetanne banta aawa ehanaw Gibxefe gita para gaare eki baana mela enta kiita. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Gibxe biittan de7iya ubbaafe aadhidi lo77iyabay entassa gidiya gisho, banta aggidi yaa aquwas qoponna mela entaw oda” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Yaatin Isra7eele adde nayti kawoy gidaysada oothidosona. Yoosefi Kawoy kiitidaysada gita para gaaretanne oges shinqeka entaw immis. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>Enta ubbaas huuphen huuphen ooratha ma7o immis. Shin Biniyaames tammanne usupun kilo giraame deexiya biranne ichashu kumetha ma7o immis. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>I ba aawas Gibxen de7iyabaape lo77iyaba ubbaa tammu adde haren caanidi, qassi oges kathi, uythinne hara kathi tammu macca haretan caanidi yeddis. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Yaatidi, Yoosefi ba ishata moyzishe, entako, “Ogiyan bishe ooyetofite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>Enti Gibxefe dendidi, Kanaane biittan de7iya banta aawa Yayqoobako simmidosona. <verse eid="GEN 45:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>Enti Yayqoobako, “Yoosefi paxa de7ees. I hessafe aadhidi Gibxe biitta ubbaa haarees” yaagidosona. Yayqoobi dagammidi, wozana dhayda gisho, enti giyaba ammanibena. <verse eid="GEN 45:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Shin enti Yoosefi entaw odidaba ubbaa iyaw odin, qassika iya eki yaana mela I yeddida gita para gaareta I be7in iyaw shempoy simmis. <verse eid="GEN 45:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Isra7eeley, “Hiza ta ammanetas. Ta na7aa Yoosefi hanno gakanaw paxa de7ees. Ta hayqanaape sinthe bada iya be7ana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Gibxe Buussaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Isra7eeley baw de7iyaba ubbaa ekidi, Barsaabe gakida wode ba aawa Yisaaqa Xoossas yarsho yarshis. <verse eid="GEN 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Xoossay qamma Isra7eeles qoncidi, “Yayqooba, Yayqooba” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Ika, “Heko, abe Godaw” gidi koyis.<verse eid="GEN 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Xoossay iyako, “Taani Xoossaa, ne aawa Xoossa; neeni Gibxe baanaw babofa. Ta ne sheesha yan gita dere kessana. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/>Taani neera issife Gibxe baana; taani ne sheesha yaape kessada haa ehana. Ne hayqiya wode Yoosefi ne ayfiya oykana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobi Barsaabepe dendis. Isra7eele adde nayti banta aawa Yayqooba, banta naytanne banta macheta Gibxe Kawoy entaw yeddida gita para gaare bolla uttisidi efidosona. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>Enti Kanaane biittan haarida haaruwanne mehe ubbaa eki bidosona. Yayqoobi ba soo asa ubbaa ekidi Gibxe bis. <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>I ba soo asa ubbaa; adde naytanne ba adde nayta nayta, ba macca naytanne ba macca nayta nayta, ubbaa baara ekidi Gibxe bis.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>Isra7eelera Gibxe biitta bida iya nayta sunthay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:8">Yayqooba bayra na7ay Robeela; <verse eid="GEN 46:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>Robeela adde nayti Hanooka, Pala, Hesiroonanne Karma. <verse eid="GEN 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>Simoona adde nayti Yamu7eela, Yamina, Ohada, Yakina, Xohaaranne Kanaane maccaseepe yelida Saa7ula. <verse eid="GEN 46:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>Leewe adde nayti Gedisoona, Qahatanne Meraara. <verse eid="GEN 46:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Yihuda adde nayti Era, Onaana, Seela, Paaresanne Zaara. Shin Erinne Onani Kanaane biittan hayqidosona. Paaresa adde nayti Hesiroonanne Hamuula. <verse eid="GEN 46:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Yisakoora adde nayti Tola, Puu7a, Yoobanne Shimroona. <verse eid="GEN 46:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Zabloona adde nayti Sareda, Eloonanne Yahilaala. <verse eid="GEN 46:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Ha adde naytinne macca na7iya Diina, Liya Masephexoome biittan Yayqoobas yelidaysata. Diina gujin iya naytinne nayta nayti kumethi hastamanne heedza.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>Gaade adde nayti Xafoona, Hagge, Shuuna, Exiboona, Eri, Aroodanne Ar7eela. <verse eid="GEN 46:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Aseera adde nayti Yimina, Yesuwa, Yisiwanne Beri7a. Enta michiya Saraho. Beri7a adde nayti Hebeeranne Malki7eela. <verse eid="GEN 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Haysati Laabi ba na7e Liyas immida Zalafa Yayqoobas yelida nayta. Enti kumethi tammanne usupuna.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Yayqooba mache Raheeli adde nayti Yoosefanne Biniyaame. <verse eid="GEN 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Ona katama kahine Phoxfaara na7iya Asnaata Yoosefas Gibxen Minaasenne Efreema yelasu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>Biniyaame nayti Beella, Bekera, Asbeela, Geera, Naamane, Eha, Orosha, Mufima, Hufimanne Arada. <verse eid="GEN 46:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Haysati Yayqoobas yeletida Raheeli adde nayta. Enti kumethi tammanne oydda.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Daane adde na7ay Hushima. <verse eid="GEN 46:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Niftaaleme adde nayti Yahixeela, Guna, Yexeranne Shileme. <verse eid="GEN 46:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Haysati laapunati Laabi ba na7e Raheelis immida Baali Yayqoobas yelida naytanne nayta nayta.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>Yayqoobara Gibxe bida, iya gulbatape keyida nayti, iya nayta macheta gujonna usupun tammanne usupuna. <verse eid="GEN 46:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Gibxen Yoosefas yeletida nam7u nayta gujiko, Gibxe bida Yayqooba soo asay kumethi laapun tamma.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Geesame biittan bantana mokana mela Yayqoobi Yihuda baape sinthe Yoosefako kiittis. Enti yaa gakiya wode, <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Yoosefi ba para gaariya giigisidi, ba aawa Isra7eelera gahetanaw Geesame bis. Yoosefi ba aawa demmida mela iya qoodhiyan xaaxetidi daro wode yeekis.<verse eid="GEN 46:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Isra7eeley Yoosefako, “Neeni paxa de7ishin, taani ne ayfiya be7ida gisho, hiza taani hayqikoka aykoy baawa” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 46:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Hessafe guye, Yoosefi ba ishatanne ba aawa soo asatako, “Taani Gibxe kawako bada iyako, ‘Kanaane biittan de7iya ta ishatinne ta aawa soo asay taako yidosona. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Enti mehe haareyisata, enti bantara banta dorsa, banta deesha, mehiyanne bantaw de7iyaba ubbaa ekidi yidosona’ yaagana. <verse eid="GEN 46:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>Kawoy hintena xeegisidi, ‘Hinte oosoy aybee?’ gidi oychiko, <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>hinte iyako, ‘Nuuni ne aylleti na7atethafe doomidi nu aawatada mehe heemmoos’ yaagite. Dorse haariya asi Gibxe asan kadhetidaba gidiya gisho, I hinte Geesame biittan daana mela oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1-2"/>Yoosefi ba ishatape ichashata dooridi Gibxe kawako gelidi haysada yaagis; “Ta aawaynne ta ishati, banta dorsa, banta deesha, banta mehiyanne bantaw de7iyaba ubbaa ekidi Kanaane biittafe yidi, ha7i Geesamen de7oosona” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 47:1-2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Kawoy he ishatako, “Hinte oosoy aybee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Enti kawako, “Nuuni ne aylleti nu aawatada dorse haariya asata” yaagidi zaaridosona. <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>Qassika enti iyako, “Kanaane biittan koshi keyida gishonne nu mehiyas miyabay dhayda gisho, nuuni haysan daanaw yida. Hayyana, nuna ne aylleta Geesame biittan de7o garki” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Kawoy Yoosefako, “Ne aawaynne ne ishati neeko yidosona. <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>Hiza Gibxe biittay ne kushena. Ha biittan ubbaafe aadhidi lo77iya bessan ne aawanne ne ishata wotha; enti Geesame biittan de7ona. Enta giddofe dumma qaratethi de7eysati de7iko, hessata ta mehiya bolla shuuma” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Hessafe guye, Yoosefi ba aawa Yayqooba gelsidi, kawa sinthe aathis. Yayqoobi Gibxe kawa anjidaape guye, <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>Kawoy Yayqooba, “New aapun laythee?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Yayqoobi kawako, “Taani daabursan de7ida laythay xeetanne hastama. Ta laythay beni ta aawati daabursan de7ida laythafe guuthanne metoy darida laythi” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobi kawa anjidi, iya sinthafe kare keyis.<verse eid="GEN 47:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Yoosefi kawoy kiitidaysada ba aawanne ba ishata Gibxe biittan Ramse katama matan de7iya ubbaafe aadhida arada biittan enta wothis. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>Yoosefi ba aawas, ba ishatasinne baara de7iya ubbaas enta nayta taybuwada kathi immis.<verse eid="GEN 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Koshaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Biitta ubban koshi suullida gisho biittan ubban kathi baawa; Gibxeynne Kanaane biittay qohetidosona. <verse eid="GEN 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>Yoosefi Gibxe katha bayzidi, Gibxeninne Kanaane biittatan de7iya miishiya ubbaa shiishidi Gibxe kawa keetha gelsis. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Gibxe miisheynne Kanaane miishey wurida wode Gibxe asa ubbay Yoosefako yidi “Nuus kathi imma. Nu miishey wurida gisho nuuni ne sinthan ayis koshan hayqanee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 47:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Yoosefi entako, “Hinte mehiya eki yiite. Hinte miishey wuridaba gidiko, taani katha hinte mehiyara laammana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>Hessa gisho, enti banta mehiya Yoosefas ehidosona. Yoosefi enta para, dorsa, deesha, miizanne hariya kathara laammis. I he laythi enta mehiya ubbara kathaa laammidi, enta muzidi shaachis.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>Enti kaalliya laythan iyako yidi “Nuuni nu godaape qosiyabay baawa; nu miishey ubbay wuris. Nu mehiyaka new immi diggida. Nu bollafenne nu gadiyape attishin, nu godaas immanabay harabay baawa. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Nuuni ne be7ishin ayis koshan hayqanee? Nu gadeyka ayis dhayii? Nunaka nu gadiyaka shammada nuus kathi imma. Nuuni kawas aylletana, nu gadeyka iyabaa gido. Nuuni hayqonna attana mela nu gadeyka oxonna mela zerethi nuus imma” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Yoosefi Gibxe biitta ubbaa kawas shammis. Koshi suullin, Gibxe asay un7etidi banta gadiya bayzin gadey kawuwaba gidis. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>Yoosefi asa ubbaa Gibxes ha gaxape hini gaxa gakanaw kawas aylle oothis. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>Shin kawoy kahinetas kathi immiya gisho Yoosefi enta gadiya shammibeenna. Hessa gisho, banta gadiya bayzibokona.<verse eid="GEN 47:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Yoosefi asaako, “Hiza hachi taani hintenanne hinte gadiya kawas shammida gisho, zerethi efidi hinte gaden zerite. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Shin kathaa shiishiya wode ayfidabape ichashu kushiyape issi kushiya kawas immite. Attida oyddu kushey hinte gadiyas zerethi, hintewunne hinte soo asaas kathi gido” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 47:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>Enti, “Neeni nuna ashshadasa. Nu godaa sinthan nuuni sabetiko, nuuni kawas aylletana” yaagidosona. <verse eid="GEN 47:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Hessa gisho, Yoosefi Gibxe biittan ayfidabape ichashu kushiyape issuwa kawas immeysa higge kessis. He wogayka hachi gakana eqidi de7ees. Kahineta gadiyape attishin, hari ubbay kawuwaba gidis.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Isra7eeleti Gibxe biittan Geesame giya bessan de7idosona. Enti yan duretidosona; yeleti daridosona.<verse eid="GEN 47:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Yayqoobi Gibxe biittan tammanne laapun laythi de7is. Yayqoobi de7ida laythay xeetanne oytamanne laapuna. <verse eid="GEN 47:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Isra7eeles hayqiya wodey matatin, ba na7aa Yoosefa xeegisidi haysada yaagis; “Taani ne sinthan sabetidaba gidiko, ne kushiya ta shempuwa bolla wotha. Neeni taw mishetiyaba gidiko tana Gibxen moogike gada taw caaqa. <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>Shin taani hayqiya wode tana Gibxefe efada, ta mayzati moogetidasuwan mooga” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yoosefi, “Taani, nena ne gidaysada oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 47:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Yayqoobi iyako, “Ane taw caaqa” yaagis. Yoosefi iyaw caaqis. Hessafe guye, Isra7eeley ba guufiya bolla katidi Xoossaa goyinnis.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="s1">Minaasenne Efreema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Hessafe guye asay, “Ne aaway saketees” yaagidi Yoosefas odidosona. I ba nam7u adde nayta Minaasenne Efreema ekidi ba aawa be7anaw bis. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>Yayqoobi, iya na7ay Yoosefi yidaysa si7ida wode, Isra7eeley bana minthethidi hiixan uttis.<verse eid="GEN 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Yayqoobi Yoosefa, “Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay Kanaane biittan Looza kataman taw qoncidi, tana anjis. <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>I tana, ‘Taani ne yeletetha darsana, nena daro dere oothana. Ha biitta taani neepe guye, ne sheeshas merina laata oothada immana’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>“Hiza, ne nam7u adde nayti, taani neeko haa yaanape sinthe Gibxen new yeletidaysati tabaa. Efreemeynne Minaasey taw Robeela melanne Simoona mela. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>Entafe guye yeletanaysati nebaa gido. Enti laattana biittay Efreema sunthaninne Minaase sunthan gido. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>Taani Masephexoomepe simmishin, Efraata gakanaw guuthi attishin, Raheela Kanaane biittan hayqasu. Taani iyo Beeteleme geetetiya Efraata efiya ogiya gaxan moogas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Isra7eeley Yoosefa adde nayta nam7ata be7ida wode, “Haysati oonantee?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="GEN 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Yoosefi ba aawako, “Haysati Xoossay taw ha biittan immida nayta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Yaatin Isra7eeley, “Taani enta anjana mela, enta taako haa shiisha” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Isra7eeley cimin iya ayfey ixida gisho, xeellanaw danda7enna. Hessa gisho, Yoosefi ba adde nayta iyako shiishin, Yayqoobi enta idimmidi yeeris. <verse eid="GEN 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Isra7eeley Yoosefa, “Taani ne ayfiya be7ana gada qopabike, shin Xoossay heko ne naytaka tana bessis” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Yoosefi ba nayta Yayqooba gulbatape denthidi, ba som7uwa sa7a gathidi ziggis.<verse eid="GEN 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Yoosefi ba nam7u adde nayta, Efreema Isra7eeles haddirsa baggara, Minaase Isra7eeles ushacha baggara essis. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Isra7eeley ba kushiya barbaxidi Efreemi kaalo gidikoka, ba ushacha kushiya huuphen wothis. Minaasey bayra gidikoka, Isra7eeley ba haddirsa kushiya Minaase huuphen wothis.<verse eid="GEN 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobi Yoosefa haysada yaagidi anjis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Ta aawati Abrahaameynne Yisaaqi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">iya sinthan de7ida Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">ta de7o ubban hachi gakanaw tana heemmida Xoossay nena anjo.<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>Iitaba ubbaafe tana ashshida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">iya kiitanchoy, ha nayta naago.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Ta sunthaynne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">ta aawata Abrahaame Yisaaqa sunthay entan xeegeto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Enti sa7a bolla daro”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">yaagidi anjis.<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Yoosefi ba aaway ba ushacha kushiya Efreema huuphen wothidaysa be7ida wode dosibeenna. Hessa gisho, Efreema huuphiyape denthidi, Minaase huuphen wothanaw ba aawa kushiya oykis. <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Yoosefi, “Ta aawaw, hessa gidenna. Bayray haysa ne ushacha kushiya iya bolla wotha” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>Shin iya aaway ixidi, “Ta erayis, ta na7aw, ta erayis. Minaaseyka gita dere gidana, shin iya kaalo ishay iyape aadhidi gitatana. Iya sheeshayka daro gita kawotetha gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>I he gallas enta anjishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:20">“Isra7eeleti anjo anjiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">‘Xoossay hintena Efreemadanne Minaaseda ootho’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">yaagidi hinte sunthan anjana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Yaatidi Efreema Minaasepe sinthayis.<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Hessafe guye, Isra7eeley Yoosefa, “Taani hayqanaw matas, shin Xoossay hintera de7ees. I hinte aawata biitta hintena guye zaarana. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>Taani Amooretape ta mashshaninne ta dongen ekida biitta, ne ishatara ne shaaketada ekiya biitta bolla new gujada immas” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="s1">Yayqoobi Ba Nayta anjuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobi ba adde nayta xeegidi, “Sinthafe hananaba taani hintew odana mela ha shiiqite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>“Hinteno Yayqooba nayto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">issife shiiqidi si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">hinte aaway Isra7eeley odeysa hayzite.<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>“Robeela, ta bayra na7aw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">neeni ta wolqaa; ta minotethas koyruwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">neeni bonchonka wolqanka ubbaafe aadhasa.<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>Neeni haatha mela, eqidason de7aka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">ne ishata bolla bayratethi new bessena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">Neeni ne aawa hiixan keyadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">ne aawa arsa tunisadasa.<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>“Simooninne Leewey ishata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">enti banta mashsha makallatethas denthoosona.<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>Enti banta hanquwan adde wodhidosona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">banta amuwa kunthanaw boorata gaadiya qanxidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Yaaniya gisho, taani enta zoretan gelike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">enta shiiquwanka uttike.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>Enta wolqaama hanqoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">enta wozanaa iitatethay baadetidaba gido.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Taani, enta Yayqooba asa giddon laallana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Isra7eele biittan dharcana.<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>“Yihuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yihuda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yihuda guussay Ibraawetho doonan galata guussu.</char></note> ne ishati nena galatana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">Ne kushey ne morketa qoodhe oykana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">Ne aawa nayti new hokidi ziggana.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Yihudaa, neeni wodala gaammo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">Ta na7aw, neeni shankafe wodhi simmidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">cogotidi zin7ida gaammo mela.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">Nena bochanaw danda7ey baawa.<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>Merinaw haareysi yaana gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">kawotetha xam7ay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">Yihuda kushepe keyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">kawotethati iyaw kiitetana.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>I ba hariya woyne bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">ba hare mara dooretida woyne bolla qachana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">I ba ma7uwa suuthi daaniya woyne ushshan meeccana.<verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>Iya ayfey woyne ushshafe aadhidi dulkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">iya achay xaamatape aadhidi booxana.<verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>“Zabloni abba doonan daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">I abba doonan markabeti eqiya bessi gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">iya zaway Sidoona gakana.<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>“Yisakoori mino hare mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">caanata giddon zin7ees.<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>Shin I ba shempiya bessay lo77o gideysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ba biittay ufayseysa gideysa be7iya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">caana tookanaw ba hashiya ziqi oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">aylletetha ooso oothana.<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>“Daaney<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Daane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daane guussay Ibraawetho doonan Pirda guussu.</char></note> Isra7eele zerethafe issuwa gidiya ba asa bolla pirdana.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>Daaney oge gaxan de7iya shoosha mela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">Para shuquliya dukidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">para toggidaysa guye yeggiya gope mela.<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>“Abeeti Godaw, taani ne ashuwa naagayis.<verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>“Gaade, bonqeysati qohana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">shin I enta geedo kaallidi oykana.<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>“Aseera biittay orde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">I kawotas lo77o kathi immana.<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>“Niftaalemey qashetonna yeda de7iya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">lo77o marata yeliya gen7e mela.<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>“Yoosefi haatha matan toketidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">dere bolla zaa7ida, ayfey kumida woyne mela.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Dongen dukeysati iya bolla dendana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">banta dongiyan dukishe iya gooddana.<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>Shin Yayqooba Xoossa wolqan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">Isra7eele henthanchuwa naaguwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">iya dongey mino, iya qesey xaala gidana.<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>Ne aawa Xoossay nena maaddana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Bolla salo anjuwan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Garsa ciimmuwa anjuwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">mehenka yelonka nena anjana.<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>Ne aawa anjoy benipe minnidi de7iya zumata anjuwafeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">merinaw de7iya deretape bentiya ufaysiya anjuwafeka aadhees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Haysi ubbay Yoosefa huuphen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">ba ishata giddon kaapo gideysa liiphen shempo.<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>“Biniyaamey bonqiya suudhume;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">ba olidaaba wonta mees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">ba di77idabaa omarsi shaakees” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Haysati tammanne nam7u Isra7eele sheeshata. Enta aaway enta huuphen huuphen entaw bessiya anjuwa anjishe entako gidabay haysa.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayqooba Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Hessafe guye, I enta haysada yaagidi kiittis; “Taani ta mayzatan gahetana hanayis. Tana Hite addiya Efroona gaden de7iya gongoluwan ta aawata matan moogite. <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>Hessika, Kanaane biittan, Maammire matan de7iya, Makifeelan de7iya gongoluwa. He gongoloy Abrahaamey moogoos Hite addiya Efroonape iya gadiyara shammida duufuwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>Abrahaameynne iya machiya Saara, Yisaaqinne iya machiya Irbiqa yan moogetidosona. Taani qassi Liyaka yan moogas. <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>He gadeynne iyan de7iya gongoloy Hitetape shametidaysa. Tana yan moogite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 49:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Yayqoobi, ba nayta kiitaa ongidaape guye ba tohuwa ba hiixan shiishi ekidi, ba mayzatan gahetis.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Yoosefi ba aawa aha bolla kundidi, yeerishe iyaw yeekis. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Hessafe guye, Yoosefi dhale shiishiya ba oosanchota, ba aawa Isra7eele aha shitto tiyidi melisana mela kiittis. Enti tiyidi melisidosona. <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>Shitto tishsha wogay oytamu gallas kumethi ekees. Gibxe asati iyaw laapun tammu gallas yeekidosona.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Yeeho gallasati aadhida wode, Yoosefi Gibxe kawa oosanchota, “Taani hinte sinthan saba demmidaba gidiko, taw kawas haysada yaagidi odite. <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/>‘Ta aaway tana issi caaqo caaqisis. Taani hayqanaw matas. Taani ta huuphen Kanaane biittan bookida gongolo duufuwan tana mooga’ yaagis. Hessa gisho, ‘Ha7i taani yaa bada ta aawa moogada simmana mela tana yeddarki’ yaagite” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Yaatin Kawoy, “I nena caaqisidaysada bada ne aawa mooga” yaagis.<verse eid="GEN 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Yaatin Yoosefi ba aawa mooganaw bis. Kawa moorinnati ubbay, kawa keethaninne Gibxen de7iya gita asati ubbay Yoosefa kaallidi bidosona. <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>Yoosefa soo asa ubbay, iya ishatinne iya aawa soo asati Yoosefara bidosona. Enta yooga nayti, enta dorsati, enta deeshatinne enta miiza wudiya xalaali Geesamen attis. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>Para gaaretinne togati iyara bidosona. Iya kaallidi bida asay daro.<verse eid="GEN 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>Enti Yordaanose Shaafa matan de7iya Axaade geetetiya wudumma gakidi, banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, zeleelidi yeekidosona. Yan Yoosefi ba aawa yeehuwan laapun gallas uttis. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>He biittan de7iya Kanaane asati Axaade wudumman he yeehuwa be7ida wode, “Gibxeti aybi yibbata yeeho yeekona?” yaagidosona. Hessa gisho, Yordaanose matan de7iya he bessay Abeel-Mixraama (Gibxeta Yeeho) geetetis.<verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Yayqooba nayti enta aaway enta kiitidaysada oothidosona. <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>Enti iya aha Kanaane biitta efidi, Mamirepe ushacha baggan de7iya Makifeela gongoluwan moogidosona. Hessika, Abrahaamey Hite addiya Efroonape moogoos shammida gadiya. <verse eid="GEN 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>Yoosefi ba aawa moogidaape guye, ba ishataranne iya aawa mooganaw iyara bida hara asata ubbatara Gibxe simmis.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Banta aaway hayqidaape guye, Yoosefa ishati banta giddon, “Nuuni iyaw oothida iitaba ubbaas Yoosefi nuna ba ulon morkidi halo keyanaw koyiko nuuni waananee?” yaagidosona. <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Hessa gisho, Yoosefako yaagidi kiita kiittidosona; “Ne aaway hayqanaape sinthe nuuko, <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>‘Neeni, ne ishata nagaraanne enta iita naaquwa hayyana atto yaaga yaagis gidi odite’ yaagis. Hessa gisho, ha7i hayyana, nu nagara, ne aawa Xoossa aylleta naaquwa atto yaaga” yaagidosona. Yoosefi hessa si7idi yeekis.<verse eid="GEN 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>Hessafe guye, iya ishati banta huuphen iyako yidi, iya sinthan gufannidi, “Nuuni, ne aylleta” yaagidosona.<verse eid="GEN 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Shin Yoosefi entako, “Babofite, Tana hintew Xoossa gidetiyee? <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Hinte taw iita oothideta, shin ha7i daro asay hayqonna attana mela Xoossay haysa lo77otethas oothis. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Hessa gisho, hiza babofite. Taani hintenanne hinte nayta muzana” yaagidi, enta minthethidi lo77o qaala hassayis.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefa Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Yoosefi, iyaw laythi xeetanne tamma gidana gakanaw ba aawa soo asaara Gibxen de7is. <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>Efreema naytanne, enta nayta nayta be7is. Qassi Minaase na7aa Makira nayta, ba nayta oothis.<verse eid="GEN 50:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Hessafe guye Yoosefi ba ishata, “Taani hayqanaw matas, shin Xoossay hintena maaddanaw xomoosana. I hintena ha biittafe kessidi, Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas immana gidi caaqida biitta efana” yaagis. <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Yoosefi Isra7eele nayta, “Xoossay hintena maaddanaw xomoosiya wode, hinte ta meqetha ha biittafe ekidi biite” yaagidi caaqisis.<verse eid="GEN 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Yoosefi xeetanne tammu laythi de7idi hayqin, shittuwan iya aha tiyidi melisidaape guye, Gibxe biittan saaxinen wothidosona.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
